<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">EZEPOK.SFK 15-08-08 lina Quej X. Pocomchi. Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">EZEQUIEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ez</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ez</para>
  <para style="toc1">EZEQUIEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I EZEQUIEL</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZEQUIEL</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' noq xk'uhtjik cho reh parusaq wiriik i ruloq'il i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin Ezequiel k'amal b'eeh aj tiij, hin rak'uun i Buzi, ar wilkiin chi kixilak i aj Israel xi k'amarik reje Babilonia. Eh ar wilkooj chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. Eh ho'oob' rub'eeh i rukaaj poh reh i lajeeb' ru ka'winaq haab'. Xteh chik i chii' i taxaaj noq xwilow panusaq wiriik. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh pan ho'oob' rub'eeh i poh reh i roo' haab' ruk'amariik reje Babilonia i Joaquín kireey i aj Israel, <verse number="3" style="v" />noq xiruq'o'reej i QaJaaw Dios i hin Ezequiel k'amal b'eeh aj tiij, hin rak'uun i Buzi. Eh ar wilkiin Babilonia chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. Ar xuyeew chaq'ab' chi nunaah i QaJaaw noq xwik'raaj i rajaawriik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin xwilow panusaq wiriik chi jinaj i kowlaj teew xchalik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij k'ahchi' cho ruk'amam jinaj i nimlaj suutz', eh kotimaj riij chi xaq q'aaq'. Eh panyejaal i q'aaq' re' re' jinaj xan rob'rotik chik xa je' chik rukab' i q'an ch'ihch'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh panyejaal i q'aaq' re' re' kijib' b'ila' chik i k'achaach je' b'ila' chik kiwii' winaq. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chi kiju'junaal taqe re' kajkaj b'ila' i kiwach, eh kajkaj i kixiik'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' wach kich'ehk korik wach, eh re' kixk'aq je' b'ila' rukab' i rixk'aq k'isa imas wakax, xan rob'rotik chik xa je' chik rukab' i ch'ub'ik wach q'an ch'ihch'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chi ri'sil kajchel i kixiik' wilik kijib' kiq'ab', je' q'ab' winaq, kajtarchel wilik wii' i kiwach, eh kajtarchel wo' wilik wii' i kixiik' <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh pan kijib'al inkik'ulaa' wach ikixiik'k'ul inkib'ur kiib' ruuk'. Noq kib'ehik xa jinaj kiooj wii'. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe k'achaach re' re' je' wili kika'yik chi ju'juntar: Re' juntar je' inka'yik winaq, re' juntar je' inka'yik kaq b'ahlam, re' juntar je' inka'yik imas wakax, re' juntar chik je' inka'yik xihk. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chi kiju'junaal kihe'em paam i kixiik', ki'ib' i kixiik' k'ul inkitz'aj reje kiib' ruuk', eh ki'ib' ikixiik' inkib'ur wii' i kiti'jolal. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chi kiju'junaal xa jinaj kiooj wii'. Ar chi korik ojik inki a'n chikiwach, aha' kik'amarik ruum i uxlab'al, ma' kisutinik ta chik chikiij. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i kijib' chi k'achaach wilik i je' aaq'ut qoplik ruq'aq'al, eh je' rukab' i q'aaq' qoplik ju' chee' k'ul inooj chi kixilak. Re' i q'aaq' re' re' xasaqum chik i rub'an, eh i rukut reje i ch'aab' je' ruch'aab' kahoq. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach re' re' xa chi jumehq'iil kichalik kiooj xa je' chik kowiil i rub'an i ruch'aab' i kahoq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh xwilow panusaq wiriik chi re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach wilik wach ak'al pantaq kicheel i ju'jun i kotokaq. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq eliik kiwach, eliik wach kiyejeb'jiik. Eh xan rob'rotik chik i kiwach xa je' chik rukab' i holohik ab'aj Crisolito. Eh chupaam taqe i ju'jun chi kotokaq wilik wo' chik i ju'jun chi kotokaq. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i kotokaq re' re' noq kib'ehik reje chikiwach je' chikiij, je' pantaq kicheel kiooj xa re' la' xama' kisutinik ta wo' hoq. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq re' re' kichopom kiib' panyejaal, eh chi kijunsuut juninaq chi je' naq'wachiis xan saqumanik chik. <verse number="19" style="v" />Noq kiooj reje i k'achaach kiooj wo' taqe kotokaq kuch'ihil reje. Eh noq kiwuktik reje i k'achaach kiwuktik b'ila' wo' reje i kijib' chi kotokaq. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach aha' ink'amarik reje kib'eeh ruum uxlab'al ar wo' kiooj. Eh re' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq kiooj wo' haa' chikiij i taqe k'achaach, ruum re' wo' taqe haa' kuuk'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Noq kib'ehik reje i kijib' chi k'achaach, kib'ehik wo' reje i kijib' chi kotokaq. Eh noq kipa'lojik i k'achaach kipa'lojik wo' hoq i kotokaq. Noq kiwuktik reje i k'achaach kiwuktik wo' reje i kotokaq, ruum re' wo' hoq i kijib' chi k'achaach inye'wik kik'achariik i kotokaq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach wilik i he'lik johtoq chikinaah xan reprotik chik je' rukab' i lemow. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chi ri'sil i he'lik chikinaah kihe'em b'ila' chik i kixiik' i kijib' chi k'achaach. Eh k'ul k'ahchi' kitz'a'am kiib' ruuk' kab'chel i kixiik', eh ruuk' i ki'ib' chik inkib'ur i kiti'jolal i keh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' hin imb'iraj b'ila' chik i choqik i rub'an i kixiik' noq b'ehik inki a'n xa je' chik rukab' i choqik i rub'an i elal ha', je' wo' kowiil inq'orik i QaJaaw nim rajaawriik. Eh je' wo' rukab' i choqik inki a'n i ruk'ihaal soldado, eh noq kipahik inkiqaasaj i kixiik'. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh jinaj i kowlaj q'orik x-ib'irjik xb'aan cho chinaah i he'lik chikinaah i kijib' chi k'achaach. <verse number="26" style="v" />Chinaah i he'lik chikinaah re' re' xwilow chi wilik jinaj i loq'laj tzunaab', xa je' yej-amaj ruuk' i holohaq laj ab'aj zafiro. Eh chupaam i loq'laj ye'aab' re' re' jinaj i tzunlik ar je' ruwii' winaq. <verse number="27" style="v" />Xwilow wo' hoq i je' ruwii' winaq, chinaah rutuuq xtihk'ik johtoq, xponik ko wach naah xan reprotik chik xa je' chik rukab' i ch'ub'ik wach ch'ihch' xan reprotik chik wach kotimaj riij chi q'aaq'. Eh chi ri'sil i nah rutuuq xwilow wach i je' q'aaq', xan saqumanik chik i rub'an chi junsuut. <verse number="28" style="v" />Je' rukab' i raxkojl q'atb'al reh i suutz' noq i rub'an i jab'.</para>
  <para style="p">Je' aj wili noq xuk'uhtaaj cho weh i ruloq'il i Dios panusaq wiriik. Eh noq xwilow taqe re' xnupach'aa' qohoq wiib' korehtaal xnureq wach ak'al ruuk' i yejal nuwach.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Ezequiel xsik'arik wach ruum i Dios chi xkahnik chi jalal ruq'oral</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq tipaa' johtoq, re' hin wilik i naa nuq'orom aweh, inki. <verse number="2" style="v" />Noq k'ahchi' chi q'orik wuuk' xokik wuuk' i ruxlab'al chi manlik. Ruum i re' xinpahik johtoq. Re' reh ma' xukanaa' ta nuq'orob'jiik. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq, re' hin naa kaat nutaq'aam reje chi kixilak i aj Israel. Re' i tinamit ma' kinimanik taj ximahkunik chi nuwach, chi re' i kimaam kati't, chi re' keh xa ko xik'uloq wo' ayu' yu'naak. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' keh q'e' kow i kinaah, q'e' kow i kánima, re' hin nak'at nutaq'aam reje chi kixilak, eh naa aq'orom keh i nuk'uhb'aal. <verse number="5" style="v" />Atoob' ta neenkinimaj, atoob' ta ma' neenkinimaj, ruum re' taqe re' ma' kinimanik taj. Xa re' la' neenkinab'eej chi xnutaq'aaj reje jinaj i jalal nuq'oral chi kixilak. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq mat yo'jik chikiwach, maayohb'isaj awiib' ruuk' i neenkiq'or aweh. Atoob' ta neenawik'raaj chi je' xilak k'iix wilkaat kuum, oon chi je' xilak josq'laj tzina'j, atoob' ta xa nee chik inkiyoj aweh i kiwach ruum kijosq'iil. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hat naa aq'orom keh i nuq'oral atoob' ta neenkib'iraj, atoob' ta ma' neenkib'iraj, ruum re' keh ma' kinimanik taj. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq chab'iraj i k'ahchi' nuq'orom aweh, mo'-oq je' akab' taqe i tinamit ma' kinimanik taj. Cha teh aachii' chak'ux i nuyeew aweh, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' hin xwilow panusaq wiriik jinaj i q'ab'iis wilik i koq wuuk' ruchopom i junb'oht chi huuj. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh xuhe' chik wach chi nuwach, k'ul tz'ihb'amaj wach je' chi riij, je' chuwach. Ar tz'ihb'amaj i runimaal ti'kiil k'uxliis, eh i runimaal oq'ik naa ruchaliik chikinaah i aj Israel.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or weh i Dios: Re' hat rak'uun winaq chak'ux i huuj wili tz'ihb'amaj wach. Eh hiy cha q'or i nuq'oral keh i tinamit Israel, inki. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hin xnuteh b'ila' chik i nuchii', eh xuyeew weh chi k'uxarik i huuj tz'ihb'amaj wach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh je' wili xuq'or weh: Chab'iq' i huuj tz'ihb'amaj wach xnuyeew aweh, chanujisaj aapaam ruuk', inki. Re' hin xnub'iq wo' hoq, xa je' chik ki'iil riis kaab' noq xwik'raaj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh i Dios: Hat rak'uun winaq, yu'naak hiy cha q'or keh i tinamit Israel i nuk'uhb'aal. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin ma' chi kixilak taj i tinamit k'axik wach i kiq'oral ma' tankan chi riij inkiq'or k'ahchi' kaat nutaq'aam reje, chi kixilak la' i awuch aj Israel tinutaq'aaj reje. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh ma' re' ta wo' chi kixilak i k'ih ch'uq chi tinamit k'ayeew wach kiq'orik, ma' ta neenkan chi riij inkiq'or k'ahchi' kaat nutaq'aam reje, eh kuuk' ta wo' taqe re' neetinutaq'aaj, re' keh nee naq inkinimaj i nuk'uhb'aal neenaq'or keh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xama' naa ta wo' kaat kib'iram ruum xama' kinkaaj ta wo' kinkib'iram i hin. Ruum chu'nchel i tinamit Israel q'e' kow i kinaah, eh q'e' kow i kánima. <verse number="8" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin naa wo' nuye'em rukowiil ak'ux i hat naa aq'atam wach i rukowiil kik'ux i keh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin xiik' naah aakowiil naa nuye'em, ma' xata je' kowlaj ab'aj ma' xata je' holohik ab'aj diamante. Eh ma' naa tayo'jikkuum atoob' ta neenkiyoj awee kiwach ruum re' keh ma' kinimanik taj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or weh i Dios: Re' hat rak'uun winaq chab'iraj chu'nchel i nuk'uhb'aal naa nuq'orom aweh, eh chamol panawánima. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh hiy chi kixilak aatinamiit Israel re' i xi k'amarik reje pan tokoom tinamit, ar cha q'or keh i nuk'uhb'aal atoob' ta neenkinimaj, atoob' ta ma' neenkinimaj, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' i ruxlab'al i Dios x-uksanik weh, eh chi wiij jinaj i kowlaj q'orik xb'aan chaloq, xa je' chik kowlaj yihk je' wili xuq'or: Xwuktik chaloq paruye'aab' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw, inki. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i choqik re' re', re' b'ila' chik i kixiik' i kijib' chi k'achaach imb'anik re' noq k'ul i ruq'oj riib' i kixiik'. Eh re' i kijib' chi kotokaq b'ehik wo' rub'an haa' kuuk', eh yohb'aal wach i choqik xkian. <verse number="14" style="v" />Xiruk'am b'ila' reje i Ruxlab'al i Dios, re' hin ti' ti' i nuk'ux noq xinooj, eh k'ahchi' i nuk'aah. Eh re' i QaJaaw xakow b'ila' chik xiruchop ruuk' q'ab'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' hin ximponik wo' kuuk' i aj Israel k'amooj taqe reje pan tokoom tinamit patim taqe ar Tel-Abib chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar, wuquub' q'iij xintzuhnik chi kixilak chi sachlik nuk'ux.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i QaJaaw Dios xukoj i Ezequiel chi chajen keh i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 33:1-9">Ez 33.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh paruwuuq q'iij xiruq'o'reej QaJaaw je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq re' hat xnusik' chawach chi naa acha'jeem i nutinamiit Israel. Noq naa ab'iram i nuk'uhb'aal, ruuk' i re' naa akojom kina'ojb'al. <verse number="18" style="v" />Noq naa nuq'orom chi naa rukimiik i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al. Re' hat naa aq'orom reh chi nee rukanaa' rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, chi je' re' neeruko'leej riij i ruk'achariik. Eh wila' re' hat ma' xaq'il chub'aan, korehtaal-oq xkimik chub'aan, re' hat naa kaat nuye'em chutojariik riij i ru mahk. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh raaj wila' re' hat xaq'or reh i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al chi chukanaa' rub'aan, eh wila' ma' xukanaa' rub'aan, xa chi rib'il riib' naa rukimiik ruum i ru mahk, eh re' hat naa ako'leem riij aak'achariik <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i korik wach ruk'ux nee wo' chik i rub'an i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, eh xnuyeew-oq q'ab' i hin chi neeruq'eb' riib' re' re' naa rukanteesjiik. Eh mo'-oq xaq'il chub'aan, korehtaal-oq xkimik parumahk, re' hin ma' naa ta nukojom paruman i holohik rub'anam chaloq. Eh re' hat naa kaat nuye'em chutojariik riij i rukimiik. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh wila' re' hat xaq'or reh i korik wach ruk'ux chi maa rub'an chik i mahk, wila' xunimaj i ruq'ilariik neena a'n ma' naa ta rukimiik. Eh re' hat nee inako'leej riij ak'achariik, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Ezequiel jalal ruq'oral i Dios xkahnik chi meem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' xuyeew i q'ab' chi nunaah i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or weh: Wukteen reje hiy wach k'ixkaab' ar neenuq'or aweh chib'ih i naa a'nam, inki. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin xinooj wo' wach k'ixkaab', ar xwilow wach i runimaal i ruloq'il i Dios, je' rukab' i ruloq'il xwilow cho chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. Re' hin xnupach'aa' wiib' korehtaal rutz'aj wach aak'al i yejal nuwach. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' i rajaawriik i Dios xokik wuuk' xirupab'aa' johtoq. Chi riij i re' je' wili i xuq'or weh i Dios: Yu'naak hiy panapaat neenatz'ap awiib' ar. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq je' naa kaat kib'ak'am ruuk' k'ahaam, ma' naa ta chik kiye'em q'ab' aweh chi naa awihiik chi kixilak i tinamit. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi na naa ruchopom riib' aawaaq' pan ajahaay naa akahniik chi hat meem reh chi ma' naa ta chik a'nam kiq'ilariik i tinamit. Ruum re' keh xama' kinimanik ta wo' hoq. <verse number="27" style="v" />Xa re' la' noq naa kaat nuq'oreem i hin naa wo' chik nuye'em aq'oral. Eh naa aq'orom i nuk'uhb'aal keh i tinamit, awach i naa rajwaam rib'irjiik naa wo' rib'iram, awach i ma' naa ta rajwaam rib'irjiik xama' naa ta wo' rib'iram. Ruum re' i tinamit re' re' xama' kinimanik ta wo' hoq.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Ezequiel xuk'uhtaaj nik' wach noq xchoparik naah i tinamit Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' hat rak'uun winaq, cha chop jino'q i nimlaj xaan neenatz'ihb'aaj chuwach i rehtalil i tinamit Jerusaleem. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh neenatz'ihb'aaj chi junsuut i kehtalil i soldado je' i q'aq'inik inki a'n Eh nee neenatz'ihb'aaj i rehtalil chi kotimaj riij chi tz'aq, neenatz'ihb'aaj rehtalil chi k'otooj jul je' rooq ha' chi junsuut, k'uhtb'al reh chi re' i tinamit kotimaj chik riij. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh neenaperaa' jumpehr-oq i ch'ihch' chawach reh chi je' jinaj koraal tz'aq i neenq'atwik chawach i xatz'ihb'aaj wii' rehtalil i tinamit Jerusaleem. Eh naa ayejaam awiib' chi je' cho naa awokiik chi q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit. Re' re' i rehtalil chi je' re' i naakik'ulum i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Yu'naak naa ayohkiik chinaah i tz'eet k'uhtb'al reh i kimahk i aj Israel. Eh jarub' q'iij naa ayohkiik chinaah aatz'eet ar naa ak'uhtaam chi je' re' najtiil i ti' k'axik naakik'ulum i aj Israel ruum i kimahk. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh lajeeb' chik ma' kijib' siento q'iij naa ayohkiik panatz'eet, eh re' ju'jun q'iij rehtalil i ju'jun haab' chi ti' k'axik naakik'ulum i aj Israel ruum i kimahk. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chi riij i re', ka'winaq q'iij naa ayok'aam awiib' pana sak'aaj, re' ju'jun q'iij rehtalil i ju'jun haab' chi ti' k'axik naakik'ulum i aj Judá ruum i kimahk. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh nee ti' ilwik reje Jerusaleem rehtalil chi naa ruchopariik naah kuum i aj ixowaal neenatol i wach atileb', eh neenaq'or keh i ti' k'axik naakik'ulum. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin je' naa nanuub'ak'am awach chi k'ahaam reh chi ma' k'ul ta chik nee nasutej awiib' korehtaal inakohlaaj ruk'ulariik i ti' k'axik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Yu'naak i hat chamol k'isinoq atrigo, eebada, lentejas, mijo, eh avena, xa jinaj chayeew wii' pan jino'q xun. Ruuk' taqe re' naa ayejaam aakaxlanwi'k re' naa ak'uxum chuwach i lajeeb' chik ma' kijib' siento q'iij noq naa ayohkiik chinaah aatz'eet. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' hat xanaa apajam awa', xa waxiqiib' onse naa ak'uxum chuwach i ju'jun chi q'iij. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh je' wo' hoq ahaa' xanaa wo' apajam xakiib' kulk i naa awuk'em chuwach i ju'jun chi q'iij. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i naa ak'uxum jinaj chi kaxlanwi'k re' ruuk' i Eebada korjinaq wii', eh ruuk' ruq'aq'al rusaa' tinamit naa achaq'sam. Ar naa achaq'sam aha' naa kaat kilom wii' i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Je' aj wili i naa kik'uxum i aj Israel aha' naakik'amariik reje wii' pan tokoom tinamit. Ch'uwa' wach i naa rojiik kik'uxum, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' hin je' wili i xnuq'or reh: QaJaaw Dios, re' hin ma' jank'al ta nutz'aj cho weh i ch'uwa' wach. Eh ma' jank'al taj i nuk'ux weh i chikop xakikimik chi kutkeel, je' wo' taqe chikop xa kikanteesjik kuum i josq'laj chikop, ni xata re' taqe i ch'uwa' wach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' reh je' wili i xuq'or reh: Wila' ma' nawaaj akojom i rusaa' tinamit chi chaq'teesb'al reh aakaxlanwi'k, neenuyeew q'ab' aweh chi ruuk' i rusaa' wakax neenachaq'saj, inki. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq re' hin naa nuye'em i wi'jaleel chikinaah i aj Jerusaleem. Xa naa chik rupajariik i kiwa', eh naa rutib'iik kik'ux. Re' i kihaa' xanaa wo' rupajariik, eh ma' k'isiin ta naa kiyo'jiik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq ma' xta chik i kiwa' kihaa', xak'ul chik naakitz'ehtaam panaq'kiwach, naa kiyo'jiik. Xa re' la' xa ruum wo' i kimahk naa rusahchiik kiwach, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha sik' jino'q i q'aslaj kuchilo, re' ruuk' i johyb'al, ruuk' i re' neenajoy i rismaal aanaah i awisinchii'. Eh oxb'ohr neenawisaj aawismaal noq neenapaj pan pexu. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh jumb'ohr aawismaal neenak'at panyejaal i tinamit noq neenkuxik i q'aq'inik, nee wo' chik nayok' jumb'ohr-oq aawismaal neenakut chi junsuut i tinamit. Eh re' chik i jumb'ohr chi aawismaal neenakut pan taxaaj xa aha' neenk'amarik reje ruum i teew, re' re' rehtalil chi xailook' chik i nuyeew nujosq'iil chikinaah je' rukab' i q'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh naa wo' achopom cho k'isinoq aawismaal reh chi nee natus chi rooq aso'. <verse number="4" style="v" />Chi riij i re' naa wo' chik achopom cho kiib' ixib'-oq chi naq'awach aawismaal neenakut yejal q'aaq' re' re' naruk'atwiik keh chu'nchel i tinamit Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or: Je' aj wili i naa ruk'ulum i tinamit Jerusaleem, ruum re' wo' naq i hin xin ye'wik kajaawriik, chikiwach i kok' tinamit i nimaq tinamit. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' keh ma' xkaaj ta chik kinimam taqe i nuk'uhb'aal, eh ma' xkaaj ta wo' kianam i xnuq'or keh. Xti ma' kinimanik ta wo' chik k'isinoq i keh xkiq'at wo' chik wach i wilkeeb' pankok' tinamit, eh i wilkeeb' pan nimaq tinamit wilik chi kijunsuut.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' hin i Dios je' wili xnuq'or keh: Re' taq i hat xti q'e' wo' chik ma' xat nimanik ta taq ma' xata je' rukab' i xkian tinamit wilkeeb' taq cha junsuut. Ma' xanimaj ta taq i nuk'uhb'aal, eh ma' xanimaj ta wo' taq i k'uhb'aal inkinimaj i tinamit wilkeeb' taq cha junsuut. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ruum i re', re' hin i Dios xchalik nujosq'iil cha naah taq i hat aj Jerusaleem. Naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik aamahk reh chi naakilom i wilkeeb' panimaq tinamit. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum chi ma' nakanaa' ta taq rub'aan ach'uwa' wach na'ojb'al, re' hin naa nuye'em ti' k'axik taq cha naah, re' ruuk' i ma' jank'al ta nuyeew chaloq, eh ma' naa ta wo' chik nuye'em. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chaxilak taq i hat wilik taqe i ajaab'ees naa kik'uxum i kak'uun, eh wilik taqe ak'uunb'ees naa kik'uxum i kajaaw. Naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik amahk, eh re' i konaakikahniik chi k'achalkeeb' naa nutukem reje kiwach xa aha' yuuq'. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' hin i k'achlik Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi naa taq nusacham awach, ma' naa ta nuketelaam taq k'isinoq awach. Ruum xach'uwa'risaj taq paam i nuSantolaj paat ruuk' i kilooq'jiik i tiyoox, ruuk' taq i ayiib' wach ana'ojb'al. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh achk'isiin ma' yejaal taq aatinamiit naa kikimiik ruum yab'ilaal, ruum wi'jaleel, eh re' k'isiin chik ma' yejaal naa kikanteesjiik kuum i aj ixowaal. Eh re' chik i ruqox naa nutukem kiwach xa aha', re' i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em chikinaah, xa je' chik rukab' i q'aslaj ch'ihch'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Korehtaal inwik'saj i nujosq'iil chikinaah, ruuk' i re' naa ruch'iklojiik nuk'ux. Eh noq wik'sam chik i nujosq'iil chikinaah naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i Dios aha' wilik i nuq'or i nub'an wo' hoq. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusacham taq awach, naa taq nuk'uhtaam ak'ixb'ilaal chikiwach i tinamit wilkeeb' taq cha junsuut. Eh re' i naakik'iik ar naakilom taq i naa ak'ulum. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil taq cha naah, tojb'al taq riij aamahk chu'nchel taq naa kikaqse'lanik aweh. Naa taq kaat kib'ajam i wilkeeb' taq cha junsuut, eh naa kiyo'jiik noq naakilom taq i naa ak'ulum. Re' wili re' hin kin q'orik, inki i Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i runimaal wi'jaleel taq cha naah re' i naa rusachwiik taq awach. Korik wo' hoq chi naa nuye'em wi'jaleel taq cha naah, sachb'al ta awach, korehtaal i nukanaa' chi ma' xta chik k'uxumb'al taq aweh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i wi'jaleel, i yab'ilaal taq cha naah. Naa nutaq'aam taqe chaloq i josq'laj chikop, chi sachb'al taq awach, eh naa ta kaat kikanaam chi ma' xta chik taq awak'uun awixq'uun. Eh wilik taq aweh i hat i naa kikimiik panq'aq'inik, inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Ezequiel xuq'or chi mahk i loq'inik xatz'aqoj tiyoox</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq ti tz'ehtanoq reje chikinaah i yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel, cha q'oreej taqe panub'ihnaal. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i neenaq'or keh: Hat taq najt anaah yuuq', hat taq rub'ohl yuuq', hat taq nim ha', i hat taq k'ixkaab', je' wili i ruq'or taq aweh i QaJaaw Dios: Re' hin naa nuk'amam chee q'aq'inik taq cha naah naa nusacham taq awach i hat najt taq anaah yuuq' re' kiloq'jik wii' i tiyoox. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusacham kiwach ar taqe aa artaal, re' i nayeew taq wii' aamayiij i hat taq aj Israel, naa nupaxem i tiyoox rujalwaach i q'iij re' inakoj taq chi aadios, eh naa nukansam taqe i koq chuwach i kitiyoox. <verse number="5" style="v" />Naa nukutum i kiti'jolal i aj Israel chuwach taq aatiyoox. Eh re' i kib'aqil ar naa nukutum chi junsuut taq aa artaal. <verse number="6" style="v" />Xa aha' pa' i tinamit naa apatiniik taq wii' naa rusachariik wach. Eh re' taqe inajt kinaah yuuq' wilik taq wii' aa artaal, inaloq'ej taq wii' tiyoox naa wo' rusachariik kiwach. Re' taq aatiyoox rujalwaach i q'iij naakixerariik, re' taq aa artaal i naakituhb'jiik wach ak'al. Chu'nchel i ayejaam taq i hat naa rusachariik kiwach. <verse number="7" style="v" />Noq naa taq awilom chi ma' k'isiin taqe i kamnaq naakikahnik chi kutlik taq chaxilak, naa taq anab'eem chi xa re' wo' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="8" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin ma' naa ta nuye'em q'ab' chi naa taq akimiik chawunchelaal i hat taq aj Israel i tukimaj taq awach pantaq tokoom tinamit. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i naa kikahniik chi kok'achalkeeb' taq panaxilak, naa ruk'uliik cho pankik'ux chupaam taqe i tokoom tinamit nik' wach noq xwik'saj taqe chi ti' k'axik, ruum ma' xinkinimaj taj. Eh ruum chi xinkiq'eb' chi riij kik'ux i hin, re' chik i tiyoox xkiloq'ej. Re' keh ma' k'isiin ta naa ruchaliik kik'ixiik, ruum i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios ma' kinchukwik ta q'orik noq xnuq'or chi naa nuye'em ti' k'axik chikinaah naa wo' nuye'em tiko'q keh, inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' hat chapohq'aaj paam aq'ab' chatohyaaj aawooq wach ak'al, ti oq'oq, cha k'er aachii' chi riij i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al i aj Israel. Ruum re' keh wilik i naa kikimiik ruum q'aq'inik, wilik i naa kikimiik ruum wi'jaleel, wilik i naa kikimiik ruum yab'ilaal. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i wilkeeb' poo chi najt, naa kikimiik ruum yab'ilaal, re' taqe i ma' najt ta wilkeeb' naa kikimiik ruum q'aq'inik. Eh re' taqe i naa kikahniik chi k'achalkeeb' naa kikimiik ruum wi'jaleel. Je' re' noq naa wik'sam i nujosq'iil, chikinaah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh noq naakilom i kiti'jolal i kitinamiit chi kutlik chi kixilak taqe i tiyoox, chi kijunsuut taqe artaal, chupaam taqe i ye'aab' najt kinaah, chinaah taqe inajt kinaah yuuq', chi ki'sil taqe chee' tz'inuj, chupaam i ye'aab' inkiyeew wii' inkohnik laj mayiij chuwach i tiyoox, naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin naa nukanaam i kiye'aab' chi xan tz'irik chik paam, chi xa je' chik chiq yuuq', ar naa rutohq'iik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij naa ruponiik chupaam i ye'aab' Diblat. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem i aj Israel chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ponik reh i q'iij chi naa rusahchiik wach i tinamit Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq, cha q'or keh i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="q">chi re' hin je' wili i nuq'or chikiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Ponik reh i q'iij chi naa rusahchiik</para>
  <para style="q">wach i kitinamiit, je' wo' i kiye'aab'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh yu'naak naa rusachariik awach taq i hat aj Israel,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nuye'em nujosq'iil, naa nuq'atam i q'orik taq cha naah.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa taq kaat nuye'em chi tojariik riij taq i yiib' wach na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin ma' naa ta nuketelaam taq awach, naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik amahk.</para>
  <para style="q">Korehtaal taq inatoj riij chu'nchel i a'nam chaloq.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or taq aweh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' i runimaal ti' k'axik naa nuye'em taq cha naah xa rutahqeem chik riib'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Yu'naak xponik chik i ruq'ijil</para>
  <para style="q">chi naa rusachariik taq awach.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh xti korik chi naa rusachariik taq awach.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh xponik chik ruq'ijil chi naa rusachariik taq awach i chupaam i tinamit wili.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ma' naa ta chik rub'aan i ninq'iij chinaah taqe i yuuq',</para>
  <para style="q">ruti'kiil la' taq chik ak'ux i naa ruwihiik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Yu'naak xa chi jumehq'iil</para>
  <para style="q">naa nusacham taq awach ruum i nujosq'iil.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa nuq'atam i q'orik taq cha naah, ruuk' taq i xa a'n</para>
  <para style="q">naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik riij ayiib' wach na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta nuketelaam taq awach.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa la' taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik riij taq ayiib' wach na'ojb'al,</para>
  <para style="q">naa taq atojom riij chu'nchel i taq i xa a'n.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios</para>
  <para style="q">xin ye'wik taq aweh chutojariik aamahk.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Xponik chik i q'iij chi naa rusachariik taq awach,</para>
  <para style="q">eh chi naa taq atojom wach i ayiib' wach na'ojb'al,</para>
  <para style="q">ruum xooj chi nimaal</para>
  <para style="q">eh xanimb'isaj taq awiib'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xooj chi nimaal,</para>
  <para style="q">eh ma' holohik taj i ruk'am chaloq.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' kib'ehomal, re' runinqaal kiwach ma' xta naa rokiik wii'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh xponik chik i q'iij, i ru orahiil,</para>
  <para style="q">chi ma' naa ta rusuuqb'iik ruk'ux i loq'ool,</para>
  <para style="q">ni xata re' i aj k'aay.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum re' hin naa nuye'em taqe</para>
  <para style="q">chutojariik i kimahk i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruum awach i xuk'ayej i rak'aal,</para>
  <para style="q">xama' naa ta wo' chik rehchaam</para>
  <para style="q">atoob' ta konee wo' naq ink'acharik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ma' nee ta wo' chik i ruyoj wach i k'aay xub'an,</para>
  <para style="q">eh ma' jino'q chik i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al naa rukahniik chi k'achlik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh naa wo' naq ruxuljiik i tuun reh ojik q'aq'ineel,</para>
  <para style="q">chu'nchel naq i naa kiyejaam kiib'</para>
  <para style="q">xa re' la' xama' awach ta wo' naa rojiik.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum re' nujosq'iil naa nuye'em chikinaah i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chi riij i tinamit naa ruwihiik q'aq'inik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh chupaam i tinamit naa ruwihiik wi'jaleel, eh kaq yab'ilaal.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' naa kiwihiik panab'iix ruuk' q'aq'inik naa kikantesjiik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i naa kiwihiik pan tinamit wi'jaleel, kaq yab'ilaal naa rukansanik keh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh wilik taqe i naakimolom chi elik</para>
  <para style="q">pantaq raxchee' je' rukab' noq inkimol chi elik i paloma ruum kiyo'jiik,</para>
  <para style="q">ar naa koq'iim ruum i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Xa naa chik kisiksotiik ruum kiyo'jiik</para>
  <para style="q">naa rukahniik chi ma' xta rukowiil i kooq kiq'ab'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh naa kikojom i q'as wach itz'ihy chikiij.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa rub'arb'otiik i kiti'jolal</para>
  <para style="q">ruum kiyo'jiik naa kijoyom i rismaal kinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">xanaa chik ruchaliik kik'ixiik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh naakiq'eb'em i ki oro, i ki plata pantaq b'eeh.</para>
  <para style="q">Ni xata re' i oro ni xata re' i plata</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruko'liniik keh noq naa nuye'em nujosq'iil chikinaah.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ma' naa ta chik kiloq'om kiwa', kihaa' ruuk' ki oro i ki plata,</para>
  <para style="q">ruum re' wo' taqe re' xq'eb'wik keh pamahk.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruum q'e' xkiyeew ruloq'il i ki oro i ki plata xkinimb'isaj kiwach,</para>
  <para style="q">eh ruuk' taqe re' xkiyejaa' kiyiib' wach tiyoox.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum aj re', re' hin naa nuye'em pankikapeb'aal</para>
  <para style="q">chi xa je' chik sohk', i ki oro i ki plata.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hin naa taqe nuye'em pan kiq'ab' i tokoom tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' tinamit xiik' naah yib'kiil wach i kina'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruk'uliik elq'anoq i kib'ehomal, naa kich'uwa'risam wach.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin ma' naa ta chik nutob'eem taqe,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naakokiik i aj ixowaal</para>
  <para style="q">chupaam i nupaat re' naq i q'e' looq' chi weh,</para>
  <para style="q">naakich'uwareem paam.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa kichaliik i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="q">naa kelq'aam i chib'ih i wilik ar.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hat cha yejaa' jino'q i karena</para>
  <para style="q">rehtalil chi naa ruchopariik kinaah</para>
  <para style="q">ruum re' tinamit wili xa re' kaansanik xa re' i yiib' wach inki a'n</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kichaliik i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al,</para>
  <para style="q">naa kichopom naah taqe paat pan tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naawisam i runimaal kiwach i wilik kajaawriik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' i kiye'aab' q'e' naq looq' keh naa ruch'uwareesjiik paam.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naa rusachariik kiwach,</para>
  <para style="q">naa naq chik kisik'im i rusuqkiil kik'ux, ma' naa ta chik kireqem.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Xa rutahqeem chik riib' i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chikinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">xa re' chik i re' naa kib'iram.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa naq kipahqaam kuuk' i jalal nuq'oral,</para>
  <para style="q">xama' xta wo' naa ruq'orariik keh.</para>
  <para style="q">Ma' naa ta chik kitijiik ruum i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, ruum i wilik runa'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' reey naa rukojom ruq'eq' so' chi riij, re' i k'amal b'eeh naa rutib'iik ruk'ux.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i tinamit naakib'arb'otiik ruum kiyo'jiik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk,</para>
  <para style="q">chi riij i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xkian.</para>
  <para style="q">Ar naakinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Ezequiel xk'uhtjik reh parusaq wiriik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xb'aan Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hoob' q'iij-oq chik ruk'amam rub'eeh i ruwaaq' poh reh i ruwaaq' haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia. Eh noq wilkiin panupaat wuch'ihil taqe i aj Judá nimaq wach kikamaj xwik'raaj noq xuyeew q'ab' i QaJaaw Dios chi nunaah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh jinaj b'ila' chik xwilow wach je' ruwii' winaq, eh xwilow chinaah rutuuq xutik'aa' qohoq i xa je' chik xaq q'aaq'. Eh nah rutuuq xutik'aa' johtoq i xanrob'rotik chik xa je' chik rukab' i q'an ch'ihch' inreprotik wach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i je' ruwii' winaq re' re' xuyub' b'ila' chik chaloq i q'aaq' xuchop chi rismaal nunaah, eh xiruksaj johtoq i Dios ruuk' i rajaawriik, xiruk'am reje chi chii' i puerta Jerusaleem noq xwilow panusaq wiriik. Ximponik chik rupab'aa' chi chii' i puerta wilik reje panookb'al reh i tinamit pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. Re' wilik wii' i tiyoox i nuksanik wach i rujosq'iil i Dios. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh ar xwilow wo' chik wach i ruloq'il i QaJaaw i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel. Je' rukab' i rujosq'iil xwilow wach panusaq wiriik wach k'ixkaab'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i je' ruwii' winaq je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq ti tz'ehtanoq reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, inki. Re' hin xintz'ehtanik wo' reje ar. Eh panookb'al i koq ma' najt ta ruuk' i puerta wilik wii' i artaal ar wilik i tiyoox i nuksanik wach i rujosq'iil i Dios. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh i je' ruwii' winaq: Hat rak'uun winaq ¿Mi nawil i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach inki a'n ayu' i aj Israel? Ruum inki a'n re' re' k'ahchi' kiin kesam reje pan nuSantolaj paat. Re' hin i nuq'or aweh chi ko wilik i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach naa awilom, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am b'ila' chik i koq panookb'al chi chii' i rupaat i Dios, eh chuwach i tz'aq xwilow wach jinaj i hoop. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq chanimb'isaj i hoop re' re', inki. Eh re' hin xnunimb'isaj wo' hoq i hoop, eh xnureq jinaj i ookb'al. <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: Okeen i koq ar neenawilow i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach inki a'n inki. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq xinokik i koq xwilow chi chuwach tz'aq tz'ihb'amaj i kehtalil i chikop xa kijukem kiib' noq kib'ehik, i kehtalil i chikop xiik' naah yib'kiil kiwach. Eh je' wo' i kehtalil i tiyoox inkiloq'ej i aj Israel. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chikiwach taqe i ehtalil re' re' wilkeeb' i koq i lajeeb' ru kajwinaq chi winaq, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel, eh pankiyejaal wilik i Jaazanias rak'uun i Safán. Eh k'ahchi' keeb' i koq chi loq'inik chi kiju'junaal kiyohq'eem kisansario xaq'eq chik paam i rusib'eel i insensia injohtik taxaaj inki a'n <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i je' ruwii' winaq je' wili i xuq'or weh: ¿Mi nawil inki a'n taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel, k'ahchi' kiloq'em i tiyoox chi q'eeqmaal? Re' keh inkikapaaj chi ma' k'ahchi' ta wilow taqe, chi ma' wilkiin ta chupaam i tinamit wili. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i hat ma' xata re' re' naa awilom ko wilik la' i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach naa kia'nam, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am reje chi chii' i ru puertahiil i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios, re' i puerta wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh wilik taqe i ixoq xwilow kiwach ar xasuq chik kioq'ik chi riij i tiyoox Tamuz rub'ihnaal. <verse number="15" style="v" />Je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: ¿Mi nawil inki a'n ixoq re' re'? Eh ma' xata re' re' naa awilom ko wilik i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach naa awilom, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am i koq chupaam i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios, eh ruuk' i koq i artaal xwilow chi ar wilkeeb' i ho'oob' ru ka'winaq chi winaq, re' i kiij kiye'em reje reh i wilik wii' i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. Ar kika'yik reje parelb'aal i q'iij kipach'aam kiib' korehtaal inkireq wach ak'al ruuk' i yejal kiwach chi looq'jiik reje i q'iij. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' QaJaaw je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: ¿Mi nawil taqe re'? Re' taqe i aj Judá ma' xata re' i panupaat inki a'n i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, inkinujisaj la' wo' paam i tinamit ruuk' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Re' keh k'ahchi' kijosam wach i nujosq'iil, imponik ruchuhkiil panuju' i loq'inik inki a'n <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' hin yohb'aal wach i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em chikinaah, ma' naa ta nuketelaam kiwach. Atoob' ta kik'er kichii' chi tiij, re' hin xama' naa ta wo' b'iram taqe, inki weh panusaq wiriik.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Ezequiel xk'uhtjik reh parusaq wiriik i ti' k'axik xkik'ul i aj Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin je' wili i xwilow panusaq wiriik, jinaj i kowlaj q'orik xb'aan chaloq, je' wili i xuq'or: Yu'naak xi k'ulik chik iloq kiyohq'eem kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' chi kiju'junaal naakiye'wiik chutojariik i kimahk i tinamit wili, inki. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh i waqiib' taqe i winaq kiyohq'eem kiq'aslaj ch'ihch', xi okik i koq chi chii' i puerta wilik taxaaj, pantz'eet reje reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh chi kixilak taqe re' wilik jinaj i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso' rukojom rub'ak'am nah rutuuq i jinaj lemeta chi rax ha' chi tz'ihb'al. Eh noq xi okik i koq xkipab'aa' kiib' chuwach i artaal q'an ch'ihch' ruyej-aal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios i hoj, hoj aj Israel, xwilow chik chi xelik reje chikinaah i k'achaach je' kiwii' ánjel xooj panookb'al reh i rupaat i Dios. Re' i QaJaaw Dios xuyuq'eej reje i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso', re' i rub'ak'am nah rutuuq i rax ha' reh tz'ihb'al. <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or reh: Yu'naak hiy chab'ehuj paam chu'nchel i tinamit Jerusaleem. Neenakoj rehtalil i yejal kiwach i tinamit ruuk' aatz'ihb'aal, chu'nchel i ti' inkik'raaj inkiyot' i kik'ux chi riij i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach na'ojb'al imb'aan chupaam i tinamit, inki. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh xb'iraj wo' hoq chi re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or keh i waqiib' chi winaq: Re' taq i hat hiy taq pan tinamit chi xam b'eeh chi riij i winaq re' re'. Ma' naa ta taq i akuyum i kimahk, ma' naa ta aketelaam taq kiwach. <verse number="6" style="v" />Naa la' taq rukuxiik akansam i ma' kojooj ta kehtalil chi rijib' winaq, chi rijib' ixoq, chi k'ijolaq, chi q'ahxoq, chi ha'lak'un. Xa re' la' ma' nee ta taq inatz'aj jino'q taqe i wilik kehtalil yejalkiwach, inki. Re' hin xwilow chi re' b'ila' chik taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel peet xkikansaj, re' i wilkeeb' chuwach i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or keh: Yu'naak hiy taq chach'uwa'risaj taq cho paam i nupaat cha nujisaj taq chi kamnaq, inki. Re' keh xiooj wo' chi kansanik chupaam i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh noq kaansanik inki a'n re' hin xin kahnik chi wutkeel, xnupach'aa' qohoq wiib' wach ak'al, q'e' xtib'ik nuk'ux. Xnuk'er nuchii' chi q'orariik chi je' wili: QaJaaw Dios ¿Mi naa rukuxiik asacham kiwach re' i kiqox i aj Israel noq naa aye'em aajosq'iil chikinaah i aj Jerusaleem? kinki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh je' wili xuq'or weh: Re' taqe i aj Israel, taqe i aj Judá yohb'aal wach i kimahk, re' i kitinamiit nujinaq chi aj kaansoom, eh nujinaq chi ma' korik ta laj na'ojb'al. Re' keh inkikapaaj chi ma' wilkiin ta chupaam i tinamit wili, eh chi ma' k'ahchi' ta chik wilom i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="10" style="v" />Je' re', noq re' hin ma' naa ta nuketelaam k'isinoq kiwach, naa taqe nuye'em chutojariik riij chu'nchel i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso' rukojom i ruk'amam cho naah rutuuq i rax ha' tz'ihb'al, xsutinik b'ila' wo' chik chaloq je' wili i xuq'or reh i QaJaaw Dios: Yu'naak xponik chik nub'an i xaq'or weh, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruloq'il i Dios xelik chupaam i rupaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh xwilow wo' hoq panusaq wiriik chi wilik i he'lik chikinaah i kijib' chi k'achaach, re' i xwilow kiwach paam peet, jinaj i tzunaab' yej-amaj ruuk' i holohaq ab'aj safiro. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso': Okeen i koq chupaam i kotokaq wilik chi ki'sil i kijib' chi k'achaach. Neenachop jumohq'-oq i nah wach q'aaq' qoplik i ruq'aq'al wilik chi kixilak i k'achaach neenahilej chinaah i tinamit, inki reh. Re' i winaq re' re' xokik wo' i koq ar noq xwilow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach ar wilkeeb' reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i rupaat i Dios noq xokik i koq i winaq. Eh re' i ookb'al wilik i koq ma' najt ta ruuk' i rupaat i Dios xnujik chi suutz'. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios xelik reje chikinaah i kijib' chi k'achaach ar chik xooj panookb'al reh i rupaat i Dios. Re' i chii' paat xan saqumanik chik xub'an i ruloq'il i QaJaaw. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' choqik i rub'an i kixiik' taqe i k'achaach x-ib'irjik chaloq chupaam i ye'aab' wilik cho kochiriij i rupaat i Dios, xa je' chik rukab' noq i rub'an chee kowlaj q'orik i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios xuq'or wo' chik reh i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso' chi naa ruchopom jumohq'-oq i nah wach q'aaq' wilik pankiyejaal i kijib' chi kotokaq, re' i wilkeeb' wii' i kijib' chi k'achaach. Eh re' i winaq xujil i koq riib' ruuk' i jinaj keh i kotokaq. <verse number="7" style="v" />Xchalik i jinaj keh kijib' chi k'achaach, xiyub' b'ila' chik chaloq i q'ab' xuchop i jumohq' chinaah wach q'aaq' wilik pankiyejaal, eh xuyeew pan q'ab' i winaq holohik itz'ihy lino i ruso', re' reh xuk'ul wo' hoq xelik cho ar. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' hin xwilow chi jinaj i je' q'ab' winaq wilik cho ri'sil kixiik' i k'achaach re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Xwilow wo' i kijib' chi kotokaq ju'jun i wilik pankicheel i ju'jun chi k'achaach. Eh re' taqe i kotokaq re' re' xan rob'rotik chik i kiwach, xa je' chik holohik laj ab'aj Crisolito. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq eliik wach kininqaal, eh chupaam taqe i ju'jun chi kotokaq wilik ta b'ila' wo' chik taqe i ju'jun chi kotokaq. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe i kotokaq xa aha' kiooj xama' kisutinik ta wo' hoq. Re' taqe k'achaach ojik inki a'n panyejaal jinajkiooj wii'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'achaach re' re', yohb'aal wach inaq' kiwach xan rob'rotik chik je' chikiwach, je' chikiij, je' wataq kiq'ab', je' wataq kixiik'. Je' wo' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq imb'esanik keh ma' k'isiin wo' naq' kiwach. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' hin Ezequiel xb'iraj wo' hoq chi re' kijib' chi kotokaq re' re' kareta i rub'ihnaal inkiq'or. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach re' re' kajtarchel wilik i kiwach chi kiju'junaal. Re' peet kiwach je' inka'yik imas wakax, re' rukab' kiwach je' inka'yik winaq, re' i roox kiwach je' inka'yik kaq b'ahlam, re' i rukaaj kiwach je' inka'yik xihk.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach xirupinik chik johtoq taxaaj noq xwil, re' wo' taqe i xwilow cho kiwach chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. <verse number="16" style="v" />Noq kiooj reje i k'achaach kiooj wo' haa' i kotokaq. Noq inkihe' paam i kixiik' reh i wuktik i k'achaach inkiyejaa' wo' kiib' i kotokaq keh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq kipahik i k'achaach, kipahik wo' hoq i kotokaq. Noq kiwutik reje i k'achaach, kiwutik wo' haa' i kotokaq. Ruum re' taqe k'achaach inye'wik kik'achariik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios xelik cho panookb'al reh i rupaat i Dios xooj ruyeew riib' chikinaah taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach. <verse number="19" style="v" />Xwilow b'ila' chik noq xkihe' paam i kixiik' xiwutik reje chinaah i wach ak'al. Eh xi wuktik wo' reje haa' kijib' chi kotokaq wilik pankicheel, ar xiooj pa'lojoq chi chii' i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios, re' i puerta wilik reje parelb'aal q'ij. Eh re' i ruloq'il i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel wilik chikinaah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hin xnunab'eej chi re' wo' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach xwilow kiwach parutzunaab' i QaJaaw i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel, ar chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. Xnukoj rehtaal chi re' wo' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh xwilow wo' hoq chi kajkaj i kiwach wilik chi kiju'junaal, eh kajkaj kixiik'. Eh chi ri'sil i kixiik' xwilow chi wilik taqe i je' q'ab' winaq. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kajtarchel wo' wilik i kiwach, re' wo' kika'yik i xwilow kiwach chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar. Eh kikajcheel jinaj b'ila' chik ojik inki a'n wii'.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xkian i k'amal b'eeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin xwilow panusaq wiriik chi xiruk'am reje i Ruxlab'al QaJaaw Dios chi chii' i puerta wilik reje panelb'aal reh i rupaat i Dios. Eh inwilow ar wilkeeb' i hoob' ru ka'winaq chi winaq, chi kixilak i re' xnunab'eej wach i Jaazanias rak'uun i Azur, je' wo' hoq i Pelatías rak'uun i Benaía, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i tinamit. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' aj taqe i winaq wili kib'anik i ti' k'axik, eh inkiyejaa' wach i yiib' wach na'ojb'al chupaam i tinamit wili. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh je' wili inkiq'or: Re' hoj neerub'an chi neenqayejaa' qatinamiit ar neenqako'leej qiib'. Re' qatinamiit je' rukab' jino'q i xun, eh re' hoj je' hoj tiwik chupaam, inki taqe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hat, cha q'or rib'iral keh panub'ihnaal i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chikinaah, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i Ruxlab'al i QaJaaw xuyeew chi nunaah xuq'or weh chi naa nuq'orom chi je' wili: Je' wili i xuq'or taq cho chawiij i QaJaaw: Re' taqe i aj Israel xa reh reh inkiq'or eh xa reh reh inkiyejaa' wach, xa re' la' re' hin weht'al chib'ih i wilik pankik'ux. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ma' k'isiin ikaansanik taq xa a'n xanujisaj taq chi kamnaq paam i tinamit. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or taq aweh i hat aj Jerusaleem chi naa taq kaat nuk'amam taqe reje pan tokoom tinamit, je' naa jinaj xun xa re' la' re' jilow i tiwik naa kiwihiik chupaam ma' re' ta chik i taq i hat, re' la' taq i xakansaj i hat. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ma' k'isiin taq tiyo'jik ruum i q'aq'inik, eh re' hin naa nuye'em i q'aq'inik taq cha naah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq kaat wesam reje ayu' naa taq kaat nuq'asam pan kiq'ab' i tokoom tinamit, naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik i aamahk. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa taq akanteesjiik, naa nuq'atam i q'orik taq cha naah. Eh pank'ula't reh i ye'aab' Israel naa nutoq'aam, reh chi naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taq aatinamiit ma' naa ta chik rukamaniik taq aweh chi je' xun, eh ma' naa ta wo' chik taq akamaniik i hat chi je' tiwik. Re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik taq cha naah, pank'ula't reh i Israel. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruuk' i re' naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. Re' taq i hat ma' xanimaj ta taqe i nuk'uhb'aal, eh ni xata xa a'n i xnuq'or taq aweh. Re' la' chik taq i xatijej i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i tinamit wilik taq chi aajunsuut, inki i Dios, inki Ezequiel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' hin xtohq'ik chik nuq'orom rib'iral i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik, eh xwilow xkimik chik i Peladias rak'uun i Benaía. Eh re' hin xnupachaa' wiib' wach ak'al, xnuk'er nuchii' chuq'orariik chi je' wilik: QaJaaw Dios ¿Mi naa rukuxiik akansam re' i kiqox i aj Israel? kinki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios xuq'or chi naa wo' chik resam taqe panti' k'axik i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or weh: <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hat re' taqe tinamit wilkeeb' Jerusaleem, k'ahchi' keeb' chi q'orik chikiij i aj Israel re' taqe i xi k'amarik reje pan tokoom tinamit je' wili inkiq'or: Re' taqe aj Israel najt wilkeeb' ruuk' i QaJaaw ma' nee ta rub'aan chi neenkiloq'ej, xkahnik qeh i ye'aab' wili inki taqe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hat cha q'or keh i aj Israel, chi re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Korik chi re' hin xintukinik reje kiwach noq xiooj pan tokoom tinamit, xa re' la' xama' najt ta wo' naa kianam cho ar. Eh re' wo' hin wilkiin kuuk' noq wilkeeb' cho chupaam taqe i tinamit re' re'. <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha q'or wo' keh chi je' wili i nuq'or: Chi re' hin naa wo' chik wesam taqe cho chupaam i tinamit wilkeeb' ponoq wii'. Naa wo' chik numolom kiwach pan kitinamiit, naa wo' chik nuye'em keh i tinamit Israel. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq wilkeeb' chik pan kitinamiit naa rukuxiik kesam i kitiyoox, ma' naa ta chik kianam i ch'uwa' wach loq'inik inki a'n <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' hin naa nujalam wach i kánima je' kowiil ab'aj ak' laj ánima, ak' laj uxlab'al chik i naa nuye'em keh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Reh chi naa kianam i nuq'or keh, eh naakinimam taqe i nuk'uhb'aal. Chi je' re' naa kikahniik chi nutinamiit taqe, eh re' chik i hin naa nukahniik chi ki Dios. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i inkiyeew kik'ux chub'anariik ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al, i loq'inik tiyoox naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik riij i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i kijib' chi k'achaach xkihe' ikixiik' xirupinik reje, eh re' taqe i kijib' chi kotokaq xiooj wo' haa' chikiij. Eh wilik chikinaah i ruloq'il i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios xelik b'ila' chik reje panyejaal i tinamit xooj ruyeew riib' chinaah i yuuq' wilik reje pareeb'aal q'iij reh i tinamit. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am b'ila' wo' chik reje Ruxlab'al i QaJaaw Dios ar Babilonia, re' hoj k'amooj reje wii' kuuk' i wuch aj Israel. Re' taqe i wili panusaq wiriik xwilow, re' taqe i xuyeew chi k'uhtjik i QaJaaw Dios. Eh xnumay rilariik i xk'uhtjik weh panusaq wiriik. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' hin xkuxik nuk'utjaam keh taqe i wuch'ihil ponoq pan tokoom tinamit, nik' nimaal i xuyeew weh chi naab'jik i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Ezequiel xuk'uhtaaj nik' wach noq naa kik'amariik reje pan tokoom tinamit i aj Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq k'acharik i na a'n chi kixilak taqe ma' kinimanik taj. Wilik naq' kiwach xama' kilwiik ta wo' hoq, wilik kixikin xama' ki-ib'irinik ta wo' hoq, eh xama' kinimanik ta wo' hoq. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha yejaa' taqe i chib'ih aweh, je' ti chik ojik aweh pan tokoom tinamit. Eh pan q'iij nee ti elik reje, chikiwach chu'nchel, nee ti elik reje i hat patim wii' nee tiooj chupaam chik jino'q i ye'aab', chi je' re' nee oon naq inche kireq chi riij chi ma' kinimanik taj. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh pan q'iij chikiwach i keh neenawesaj taqe reje i chib'ih aweh, je' cho ojik i na a'n je' cho naa aweliik reje chupaam i tinamit wilkaat wii' neena a'n awiib'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Chi riij i re' neenahop jino'q i hoop chuwach i tz'aq, eh chikiwach chu'nchel nee ti ik'ik reje ar awuch'ihil taqe i chib'ih aweh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh parokiik i q'iij nee nayeew reje nah atileb' i chib'ih aweh, nee ti elik reje chikiwach chi kunchelaal, nee nab'ur aawach reh chi ma' nee ta nawil paam i tinamit. Ruuk' i re' naa aye'em rehtalil keh i aj Israel chib'ih i naakik'ulum, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' hin xnub'an wo' i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw. Xnuyejaa' i chib'ih weh, eh pan q'iij xwesaj chaloq je' rukab' noq imb'aan ojik pan tokoom tinamit. Eh xq'eq chik xnuhop wo' hoq i hoop wach tz'aq. Noq xokik i q'iij chikiwach chi kunchelaal xnuyeew cho nah nutileb' i chib'ih weh xinelik chaloq xnub'an wiib'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chi junwaar chik je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="9" style="v" />Noq i nuq'or i hin chi re' taqe i tinamit Israel ma' kinimanik taj xkipahqaaj aweh chi chib'ih reet i xa a'n chi je' re'. <verse number="10" style="v" />Wila' xkipahqaaj aweh chib'ih reet i xa a'n cha q'or keh chi re' hin kinq'orik chi re' i xa a'n re' re' rehtalil chuwach i reey wilik Jerusaleem, rehtalil chikiwach i aj Israel patim taqe ar. <verse number="11" style="v" />Chaq'or keh chi re' hat k'ahchi' aq'oriik rib'iral chib'ih i naakik'ulum ruum aha' wilik i xak'uhtaaj i hat je' re' i naa kia'nam i keh noq naa kik'amariik reje pan tokoom tinamit. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i reey naa ruye'em cho nah tileb' i chib'ih reh, noq naa rokiik i q'equm naa relik cho chupaam i ruhopil i tz'aq naakihopom, naa rutz'apam i naq'wach reh chi ma' naa ta rilom paam i tinamit noq naa rumolom chi elik. <verse number="13" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin naa nuchopom, eh naa nuk'amam reje pan tokoom tinamit Babilonia, re' i kiyuq'ul i aj Caldeo, eh ma' naa ta rilom paam i tinamit ar naa rukimiik. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i ru soldado incha'jinik reh chi rujunsuut naa nutukem kiwach xa aha' yuuq'. Je' wo' re' i naa nub'anam keh i ruk'ihaal i ru soldado korehtaal inwik'saj i nujosq'iil chikinaah, je' naa nuyohq'eem nuq'as laj ch'ihch'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Noq nutukem chik kiwach xa aha' pantaq tokoom tinamit ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hin wilik taqe inanuko'leem, reh chi ma' naa ta kikimiik ruum q'aq'inik, ruum i wi'jalel, ruum kaq yab'ilaal. Reh chi neenkiq'or rib'iral pantaq tinamit nee ki-ik'ik wii' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n Ruuk' i re' neenkinab'eej chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ruq'orariik rib'iral tokoom chik ti' k'axik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="18" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' hat cha k'uhtaaj chi ma' k'isiin ta tiyo'jik noq neena a'n awa', eh cha k'uhtaaj chi ti' ak'ux noq neena a'n ahaa'. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh chu'nchel i aj Jerusaleem, je' wo' keh chu'nchel i aj Israel wilkeeb' ar chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or: Re' keh ruuk' ruti'kiil k'uxliis naa kianam kiwa', eh panyo'jik naa kianam kihaa'. Re' i kitinamiit naa rusachariik wach, ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n taqe i patineel wilkeeb' ar. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' i kiye'aab' wilkeeb' patineel chupaam naa rusachariik kiwach. Re' i tinamit naa rukahniik chi xan tz'irik chik paam. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, tiko'q keh, inki weh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="22" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq ¿Chib'ih reet noq inkiq'or i aj Israel chi re' i q'iij k'ahchi' rik'iik xama' k'ulariik ta wo' hoq ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik i jalal ruq'oral i Dios? inki taqe. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw je' wili i xuq'or: Chaq'or keh chi re' hin ma' naa ta chik nuye'em q'ab' chi naa ruq'orariik taqe i q'orik re' re' ayu' Israel. Cha q'or keh chi xailook' chik inooj eloq wach ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik taqe i jalal nuq'oral. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh chi ma' naa ta chik ruk'uhtjiik keh pan kisaq wiriik ma' korik taj. Ma' naa ta chik i ruq'orariik rib'iral chi kixilak ma' korik taj. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruum re' chik i hin i Dios naa nuq'oriik rib'iral chib'ih i naa ruk'ulariik, eh jumehq'iil naa rojiik eloq wach. Eh re' taqe i tinamit ma' kinimanik taj naakilom ruuk' naq' kiwach. Re' hin naa nuq'oriik rib'iral, eh naa wo' nub'anam, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel k'ahchi' kiq'orom chi re' i xaq'or rib'iral keh i nuk'uhtaaj aweh panasaq wiriik xti komajaa' ta yu'naak naa ruk'ulariik. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruum aj re' cha q'or keh chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' i nuq'oral naa rojiik eloq wach chi jumehq'iil, i nuq'orom rib'iral naa rojiik eloq wach, inki QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios xuq'or chi naa ruye'em taqe panti' k'axik inkikoj kiib' chi jalal ruq'oral</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat chaq'il taqe i panub'ihnaal i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib' wilkeeb' Israel, ruum xa kiq'oral i keh inkiq'or, je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: <verse number="3" style="v" />Q'e' ti' i naakik'ulum i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib', ma' xta kina'ojb'al xa pankik'ux inchalik inkiq'or, ma' xta wo' hoq ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe inkikoj kiib' chi jalal nuq'oral taq chaxilak taq i hat aj Israel, xa je' kikab' i pahar wilkeeb' panchiq yuuq'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ma' xtaj i k'ahchi' kiyejaam k'isinoq, ma' nkiyejaa' taj i tz'aq chi junsuut i tinamit, reh chi nee naq taq inako'leej awiib' i hat i aj Israel chuwach i q'aq'inik noq naa ruponiik i q'iij reh i nujosq'iil. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aha' wilik inkilow pan kisaq wiriik ma' korik ta wo' hoq, re' inkiq'or rib'iral i ma' korik taj. Inkiq'or chi nuq'oral i hin, xanaah re' ma' re' ta wo' hin kintaaq'anik reje keh. Eh inkuy-eej chi naa nub'anam i hin inkiq'or rib'iral. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik inkiq'or ma' korik taj, re' inkiq'or rib'iral xachukuj q'orik. Eh inkiq'or chi nuk'uhb'aal i hin inkiq'or, re' hin xama' xta wo' nuq'orom keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or: Ruum chi re' keh ma' re' tee korik inkiq'or, eh inkiq'or rib'iral i xama' korik ta wo' hoq ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik. Re' hin naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil chikinaah, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i ti' k'axik chikinaah i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib', re' i ki-ilwik reh i ma' korik taj. Re' kiq'orik reh i xachukuj q'orik, ma' naa ta kisutiniik cho Israel. Eh ni xata re' i kib'ihnaal naa rokiik haa' panhuuj i tz'ihb'amaj wii' i kib'ihnaal i aj Israel. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin k'achlik Dios. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib', xkijot' i nutinamiit, noq inkiq'or chi naa ruwihiik i rusuqkiil k'uxliis ma' korik ta wo' hoq. Re' keh je' kikab' i kijosanik reh i ma' kow ta laj koraal tz'aq, xankichunej i koq wach. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' hat cha q'or keh i xankichunej i koq wach i tz'aq re' re', chi re' i tz'aq naa ruq'ehb'iik wach ak'al noq naa nuye'em chee i runimaal jab', i nimaq taq saqb'och xa je' chik taq nimaq ab'aj, eh kaq suut teew paam. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruq'ehb'iik wach ak'al i tz'aq naa rupahqaljiik keh chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih i xkamanik wii' i chuun xa chunej taq wii' wach i tz'aq? kiuchjoq. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Ruum i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em i kaq suut teew. Eh ruum wo' i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em runimaal jab', je' wo' hoq i nimaq taq saqb'och je' taq nimaq ab'aj, reh chi naa nusacham wach i tz'aq xkiyejaa'. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusacham wach i tz'aq xachuneej taq wach, naa nukutum panak'al, naa rukahniik wach saqum i raa'. Xti korik wo' hoq chi naa ruq'ehb'iik i tz'aq, eh naa rub'uhriik kinaah ruum. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hin naa wik'sam i nujosq'iil chinaah i tz'aq, je' wo' chikinaah i xichuninik wach. Re' tinamit je' wili i naa kiq'orom: Xsahchik wach i tz'aq chi jumpech, je' wo' i xichuninik wach, inko'q taqe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib' wilkeeb' Israel inkiq'or chi xk'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik, chi naa ruwihiik suq kiil k'uxliis Jerusaleem, xanaah re' ma' korik ta wo' hoq inkiq'or, inki QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Yu'naak i hat, cha q'oreej taqe ixoq i kiq'orik reh chi re' hin kinq'orik keh inkiq'or, eh xa pankik'ux wo' inchalik inkiq'or. <verse number="18" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Q'e' ti' i naakik'ulum ixoq re' re' inkib'oj itz'ihy reh chi chu'nchel i tinamit inkikoj ralaq kiq'ab'. Eh inkib'oj i itz'ihy reh chi chu'nchel i tinamit inkib'ur wach i kinaah chi reh. ¿Mi ruuk' i re' neenkiq'or re' awach i neeruko'leej riij i ruk'achariik, eh awach i neenkimik? <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe ixoq re' re' xa ruuk' i juntzuhb' chi eebada, xa ruuk' i junch'uy chi kaxlanwi'k inkesaj i nuloq'il chikiwach i nutinamiit, inkiq'or chi naa ruk'achariik i ma' ruk'ul ta chi naa ruk'achariik. Eh inkiq'or chi naa rukimiik i ma' ruk'ul ta chi naa rukimiik. Je' re' kijot'ariik i nutinamiit inki a'n re' keh inkinimaj i chukuj q'orik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios ma' nwaaj ta wach itz'ihy re' re', re' inkiq'at wii' i tinamit, je' rukab' noq inchoparik pan xirob' i tz'ikin. Xa re' la' re' hin naa nuko'leem pan kiq'ab' i tinamit re' re' naa taqe nukanaam chi ma' xta naa ruq'atwiik pan kib'eeh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Naa wesam i nutinamiit pan kiq'ab', ma' naa ta chik kikojom itz'ihy inkikoj wach kinaah, ma' naa ta chik kiq'ilim i nutinamiit. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ruuk' i chukuj q'orik xkian ixoq re' re' xkiyoj ruk'ux i korik wach kik'ux, re' hin ma' inwaaj ta naq chi nk'ularik i re'. Eh xkiyeew rukowiil kik'ux taqe i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al chi naa kichopom kik'ux chub'aan i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe ixoq re' re' ma' naa ta chik kilom pan kisaq wiriik i xama' korik ta wo' hoq, eh ma' naa ta chik kianam i q'ijinik. Re' hin naa nuko'leem i nutinamiit pan kiq'ab', ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki weh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios xuq'or chi ma' imponik ta chuwach i kilooq'inik reh taqe i tiyoox</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin k'ih taqe i k'amal b'eeh i aj Israel xi chalik wuuk', reh chi wilik i naa nupahqaam reh i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taqe i winaq re' re' kiq'asam kiib', kiye'em kik'ux chi looq'jiik taqe i tiyoox, eh xa re' chik inki a'n inkutwik keh pamahk ¿Mi ruk'ul re' chi neenkipahqaaj weh chib'ih i naa kianam? <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hat je' wili cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or: Re' i aj Israel ruq'asam riib' ruye'em ruk'ux chulooq'jiik i tiyoox, re' i rub'an inkutwik reh pamahk. Eh neenchalik chupahqaljiik runa'ojb'al ruuk' i jalal nuq'oral, re' hin naa nuye'wiik keh panti' k'axik je' rukab' i ruk'ul chi keh ruum xa re' chik i ruk'ihaal tiyoox inkiyeew ruloq'il, inki. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin je' re' i naa nub'anam keh chu'nchel i aj Israel xkikanaa' nunimjiik ruum i kilooq'jiik i tiyoox, ruuk' i re' naa nutz'a'am i kánima reh chi nee wo' chik kinkinimaj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Chaq'or keh i aj Israel chi kinki nimaj wo' chik, kikanaa' runimjiik taqe i tiyoox. Eh kikanaa' chu'nchel i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n inki. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh wila' wilik jino'q i aj Israel, oon jino'q i tokoom tinamit wilik Israel nee rukanaa' nunimjiik neeruq'asaj riib' chi kilooq'jiik taqe i tiyoox. Eh xa re' chik neerub'an inq'eb'wik reh panmahk neenchalik chi rupahqaljiik runa'ojb'al ruuk' jino'q i jalal nuq'oral re' hin naa nuye'wiik reh i ruk'ul chi reh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil chinaah awach naa rub'aniik reh i re', naa nuye'em panti' k'axik reh chi neenkiq'or chi ma' holohik ta imb'anik. Eh naa wesam chi kixilak i nutinamiit. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh wila' re' jalal nuq'oral xujal wach i nuk'uhb'aal, re' wo' hin xin ye'wik q'ab' chi xuchuk i q'orik. Re' wo' hin naa nuye'wiik re' panti' k'axik, eh naa wesam chi kixilak i nutinamiit Israel. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh kikab'cheel naa kitojom wach i kimahk, naa rutojom wach i ru mahk i xponik rupahqaaj runa'ojb'al, eh naa wo' rutojom wach i ru mahk i jalal nuq'oral. <verse number="11" style="v" />Reh chi ma' nee ta nkikanaa' nunimjiik chi jumpech i aj Israel, reh chi ma' nee ta inkich'uwa'reej kiib' ruuk' i mahk. Reh chi nee kikahnik chi nutinamiit taqe, eh re' chik i hin naa nukahniik chi ki Dios, inki QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Dios xuq'or chi ruk'ul chi naa kiye'ariik chutojariik i kimahk i aj Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="13" style="v" />Wila' re' i tinamit i xmahkunik chi nuwach, ma' korik ta wach ruk'ux wuuk'. Re' hin naa nuye'em i nuq'ab' chinaah reh i rub'anariik reh i ti' k'axik, naa wesam chuwach i ruwa' ruhaa' naa nuye'em wi'jalel chinaah. Eh naa kikimiik i tinamit, je' wo' taqe i chikop. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh chupaam i tinamit re' re' nee ta kiwihik i Noé, Daniel, Job, xa re' wo' naq ixib' chi winaq re' re' ma' nee ta kikimik ruum korik wach kik'ux, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh wixnutaq'aaj reje taqe i josq'laj chikop chupaam i tinamit chi kikanteesjiik, reh chi ma' xta chik k'achareel neenkahnik ar. Eh ma' awach ta chik i neenkian ik'ik ar kuum i josq'laj chikop. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh wilkeeb' ta naa re' chi k'acharik ar ixib' chi winaq re' re' ma' nee ta naq inkiko'leej riij i kik'achariik i kak'uun kixq'uun, xa re' wo' naq i keh ma' nee ta kikimik. Re' i tinamit re' re' xa nee wo' naq inkahnik chi ma' xta k'achareel chupaam. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh nee ta nuyeew q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit re' re', eh neenuq'or chi neekikanteesjik chu'nchel i tinamit, je' wo' taqe i chikop. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh wilkeeb' ta naq chi k'acharik ar i ixib' chi winaq re' re'. Re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi ma' nee ta naq inkiko'leej riij i kik'achariik kak'uun kixq'uun. Xa re' wo' naq i keh ma' nee ta kikimik. <verse number="19" style="v" />Neeta nuyeew kaq yab'ilaal chinaah i tinamit re' re', eh nee ta nutoq'aa' kaansanik ar ruum i nujosq'iil. Eh nee ta nuq'or chi nee kikimik i tinamit je' wo' taqe chikop. <verse number="20" style="v" />Wilkeeb' ta naa re' chi k'acharik ar i Noé, Daniel i Job. Re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi ma' nee ta naq inkiko'leej riij i kik'achariik i kak'uun kixq'uun, xa re' wo' naq i keh ma' nee ta kikimik ruum korik wach kik'ux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi q'e' wo' chik ti' i naakik'ulum i aj Jerusaleem noq naa nuye'em chikinaah i kijib' wach chi ti' k'axik re' taqe i wili: Q'aq'inik, wi'jaleel, taqe i josq'laj chikop, i kaq yab'ilaal, kanteesb'al keh i tinamit, je' wo' taqe i chikop. <verse number="22" style="v" />Xa re' la' ko wilik wo' kiib' ixib'-oq i ma' naa ta kikimiik kuch'ihil taqe i kak'uun kixq'uun, noq naa kojiik k'oloq taq awuuk' ar. Re' taq i hat naa taq akojom rehtaal chi ma' holohik ta kib'anik, eh ma' holohik ta kiq'orik, naa rusuqb'iik taq ak'ux noq naa taq awilom i ti' k'axik naa nuye'em chikinaah i aj Jerusaleem. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh noq naa taq awilom chib'ih inki a'n chib'ih inkiq'or, naa taq rusuuqb'iik ak'ux, ruum naa taq akojom rehtaal i chi wilik wo' kimahk noq nuyeew ti' k'axik chikinaah i aj Jerusaleem, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i tinamit Jerusaleem xpajarik ruuk' i uuva ma' xta kamaj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq ¿Mi chihooj re' i ruche'el i uuva</para>
  <para style="q">chuwach i chee' wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />¿Mi neerub'an re' chi neensik'arik i q'ab' uuva reh chi</para>
  <para style="q">neen korjik i chib'ih jariik chi reh?</para>
  <para style="q">oon ¿Chi t'uyaab' jino'q xa chib'ih jariik?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Xa sii' la' chik neenkahnik</para>
  <para style="q">wii' noq k'ahtinaq chik taqe i ju', je' wo' taqe i panyejaal.</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi ko wilik neen kamanik wii' re'?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Wila' ma' chih xkamanik wii'</para>
  <para style="q">noq komanlik wach ruche'el,</para>
  <para style="q">kora'j naa chik wilik neen kamanik wii' re' noq k'ahtinaq chik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Nik' wach noq ink'atarik pan q'aaq' i ruche'el i uuva.</para>
  <para style="q">Je' wo' re' noq naa nukutum taqe pan q'aaq'</para>
  <para style="q">i aj Jerusaleem i hin chi k'atb'al keh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em nujosq'iil chikinaah.</para>
  <para style="q">Atoob' ta neenkiko'leej kiib' chuwach i q'aaq' pampeet,</para>
  <para style="q">xa q'aaq' wo' i naa ruk'atwiik keh.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' taq i hat naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin naa nukanaam i Jerusaleem chi xan tz'irik chik paam</para>
  <para style="q">ruum xa re' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n</para>
  <para style="q">inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj Jerusaleem ma' xkian taj i korik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq, cha q'or keh i aj Jerusaleem chixiik'naah yib'kiil wach i na'ojb'al inki a'n <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' taq i hat aj Jerusaleem. Hat naq taq cho aj Canaán chawaasb'al, re' taq chaloq i peet awajaaw aj amorreo, re' taq aatuut aj heteo. <verse number="4" style="v" />Noq xatoq'aa' taq cho k'acharik je' naa ma' yok'arik ta taq awatz'uum, ma' imb'aan ta taq awitiin, ma' tib'uch'arik ta taq ruuk' aatz'aam, je' naa ma' b'ak'lik ta taq apaam. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ma' awach ta naq inketeliin taq awach, ma' awach ta naq inkapeb'inik taq aweh chi xb'aan ta taq otob'il aweh. Eh noq xatoq'aa' taq cho k'acharik, xatkanab'jik taq cha wutkeel panch'ahn, ruum tikiyibuj naq taq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xinik'ik ar xat wilow taq chi xakimik taq chik aweh je' naa xa tuk'uj taq chik riib' aawooq i chupaam taq akik'eel, re' hin xnuq'or chi ma' ruk'ul ta chi naa taq akimiik. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin xatnuk'isaj taq chi je' rukab' noq ink'ihik i tik panab'iix. Xat k'ihik taq korehtaal taq xat ponik chi q'e' taq hat holohik, je' jinaj nimlaj ixoq noq ink'ihik taqe i ruch'uuch' ink'ihik i rismaal. Xa re' la' ko je' naq taq hat t'usulkaat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh koq'uun chik xwilow chi je' chik taq akab' i q'ahxoq i ruk'ul chik chi naa ruwihiik rub'ahiil. Re' hin xnub'ur wach taq ak'ixb'ilaal, ruum je' naq taq hat t'usulkaat. Xnub'an kaxáro taq awuuk' xat kahnik taq chi weh, wilik i xqayejaa' wach taq awuuk', inki i Dios. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin je' naa xnub'an taq awitiin, xnutz'aj iloq taq akik'eel, xat nub'uch taq chupaam ink'ohnik laj iq'oom <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh xoyimaj paam taq aso' xnukoj chawiij, xnukoj taq axijab' cha wooq, itz'ihy lino xnub'ak' taq wii' apaam, eh xnukoj taq axeela so' chawiij. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh je' naa xatnuxoyej taq ruuk' i xa chib'ih jariik q'e' holohaq, xnukoj kotokaq ch'ihch' wataq atileb', eh xnukoj taq karena chawalaq. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh je' naa xnukoj holohaq kotkot laj ch'ihch' taq cha ju', xnukoj taq aaka'xikin, xnukoj holohaq corona taq wach anaah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh je' naa xatnuxoyej taq ruuk' oro, ruuk' plata, xnukoj taq aholohaq so' xoyimaj paam re' ruuk' i lino, eh xela. Eh tinuk'uxlaaj wo' taq ruuk' i suq laj kaxlanwi'k, ruuk' riis kaab' ruuk' i aseite olivo. Eh xareq taq aholwochiil, xareq taq i runimaal awach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Xa holohik chik taq awib'iral chupaam taqe i nimaq tinamit ruum taq aholwochiil, ruum q'e' taq hat holohaq xat nukanaa' ruuk' taq i xoyb'al aweh, inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Xa re' la' xach'ikaa' taq ak'ux ruuk' taq aholwochiil. Xa suq taq chik ak'ux noq xelik taq awib'iral, xatoq'aa' taq rub'aan i je' k'oyomal inaq'asaj taq awiib' reh xa awach taq inik'ik chawach. <verse number="16" style="v" />Je' naa xayeew taq aso' chinaah taqe i yuuq' i xaloq'ej taq wii' i tiyoox, eh ruuk' i re' xach'uwarisaj taq wach i je' kaxáro xnub'an taq awuuk'. Eh re' re' ma' jank'al ta imb'aan, eh ma' naa ta wo' chik rub'aan chi jumpech. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taq i hat xa chih taq chaloq i oro i plata xnusiij taq aweh i hin, ruuk' i re' xayejaa' taq i winaq tiyoox. Ruuk' i kilooq'jiik i re' xach'uwarisaj taq wach i je' kaxáro xnub'an taq awuuk'. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh ruuk' taq i holohaq so' xoyimaj paam xnuyeew taq aweh xa tiq'aa' taq aatiyoox, eh xayeew taq chi amayiij chikiwach i nu aseite, i nu insensia. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' i kaxlanwi'k chi hoj laj arina ruyej-aal, ruch'ihil aseite, ruch'ihil i riiskaab', nuye'em naq chi k'uxumb'al taq aweh xayeew taq chi ink'ohnik laj mayiij chikiwach taqe i tiyoox, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh xachop taq chaloq i awak'uun awixq'uun nuye'em taq aweh xayeew taq chi mayiij chikiwach i tiyoox k'uxumb'al keh noq xakapaaj taq. ¿Mi ma' manlik taq aweh re' i je' k'oyomal taq xa a'n? <verse number="21" style="v" />¿Chib'ih reet noq xayok' taq kalaq i wak'uun wixq'uun, eh xayeew taq chi ak'atoj mayiij chikiwach taqe i tiyoox re' re'? <verse number="22" style="v" />Ruum i ruyib'kiil taq wach ana'ojb'al, ruum i je' k'oyomal taq xa a'n ma' nk'ulik ta chik taq panak'ux jank'al taq xat nureq chaloq chi je' taq atolem awiib' pan akik'eel xakimik naq taq chik aweh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili xnuq'or: Re' taq i hat xti xiik' wo' chik naah ti'kiil taq i naa ak'ulum ruum xa a'n taq ayiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh xayejaa' taq anajt naah ye'aab', xayejaa' taq artaal xa aha' chupaam taqe i ye'aab'. Ar taq i xaloq'ej i tiyoox. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh xayejaa' taq inajt kinaah ye'aab' pantaq ju' b'eeh, ar taq xa a'n i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, ruum taq aholwochiil xaq'asaj taq awiib' keh nik' nimaal i ki-ik'ik taq ilwoq aweh, xa tiq taq naah i je' k'oyomal taq xa a'n <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' taq i hat xa a'n taq i je' k'oyomal ruuk' taq aka'jaah re' taqe i aj Egipto re' i kow kiib' chub'anariik i re'. Xa nayeew taq chik ak'ux chub'aan i je' k'oyomal, ruuk' i re' xajosaj taq wach i nujosq'iil. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' hin i nuyeew taq i nuq'ab' cha naah reh i rub'anariik taq aweh i ti' k'axik, xwesaj taq chawach i chib'ih taq aweh. Eh xatnuq'asaj taq pan kiq'ab' i aj filisteo re' taqe i ki-ixowanik taq awach, ni xata re' taqe re' imponik chikiwach i k'ixb'ilaal laj na'ojb'al taq i na a'n. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ma' xch'iklojik ta taq ak'ux ruuk' taq i xa a'n re' re' xa na a'n la' wo' taq i je' k'oyomal kuuk' i aj asirio, ni xata naq ruuk' i re' ch'iklojik taq ak'ux. <verse number="29" style="v" />Xiik' wo' chik naah yib'kiil wach i na'ojb'al taq xa a'n, re' i je' k'oyomal taq xa a'n kuuk' i aj Canaán, je' wo' kuuk' i aj Babilonia, eh xama' xch'iklojik ta wo' taq ak'ux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios xnuq'or taq aweh: Chi yowaab' taq awánima chub'anariik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al re' re', je' rukab' i rub'aan i k'oyoom laj ixoq i ruk'ayej riib' ma' nk'ixik ta chub'anariik. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taq i hat inayejaa' taq najt kinaah ye'aab' pantaq ju' b'eeh, inayejaa' taq i artaal inkimol wii' kiib' i tinamit inkiloq'ej wii' taqe i tiyoox, inki a'n wii' i je' k'oyomal. Re' taq i hat i na a'n taq i je' k'oyomal xa re' la' ma' ntojarik ta taq aweh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' taq i hat i je' taq akab' ixoq ma' korik ta wach ruk'ux i ruk'at rooq i rub'ahiil ruuk' i tokoom winaq. <verse number="33" style="v" />Chu'nchel i k'oyoom laj ixoq intojarik keh noq imb'aan i mahk kuuk', eh re' taq i hat, re' taq chik i hat ti sihinik chib'ih keh i na a'n taq wii' i je' k'oyomal. Eh inatoj taq keh i kichaliik xa aha' yuuq' chub'anariik i re' taq awuuk'. <verse number="34" style="v" />Re' i rujal k'isiin taq i na a'n i hat, re' chi ma' tisik'arik ta taq, re' la' taq i hat tiooj chi kisik'ariik, eh ma' inkitoj ta taq aweh, je' k'oyomal inki a'n taq awuuk'. Ma' je' ta rukab' inki a'n i k'oyoom laj ixoq noq imb'aan i k'oyomal kuuk' intojarik keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' taq i hat i je' taq hat k'oyoom laj ixoq, chab'iraj i naa nuq'orom taq aweh chi je' wili: <verse number="36" style="v" />Re' taq i hat xak'uhtaaj taq ak'ixb'ilaal, je' naa xat'usaa' taq awiib' noq xa a'n taq i je' k'oyomal kuuk' i tokoom. Xelik wach saqum taq i xa a'n. Ruuk' taqe i kilooqjiik i tiyoox xiik' naah yib'kiil kiwach. Eh ruuk' i kikanteesjiik taqe i aawak'uun xa a'n xayeew taq chi amayiij chikiwach taqe i tiyoox re' re'. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin naa numolom kiwach chu'nchel i xa a'n taq wii' i je' k'oyomal i xach'ikaa' taq wii' ak'ux. Naa wo' numolom kiwach chu'nchel taq i xak'ax taqe i xawixow taq kiwach, reh chi naakilom chi naa wesam taq aso' chawiij, je' nanaa akahniik taq chi t'usulkaat chi jumpech. <verse number="38" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik taq cha naah ruum i je' k'oyomal taq i na a'n, eh ruum ikaansanik taq i na a'n. Eh ruum i nujosq'iil, ruum chi ti' inwik'raaj taq i na a'n naa taq kaat nuq'asam pankimik. <verse number="39" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq kaat nuq'asam pan kiq'ab' i tinamit re' re' reh chi naa ruyojiik taq aaye'aab' najt naah re' i xa a'n taq wii' i je' k'oyomal, je' naa naa rehtesjiik taq aso' chawiij, naa ruq'uchariik taq aweh chu'nchel inaxoyej naq taq wii' awiib', naa akahniik taq chi t'usulkaat. <verse number="40" style="v" />Eh naakimolom cho wach i tinamit chub'anariik taq aweh, naa taq akutariik chi ab'aj, eh naa taq akanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="41" style="v" />Eh naa ruk'atariik taq aapaat, ma' k'isiin taqe ixoq naa kilwiik reh noq naa taq aye'ariik chutojariik aamahk. Reh chi nee taq inakanaa' rub'aan i je' k'oyomal, ma' nee ta chik taq inatoj i tokoom i na a'n taq wii' i je' k'oyomal. <verse number="42" style="v" />Ruum taqe re' naa rukuxiik wik'sam i nujosq'iil taq cha naah. Naa rik'iik panuk'ux taq i naa a'nam, ruum naa rik'iik i nujosq'iil taq cha naah. <verse number="43" style="v" />Re' taq i hat ma' xk'ulik ta chik taq panak'ux i otob'il xnub'an taq chaaweh pan ak'isinal, xajosaj la' taq wach i nujosq'iil ruuk' i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach na'ojb'al taq xa a'n Ruum aj re', re' hin naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik taq amahk ruum i re', inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Re' hat Jerusaleem inooj eloq wach awuuk' i jalwaach q'orik inq'orarik chi je' wili: Nik' wach i runa'ojb'al i tuutb'ees je' wo' chik re' i runa'ojb'al i ixq'uunb'ees. <verse number="45" style="v" />Re' hat je' akab' i tuutb'ees i rixowaaj wach i rub'ahiil, je' wo' taqe i rak'uun rixq'uun. Eh re' taqe awanaab' noq inkixowaaj wach i kib'ahiil, je' wo' taqe i kak'uun qixq'uun. Eh re' aatuut aj heteo, eh re' awajaaw aj amorreo. <verse number="46" style="v" />Eh re' i aasb'ees awanaab' taq noq wilik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij wilik, re' i Samaria haa' taqe i kok' tinamit ruchopom naah. Eh re' i chaaq'b'ees awanaab' noq wilik ar wilik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, re' i Sodoma, haa' taqe i kok' tinamit ruchopom naah. <verse number="47" style="v" />Re' hat Jerusaleem xa a'n aweh i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i tinamit re' re' Eh ma' ch'iklojik ta ak'ux ruuk' i re'. Xti xiik' wo' chik naah i yiib' wach i na'ojb'al i na a'n i hat chuwach i xkian tinamit re' re'. <verse number="48" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi ni xata re' i Sodoma awanaab' taq noq wilik, ruch'ihil i kok' tinamit ruchopom naah xb'anik reh i yiib' wach taq xa a'n i hat, i xkian i kok' tinamit achopom taq naah. <verse number="49" style="v" />Re' wili i mahk xkian awanaab' noq wilik, re' i Sodoma, haa' taqe kok' tinamit ruchopom naah. Re' chi q'e' inkinimb'isaj kiib' chi wilik k'uxumb'al keh, re' chi q'e' suq wilkeeb'. Xa re' la' xama' kitob'eej ta wo' i neb'aa', taqe i ti' wilkeeb'. <verse number="50" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Sodoma inkinimb'isaj kiwach, xkian i yiib' wach na'ojb'al ma' imponik ta chi nuwach i hin. Ruum aj re' xnusach kiwach chi jumpech. <verse number="51" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Samaria ma' xkian ta yejaal-oq i mahk je' rukab' i xa a'n taq i hat. Re' taq i hat xti xiik' wo' chik naah yib'kiil wach i na'ojb'al taq xa a'n. Re' taqe i aj Samaria ma' q'e' taj i kimahk i keh chuwach amahk taq i hat. <verse number="52" style="v" />Re' taq i hat naa ruchaliik taq ak'ixiik ruum xiik' naah yib'kiil wach ana'ojb'al taq xa a'n chuwach i xkian i aj Samaria. Re' keh ma' q'e' taj i kimahk chuwach i xa a'n taq i hat, ruum ti xiik' wo' chik naah yib'kiil wach xa a'n taq i hat. Ruum i re' naa nuk'uhtaam taq ak'ixb'ilaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Re' hin naa wo' chik nuye'em q'ab' keh i aj Sodoma, i aj Samaria haa' taqe i kok' tinamit kichopom naah naakeliik korik. Eh je' wo' taq i hat naa wo' chik taq aweliik korik. <verse number="54" style="v" />Xa re' la' koruman chi naa taq akuyum i ti' k'axik, naa taq ruk'uhtjiik ak'ixb'ilaal, ruuk' taq i xa a'n, ruuk' i re' naa ruch'iklojiik kik'ux i keh. Eh awuum taq i hat naa rusuuqb'iik kik'ux i keh. <verse number="55" style="v" />Eh re' i Sodoma, i Samaria haa' i kok' tinamit kichopom naah xkireq wo' chik chi je' rukab' i pampeet, je' wo' taq i hat haa' i kok' tinamit achopom taq naah naa wo' chik taq areqem chi je' rukab' i pampeet. <verse number="56" style="v" />Re' taq i hat noq xiik' naq naah nimaal taq awach i na a'n awiib' xa naase'laaj naq taq i ti' k'axik inkik'ul i aj Sodoma awanaab' taq noq wilik. <verse number="57" style="v" />Je' naq re' taq i na a'n noq komajaa' naq inteh wach taq ayiib' wach na'ojb'al. Eh yu'naak taq i hat re' taqe i aj edomita, re' taqe i aj filisteo, eh re' taqe i tinamit wilik taq chaka'jaah kib'ajwik taq aweh, eh chu'nchel i tinamit ma' nkaaj ta taq awach. <verse number="58" style="v" />Re' taq i hat inchol taq akuyum ransil i ti' k'axik, ruum ma' holohik ta taq i na a'n xiik' naah yib'kiil wach, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi naa taq kaat nuye'em chutojariik taq aamahk je' rukab' i ruk'ul taq cha weh. Ruum ma' xa a'n ta taq i xaq'or taq i korik chi naa naq a'nam, re' i xqayejaa' taq wach awuuk'. <verse number="60" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin xa ko wilik wo' panuk'ux chib'ih i xqayejaa' taq cho wach awuuk' pan ak'isinal. Xa re' la' wilik wo' chik i naa nuyejaam wach taq awuuk' chi naaqa'nam. <verse number="61" style="v" />Eh naa ruk'uliik taq panak'ux i yiib' wach taq xa a'n naa ruchaliik taq ak'ixiik noq naa nuq'asam chi je' taq awixq'uun i Samaria, re' i aawas taq noq wilik. Eh noq naa nuq'asam taq chi awixq'uun i Sodoma, i achaaq' taq noq wilik, atoob' ta ma' nuyejaam wach taq awuuk'. <verse number="62" style="v" />Re' hin jinaj chik i naaqayejaam wach taq awuuk' chi naaqa'nam, ruuk' i re' naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="63" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq nukuyum amahk xa re' la' naa ruk'uliik taq cho panak'ux i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach na'ojb'al taq xa a'n naa ruchaliik taq ak'ixiik, ruum ma' naa ta chik taq animb'isam awiib' ruuk' aq'oral, inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i jalwaach q'orik chi riij i xihk, eh chi riij i ruche'el i uuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or i jalwaach q'orik wili keh i aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Je' wili i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Jinaj i nimlaj xihk</para>
  <para style="q">xa nimaq chik i ruxiik' xakow chik inrupinik,</para>
  <para style="q">k'ih wach xoyb'al paam i riij xponik ar Líbano,</para>
  <para style="q">eh xich'uq i rikuun i chakaltee'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xutoq wo' i nimlaj q'ab' i chee' re' re',</para>
  <para style="q">xuk'am reje chupaam i kitinamiit i aj yakool,</para>
  <para style="q">ar ponik rutik chupaam i tinamit wilik wii' i ma' k'isa yak.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chi riij i re'</para>
  <para style="q">xichop i rija'eel i uuva xutik chupaam i jinaj i holohik laj ye'aab'</para>
  <para style="q">chi chii' i nim ha',</para>
  <para style="q">reh chi naa naq ruk'ihiik korehtaal imponik chi nimlaj chee'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i ja' xpoq' korehtaal xponik chi nimlaj ruche'el uuva.</para>
  <para style="q">Atoob' ta ma' q'e' ta najt naah xponik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' q'ab' xuhel reje riib'</para>
  <para style="q">chupaam i tinamit wilik wii' i nimlaj xihik.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' uuva noq xuk'am raa' ma' k'isiin taj i q'ab', i xaq xelik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh jinaj wo' chik i mama' xihk xa nimaq chik i ruxiik'</para>
  <para style="q">ma' k'isiin i riij xakow chik inrupinik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' i ruche'el i uuva xuk'am raa' xuhel reje riib' i q'ab'</para>
  <para style="q">chupaam i ye'aab' wilik wii' i xihk re' re'</para>
  <para style="q">reh chi re' naq i reh narut'aqsaniik cho reh i tikooj wii'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' i uuva re' re' holohik ak'al wo' naq tikooj wii'</para>
  <para style="q">chi chii' i nim ha' re' naq i naa ruk'ihaaxb'iik wii' i q'ab', naa naq ruwachiniik</para>
  <para style="q">naa naq rusutiniik chi holohik laj uuva.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hat je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">¿Mi naa reliik korik re' i ruche'el i uuva re' re'?</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi ma' re' re' peet xihk naa ruchuqwiik reje reh,</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruhilem wach ak'al i wach naa ruchiqsam i xaq?</para>
  <para style="q">Re' re' xama' yohb'aal ta wo' wach kajaawriik,</para>
  <para style="q">xama' k'ih ta wo' naa ruchuqwiik reh i raa'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atoob' ta nee wo' chik inkitik ruka'peech</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi nee nelik korik re' i tik wili?</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi ma' naa ruchiqiik re' ruum i tz'a'laj teew naa ruchaliik parelb'aal q'iij?</para>
  <para style="q">Manlik naq xa rax chik wach noq naa ruchiqiik, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hat cha pahqaaj keh i aj Israel ma' kinimanik taj mix kireq chi riij i jalwaach q'orik xaq'or keh, je' wili iraaj ruq'orom. Re' chi re' i kireey i aj Babilonia naa ruchaliik Jerusaleem naa ruchopom i kireey i aj Judá, haa' taqe i nimaq wach kikamaj naa ruk'amam taqe reje chi riij Babilonia. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh naa rupab'aam jinaj i reey ma' tokoom ta ruuk' i kireey i aj Judá naa ruminim chupaam chi naa ruq'orom i xti korik chi naa ruq'orom reh chi naa ruk'amam taqe reje panti' k'axik i nimaq wach kikamaj. <verse number="14" style="v" />Reh chi naa kikahniik i aj Judá chi ma' xta chik rukowiil. Eh ma' naa ta chik keliik korik, xa re' wo' noq neen kichop kik'ux chub'aan i xq'orarik keh nee kielik korik. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i reey ma' naa ta runimam i kireey i aj Babilonia naa la' rutaq'aam reje i taqareel ruuk' i kireey i aj Egipto chupahqaljiik i ma' k'isa kawáyu, i ma' k'isa soldado ko'len reh. ¿Mi konee nelik korik i reey imb'anik reh i je' re'? ¿Mi neeruko'leej riij i ruk'achariik i ma' xub'an taj i ruq'orom chik i xti korik chi naa rub'anam? <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi re' i kireey i aj Judá ar naa rojiik kimoq Babilonia, ruum ma' naa ta rub'anam i naa nuq'orom xti korik chi naa rub'anam. Eh ma' naa ta rub'anam i naa kiyejaam wach ruuk' i kireey i aj Babilonia naa rukojwiik reh chi reyil. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq re' i kireey i aj Babilonia naa ruchaliik rub'anam reh i tinamit Jerusaleem naa rukotem riij naa ruyejaam ruye'aab' chub'an reh, noq naa rukansam i ma' k'isa tinamit. Re' i kireey i aj Egipto xama' naa ta wo' rutaq'aam chaloq chuko'ljiik. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruum re' reh xama' naa ta wo' rub'anam i naa ruq'orom i xti korik chi naa rub'anam, xama' naa ta wo' rub'anam i naa rukorjiik wach, ruum chi je' re' i naa rub'anam ma' naa ta ruko'leem riij i ruk'achariik. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi ma' xub'an taj aha' naq wilik nuq'orom i xti korik chi naa rub'anam re' qayejaa' wach ruuk'. Ruum aj re' re' hin naa nuye'em chutojariik i ru mahk chi riij i xub'an. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hin k'ul naa nuq'atam chuwach noq naa nuchopom, panya'al wilik noq naa nuk'amam reje Babilonia ar naa nuq'atam i q'orik chinaah, ruum ma' xub'an taj i xnuq'or reh chi naa rub'anam. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i ru soldado xiik' naah kikowiil naa rukuxiik kikimiik panq'aq'inik, eh re' taqe i ma' naa ta kikimiik naa rutuukjiik reje kiwach xa aha' yuuq'. Chi je' re' naa kinab'eem i keh chi re' hin i Dios xinq'orik keh i wili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin i Dios i nuq'or wo' hoq,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">chi jinaj i naawuksam chinaah i yuuq' Israel</para>
  <para style="q">je' naa naa nuch'uqum i rikuun i chee' chakaltee'</para>
  <para style="q">re' hin je' naa naa nutikim chinaah inajt naah yuuq'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chinaah inajt naah yuuq' wilik Israel naa ruk'ihaaxb'iik i q'ab',</para>
  <para style="q">naa rub'anam wach korehtaal imponik chi je' jinaj nimlaj chee' chakaltee' q'e' holohik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ruk'ihaal b'uhr wach i tz'ikin</para>
  <para style="q">naa kiyejaam kisuuq' chinaah taqe i q'ab'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu'nchel i je' chee' panch'ahn naa kinab'eem chi re' hin Dios.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa wesam i runimaal wach i je' chee' nim wach.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' i je' chee' ma' nim ta wach naa nuye'em runimaal wach.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa nuchiqsam i je' i rax chee',</para>
  <para style="q">eh re' i je' chiq chee' naa nuraxb'isam wach, re' wili naa rojiik eloq wach inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Awach i naa rub'aniik i mahk re' wo' reh naa rukanteesjiik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />¿Chib'ih reet noq ma' nakanaa' ta taq ruq'orariik i q'orik wili i hat taq aj Israel</para>
  <para style="q">Noq re' taqe i tuutb'ees ajaab'ees inkik'ux i ch'amlaj uuva</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i kak'uun kixq'uun i nelik chi q'aah i keeh, inki taqe?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hin i k'achlik Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi ma' jaruuj taq chik naa aq'orom i jalwaach q'orik re' re' ayu' Israel. <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu'nchel i tinamit, weh hin taqe, chi je' taqe i tuutb'ees, ajaab'ees chi je' taqe ak'uunb'ees ixq'uunb'ees ruum aj re' awach imb'anik reh i mahk re' wo' re' naa rukanteesjiik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' winaq korik wach i ruk'ux, re' rub'ehel, re' korik i rub'an. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ma' ruk'ux ta reh i k'uxb'al wi'k inye'arik chi mayiij naah taq yuuq', ma' ruyeew ta ruk'ux chikinaah i kitiyoox i aj Israel. Eh ma' ruq'uch taj i rehk'een i ras ruchaaq', eh ma' inwirik ta ruuk' i rehk'een noq k'ahchi' i ruyab'ilaal reh i rupooh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh ma' awach taj i ruyeew chi ti' k'axik, noq inkanab'jik reh i xa chib'ih jariik chi riij i kemeel imb'aan ruuk', i ruq'asaj wo' chik reh i aj kemeel. Ma' awach taj i relq'aaj i chib'ih reh, eh i runej i ruwa' ruhaa' i ma' xta ruwa' ruhaa', i ruyeew ruso' i ma' xta ruso'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh noq ruyeew chi kemeel i rutumiin ma' rupahqaaj ta tojb'al riij, ma' awach taj i rujot'. Eh parub'ehel i ruq'at i q'orik chikinaah i ki'ib' chi aj peleto. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh i rub'an taqe i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, eh rub'an chi korik chu'nchel i nuq'or reh. Re' winaq re' re' xti korik wach ruk'ux ruum aj re' naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik. Re' wili korik ruum re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' winaq re' re' korik wach ruk'ux. Wila' wilik jino'q rak'uun aj jileq', aj kaansoom, i rub'an taqe ma' holohik taj re' i ma' jank'al ta rub'an i rajaaw. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh i ruk'ux reh i k'uxb'al wi'k mayijimaj chikiwach i tiyoox nah taq yuuq', eh i ruq'uch i rehk'een i ras ruchaaq'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh rub'an i ti' k'axik keh i neb'aa', je' wo' taqe i ma' xta wilik keh, eh i rub'an i leq', ma' ruq'asaj ta chik i xa chib'ih jariik inkanab'jik reh chi riij i kemeel imb'aan ruuk'. Eh i ruloq'ej taqe i tiyoox, i rub'an taqe i ma' holohik taj. <verse number="13" style="v" />Noq i ruyeew chi kemeel i rutumiin k'ih i kemelb'al riij i rupahqaaj. Re' ak'uunb'ees imb'anik reh i taqe re' ma' naa ta ruk'achariik. Naa la' rukanteesjiik ruum taqe i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xub'an, xa re' reh naa ruk'amwiik' chaloq i rukimiik chinaah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' winaq re' re' ma' holohik ta imb'anik, wila' wilik jino'q rak'uun nee rilow i mahk i rub'an i rajaaw, eh ma' xub'an ta ree reh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh ma' ruk'ux ta reh i k'uxb'al wi'k mayijimaj nah taq yuuq', ma' ruyeew ta ruk'ux chikinaah i kitiyoox i aj Israel, eh ma' ruq'uch taj rehk'een i ras ruchaaq'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ma' awach taj i ruyeew chi ti' k'axik, ma' xtaj i rupahqaaj chinkanab'jik ruuk' chi riij i kemeel imb'aan ruuk'. Eh ma' awach taj i relq'aaj chib'ih reh i runej i ruwa' ruhaa' i ma' xta ruwa' ruhaa' i ruyeew ruso' i ma' xta ruso'. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq i ruyeew chi kemeel i rutumiin, ma' rupahqaaj ta tojb'al riij, i rub'an taqe i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, eh rub'an chu'nchel i nuq'or reh. Re' ak'uunb'ees re' re' ma' naa ta rukanteesjiik ruum i ru mahk i rajaaw xti korik la' chi naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' rajaaw naa rukanteesjiik ruum i ru mahk xub'an, ruum chi xub'an i ma' holohik taj, xub'an i leq', xub'an i yiib' wach na'ojb'al chi xilak i rutinamiit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat neena taq inaq'or chi je' wili: Eh ¿Chib'ih reet noq re' ak'uunb'ees ma' nee ta rutoj riij i ru mahk i rajaaw? tiko'q taq. Ma' nee ta rutoj riij i ru mahk i rajaaw ruum xub'an i rub'ehel, i korik, xub'an taqe i ruq'or nuk'uhb'aal. Ruum aj re' xti korik noq naa ruk'achariik. <verse number="20" style="v" />Awach imb'anik reh mahk re' wo' re' naa rukanteesjiik, re' ak'uunb'ees ma' nee ta rutoj riij i ru mahk i rajaaw. Ni xata re' ajaab'ees neerutoj riij i ru mahk i rak'uun. Re' korik wach ruk'ux naa ruk'ulum i rukooch. Eh re' i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al re' wo' tojb'al ru mahk naa ruk'ulum.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios parub'ehel i rub'an i q'ataj q'orik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 33:10-20">Ez 33.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh wila' re' yiib' wach runa'ojb'al xukanaa' chu'nchel i mahk, re' chik neerub'an chu'nchel i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, je' wo' hoq i rub'ehel chi b'anarik, xti korik i nuq'or chi naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik ma' naa ta rukanteesjiik. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' hin ma' naa ta chik ruk'uliik cho panuk'ux chu'nchel i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xub'an naa la' ruwihiik ruk'achariik ruum i rub'anariik i korik. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin ma' inwaaj ta chi neenkimik parumahk i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al, inwaaj la' chi neerujal wach i runa'ojb'al, chi je' re' neen wihik ruk'achariik, inki i Dios. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh wila' re' korik wach ruk'ux xukanaa' wo' chik rub'aan i korik, xutoq'aa' wo' chik rub'aan chu'nchel i ma' holohik taj, je' rukab' inki a'n i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al. Re' reh ma' naa ta ruwihiik ruk'achariik. Re' hin ma' naa ta chik ruk'uliik panuk'ux chu'nchel i holohik xub'an, naa la' rukanteesjiik ruum taqe i ru mahk xub'an wo' chik ruka'peech.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' taq i hat naq'or taq chi ma' re' ta rub'ehel i nub'an, xa re' la' chab'iraj taq i naa nuq'orom aweh taq i hat aj Israel, i hat inakapaaj taq chi re' hin ma' re' ta rub'ehel i nub'an. Xanaah re', re' taq i hat ma' rub'ehel ta taq i k'ahchi' kaat. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i korik wach ruk'ux xukanaa' wo' chik rub'aan i holohik nee wo' chik i rub'aan i yiib' wach, re' reh naa rukanteesjiik ruum i ruyiib' wach na'ojb'al xub'an wo' chik ruka'peech. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al xukanaa' rub'aan i yiib' wach chi b'anarik, eh re' chik i rub'ehel, re' chik i korik neerub'an. Re' reh naa ruko'leem riij i ruk'achariik. <verse number="28" style="v" />Wila' xukoj rehtaal chi korik, nee rukanaa' rub'an chu'nchel i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Re' reh xti korik noq naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik ma' naa ta rukanteesjiik. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taq i hat aj Israel naa taq aq'orom chi ma' re' ta rub'ehel i k'ahchi' nub'anam xanaah re' ma' nakoj ta taq rehtaal chi re' taq i hat ma' rub'ehel ta taq i k'ahchi' kaat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' hin inuq'at i q'orik cha naah taq i hat aj Israel re' q'oreel chib'ih taq i xa a'n chib'ih taq i xaq'or. Re' hin i Dios korik i nuq'or taq aweh chi chayot' taq ak'ux, eh cha kanaa' taq rub'aan ayiib' wach na'ojb'al, reh chi ma' nee ta taq insacharik awach ruum taq amahk. <verse number="31" style="v" />Chakanaa' taq rub'aan chu'nchel i xat mahkunik taq wii' chi nuwach, chayeew taq q'ab' chi neen ak'b'ik taq awánima, je' wo' taq ak'achariik. Ruum wi ma' xa a'n taq i re' taq i hat aj Israel naa taq akanteesjiik. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' hin ma' inwaaj taj chi awach i neenkimik parumahk, inwaaj la' chi neenayot' taq ak'ux chi riij taq amahk, reh chi neen wihik taq ak'achariik, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruti'kiil k'uxliis chikiij i kireey i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq cha tz'uyej i tz'uuy reh ruti'kiil k'uxliis keh i kireey i aj Israel, <verse number="2" style="v" />je' wili i cha q'or keh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' i Jerusaleem atuut noq wilik, je' ixoq kaq b'ahlam,</para>
  <para style="q">eh chi kixilak i je' kaq b'ahlam xuk'isaj taqe</para>
  <para style="q">i ki'ib' chi kok' rak'uun jinaj keh i re', re' i Joacaz.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Xuk'isaj chi korik korehtaal,</para>
  <para style="q">xponik chi je' rukab' i nimlaj kaq b'ahlam</para>
  <para style="q">i rub'an chik ruchopariik rutiib' i ruk'ux chik taqe i winaq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i tokoom tinamit xkib'iraj rib'iral</para>
  <para style="q">i rub'an k'ul xkiq'at chuwach,</para>
  <para style="q">je' naa xkikoj ruxirob'aal noq kichop.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh b'ak'lik wach chi karena noq xkik'am reje Egipto.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noq xrilow i je' ixoq kaq b'ahlam chi ma' xelik ta korik</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i xukapaaj naq rub'aan.</para>
  <para style="q">Xusik' wo' chik jinaj i k'isa rak'uun, re' Joaquín,</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal xuk'isaj xureq wo' chik i runimaal.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xponik chik chi je' nimlaj kaq b'ahlam,</para>
  <para style="q">xak'ul chik inooj chi kixilak i je' kaq b'ahlam,</para>
  <para style="q">xutijej chik ruchopariik i rutiib'</para>
  <para style="q">i ruk'ux chik taqe i winaq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh yohb'aal wach i leq' xub'an</para>
  <para style="q">chupaam i paat imb'aan wii' i taaq'anik</para>
  <para style="q">xkuxik rusacham wach i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh noq xuk'er chii' xiyo'jik i tinamit ruum.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ruum i re' xchalik b'anroq reh</para>
  <para style="q">kuum i tinamit wilkeeb' reje chi junsuut,</para>
  <para style="q">xkiq'at chuwach je' naa</para>
  <para style="q">xq'ehb'ik pan xirob' noq xkichop.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh b'ak'lik wach chi karena</para>
  <para style="q">noq xkik'am reje chuwach i kireey i aj Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q">xkiyeew pantz'ilom reh chi ma' naa ta chik</para>
  <para style="q">rib'irjiik chi k'erik chii' chinaah i yuuq' Israel.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' i Jerusaleem i atuut taq noq wilik</para>
  <para style="q">je' naq rukab' i juniwal chi uuva</para>
  <para style="q">tikooj chii' rooq ha' ma' k'isiin i q'ab' i ruyeew,</para>
  <para style="q">eh inwachinik chi korik ruum xa eliik wilik ruha'iil.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh kow i q'ab' xi elik</para>
  <para style="q">xkamanik chi kikarote i reey,</para>
  <para style="q">yohb'aal wach najtiil naah xponik,</para>
  <para style="q">yohb'aal wach i q'ab', je' wo' hoq i xaq.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh chu'nchel i tinamit xi ilwik reh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' i je' juniwal chi uuva re' re' xk'ulik chuqaroq</para>
  <para style="q">xq'eb'arik wach ak'al ruum</para>
  <para style="q">i je' kowlaj teew inchalik parelb'aal q'iij,</para>
  <para style="q">xq'ehb'ik taqe wach,</para>
  <para style="q">eh xchiqik taqe i kowlaj q'ab' i xk'atarik wach q'aaq'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh yu'naak i je' juniwal chi uuva re' re' je' naa panchiq</para>
  <para style="q">ak'al tikooj ma' xta ruha'iil.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh nah taq q'ab' i nelik reje i q'aaq'</para>
  <para style="q">ink'atwik reh xaq, ruch'ihil i wach.</para>
  <para style="q">Ma' jino'q chik i kowlaj q'ab' xkamanik chi kikarote i reey</para>
  <para style="q">tiko'q keh, panatz'uuy, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">Re' i tz'uuy wili reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis naa rukamaniik wii'.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios korik wach ruk'ux, eh re' taqe i aj Israel ma' xinimanik taj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh lajeeb' chik q'iij ruk'amam rub'eeh i roo' poh ree i ruwuuq haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia, wilik taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel xiooj k'oloq chupahqaljiik kina'ojb'al reh i QaJaaw Dios xkitzunaa' i koq kiib' chi nuwach. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="3" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or keh i aj Israel re' re'. Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: ¿Mi wilik re' i xchalik kipahqaaj weh? Re' hin i Dios ma' nee ta nuchaq'weej keh inaakipahqaam tiko'q keh, inki. <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq chaq'at i q'orik chikinaah i hat. Chaq'or keh nik' nimaal i yiib' wach na'ojb'al kianam chaloq i kimaam kati't. <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' hin xnuq'or i korik noq xnusik' cho kiwach i kimaam kati't i aj Israel. Eh xnuk'uhtaaj i wajaawriik kuuk' noq wilkeeb' cho ar Egipto. Xnuq'or keh i xti korik chi xa re' wo' hin i Dios. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re' xnuq'or keh i xti korik chi naa taqe wesam chaloq Egipto. Eh chi ar chik taqe naa nuk'amam reje chupaam i ye'aab' nusik'im wach chi keh xiik' nah holwochiil chikiwach chu'nchel i ye'aab', re' i wilik wii' chu'nchel i suq atoob'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin xnuq'or keh chi kiju'junaal chi naa kisacham wach i kitiyoox. Eh chi ma' naa ta chik kich'uwa' risam kiib' ruuk' i kilooq'jiik i kitiyoox, i aj Egipto. Xnuq'or wo' keh chi xa re' hin naa kiin kikojom chi ki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' keh xkija'wachej kiib' chi nuwach, ma' xinkinimaj taj. Xa ma' xkisach ta wo' wach i kitiyoox q'e' yiib' kiwach. Eh xama' xkikanaa' ta wo' rulooq'jiik i kitiyoox i aj Egipto. Ruum taqe re' xnuq'or naq chi naa nuye'em ti' k'axik chikinaah ar Egipto korehtaal naq naa wik'sam i nujosq'iil chikinaah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin xama' xnuyeew ta wo' taqe panti' k'axik, ruum ma' xwaaj taj chi xkesaj i wajaawriik i aj Egipto wilkeeb' naq cho wii', ruum xkib'iraj wo' keh noq xnuq'or cho keh i aj Israel chi naa wesam taqe chaloq Egipto. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' hin xwesaj wo' taqe chaloq i Egipto xnuk'am taqe chaloq panchiq yuuq'. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh ar xnuyeew keh chi naab'jik i nuk'uhb'aal, eh chi awach naa rub'aniik reh i nuq'or naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik. <verse number="12" style="v" />Xnuyeew wo' keh chi naab'jik chi naakiye'em ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij, rehtalil naq chi naa kianam i xnuyejaa' wach kuuk'. Eh reh naq chi naa ruk'uliik pankik'ux chi re' hin kinye'wik kisantohiil. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel xkija'wachej kiib' chi nuwach chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' ma' xkinimaj taj i nuk'uhb'aal, ma' xkian taj i xnuq'or keh. Eh xnuq'or wo' keh chi wila' xkian i xnuq'or keh naa ruwihiik kik'achariik. Eh ma' xkiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'ij, ruum taqe re' xwaaj naq wik'sam i nujosq'iil, xwaaj naq nusacham kiwach chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. <verse number="14" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin xama' xnusach ta wo' kiwach, ruum ma' xwaaj taj chi xkesaj i wajaawriik i taqe i nimaq tinamit, re' taqe i x-ilwik reh chi xwesaj taqe chaloq i aj Israel ar Egipto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xnuq'or wo' keh chi ma' naa ta kokiik chupaam i ye'aab' nusik'im cho wach chi keh. Re' i ye'aab' xiik' naah holwochiil chikiwach chu'nchel i ye'aab', re' i wilik wii' chu'nchel i suq atoob'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Je' re' i xnuq'or keh ruum ma' xponik ta chikiwach i nuk'uhb'aal, eh ma' xkinimaj taj i xnuq'or keh. Eh ma' xkiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij, ruuk' chik taqe i tiyoox xkiyeew i kánima. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' hin xnukuy wo' kimahk, eh xnuketelaaj kiwach xama' xnusach ta wo' kiwach chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. <verse number="18" style="v" />Noq wilkeeb' panchiq yuuq' xnuq'or keh i kak'uun kixq'uun chi ma' nkik'am naah i xq'orarik keh, eh chi ma' naa ta kianam i xq'orarik keh kuum i kituut kajaaw. Eh chi ma' naa ta kich'uwarisam kiib' ruuk' taqe i kitiyoox. <verse number="19" style="v" />Xnuq'or wo' keh chi xa re' wo' hin naakiin kikojom chi ki Dios, chi naa kinimam i nuk'uhb'aal, chi naa kianam taqe i nuq'or keh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh chi naakiye'em ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij rehtalil naq chi naa kianam i xqayejaa' wach kuuk', reh naq chi naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' taqe i kak'uun kixq'uun xkija'wachej kiib' chi nuwach, xama' xkinimaj ta wo' taqe i nuk'uhb'aal inye'wik k'acharik, ma' xkian ta wo' taqe i xnuq'or keh, ma' xkiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij. Ruum aj re' xwaaj naq wik'sam i nujosq'iil chikinaah chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xwaaj naq nusacham kiwach. <verse number="22" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin xama' nusach ta wo' kiwach ruum ma' xwaaj ta chi xkesaj i wajaawriik taqe i nimaq tinamit. Re' i xi ilwik reh chi xwesaj taqe chaloq i aj Israel Egipto. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xnuq'or wo' keh i korik chi naa nutukem kiwach chupaam taqe nimaq tinamit wilkeeb' sut i wach ak'al. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ruum ma' xkinimaj taj i xnuq'or keh, eh ma' xponik ta panaq'kiwach i nuk'uhb'aal. Eh ma' xkiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij, xa re' chik i kilooqjiik taqe i tiyoox xkian, re' wo' xkiloq'ej chaloq i kituut kajaaw. <verse number="25" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin xnuyeew q'ab' chi xkinimaj i k'uhb'aal ma' holohik taj, chi xkian i yiib' wach na'ojb'al ma' inye'wik ta k'achariik. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh xnuyeew wo' q'ab' chi xkich'uwa'risaj kiib' ruuk' i ruye'ariik i kimayiij chikiwach i tiyoox, eh chi xkik'at chi kimayiij i peet kak'uun, reh naq chixiyo'jik, eh chi xkinab'eej chi re' hin i k'achalkiin inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq je' wili i cha q'or keh i aj Israel: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Je' wo' hoq i kimaam kati't i keh xin kiq'eb' wo' chi riij kik'ux xama' xinkinimaj ta wo' chaloq. <verse number="28" style="v" />Noq xnuk'am naq taqe chupaam i holohik ye'aab' re' i nuq'orom i xti korik chi naa naq nuye'em keh noq inkilow wach inajt kinaah yuuq' oon noq inkilow wach jino'q i chee' nim rumuuj ar inkik'at i chikop chi kimayiij. Ruuk' i re' xkijosaj chee nujosq'iil, ar xkik'at chi kimayiij i insensia, xkichihkaaj ink'ohnik laj iq'oom <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' hin je' wili i xnuq'or keh: ¿Mi wilik kajaawriik inajt kinaah yuuq' i nak'at taq wii' aamayiij? Re' i ye'aab' re' re' loq'oomb'al tiyoox i rub'ihnaal, eh je' re' i rub'ihnaal xkahnik chi jumpech.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih reet noq xakok'ahchi' wo' kich'uwa'risam kiib' i keh je' rukab' i xkian chee kimaam kati't xa re' kilooq'jiik taqe i tiyoox inki a'n? <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' keh xkiyeew i kimayiij, eh xkik'at i kak'uun wach q'aaq' chi kimayiij. Eh xakok'ahchi' wo' kich'uwarisam kiib' ruuk' i kilooqjiik taqe i tiyoox. ¿Mi kox chalik kipaqaaj i kina'ojb'al weh re' taqe i aj Israel? Re' hin i k'achlik Dios ma' nee ta nuchaq'weej keh ineenkipaqaaj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' keh xkimin pankinaah je' rukab' inki a'n i tokoom tinamit wilkeeb' wach ak'al kiloq'inik reh taqe i tiyoox chee' eh ab'aj korjinaq wii' ma' ruk'ul ta naq chi naa kianam i je' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' hin i k'achlik Dios, ruuk' i wajaawriik, ruuk' i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em ti' k'axik chikinaah, eh naa nukahniik chi taaq'anik chikinaah. <verse number="34" style="v" />Re' hin ruuk' i wajaawriik ruuk' i nujosq'iil naa wesam taqe chaloq chupaam taqe i tinamit nutukem reje wii' kiwach, naa wo' chik numolom kiwach. <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuk'amam taqe reje chupaam i ye'aab' xa je' chik rukab' i chiq yuuq', ar naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah. <verse number="36" style="v" />Nik' wach noq xnuq'at chee q'orik chikinaah i kimaam kati't panchiq yuuq' noq xwesaj taqe chaloq Egipto. Je' wo' chik re' noq naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah i keh, inki i Dios. <verse number="37" style="v" />Re' hin naa taqe nuye'em chi ri'sil i wajaawriik kow taqe naa numinim chub'anariik xqayejaa' wach kuuk'. <verse number="38" style="v" />Re' hin naa wesam taqe chi kixilak i ma' kinimanik taj, re' taqe i ma' kinimanik ta weh. Naa wesam taqe chaloq chupaam i tinamit k'amooj taqe reje wii' xa re' la' ma' naa ta kokiik chupaam i kiye'aab' i aj Israel. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hat taq aj Israel je' wili i ruq'or i QaJaaw taq chawiij: Yu'naak konkiyeew kik'ux chi looq'jiik i kitiyoox. Xa re' la' naa ruponiik i q'iij chi re' chik i hin naakiin kinimam, ma' naa ta chik kich'uwa'risam wach i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal ruuk' i ruye'ariik i kimayiij chikiwach taqe i tiyoox.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eh koq'uun chik chu'nchel i aj Israel naa kinkiloq'em chupaam i nuSantolaj ye'aab' ar chinaah inajt naah yuuq' Sinaí wilik ar Israel. Re' hin naa rusuuqb'iik nuk'ux kuuk', naa nuq'orom keh chi ar naa kik'amam chee kimayiij chi nuwach, i peet wach i kitik, eh chu'nchel chib'ih jariik i naa kiq'asam weh. <verse number="41" style="v" />Re' hin naa taqe nuk'ulum chi je' ink'ohnik laj mayiij noq naa wesam taqe chaloq pan tokoom tinamit nutukem reje wii' kiwach. Re' hin naa nuk'uhtaam i santohiil chi kixilak reh chi naakilom i wilkeeb' panimaq tinamit. <verse number="42" style="v" />Re' keh naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios noq naa wo' chik nuk'amam taqe cho Israel. Re' i ye'aab' xnuq'or i xti korik chi naa naq nuye'em keh i kimaam kati't. <verse number="43" style="v" />Ar naa kikojom rehtaal i yiib' wach xkian, je' wo' chu'nchel i xkich'uwa'risaj wii' kiib'. Re' keh naa ruchaliik kik'ixiik chi kib'il kiib' ruum taqe i mahk xkian. <verse number="44" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel naa kikojom rehtaal chi re' hin i Dios naa nub'aniik otob'il keh. Ma' ruum ta chi holohik ta kib'anik, naa nub'anam otob'il keh, xa ruum la' i nuk'axb'al naa nub'anam otob'il keh, eh chi naakiye'em runimaal nuwach, tiko'q keh inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i ti' k'axik naa ruk'ulum i rax chee' wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="46" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha sutej reje awach pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, cha q'or rib'iral i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chinaah i rax chee' wilik ar. <verse number="47" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or reje reh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or chawiij: Re' hin naa nuqopom ruq'aq'al naa rukuxiik nuk'atam i chee' wilik chuwach, chi rax chee' chi chiq chee'. Re' i q'aaq' re' re' ma' naa ta ruchuhpiik korehtaal taqe inkuxik ruk'atam, je' i wilkeeb' reje chuwach je' i wilkeeb' reje pansak'aaj pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="48" style="v" />Chu'nchel i tinamit naa kilwiik reh chi re' hin naa nuqopwiik reh, ma' awach ta naa ruchupwiik reh, tiko'q keh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Eh re' hin je' wili xnuq'or: QaJaaw Dios chu'nchel kiq'orik reh chi re' hin xa panjalwaach q'orik kinq'orik, eh chi ma' awach ta inreqwik chi riij, kinki reh.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios xuq'or chi xkiyejaa' chik cho wach i kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' i aj Babilonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha sutej reje awach i wilik wii' i Jerusaleem, cha q'or rib'iral keh panub'ihnaal i hin i ti' k'axik naa ruk'ulum i nupaat. Chaq'or wo' rib'iral i ti' k'axik naakik'ulum i aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' i hin inwixow wach inki a'n ruum aj re' i nuq'or chi naakikanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' chi je' korik wach kik'ux, chi je' taqe aj mahk. <verse number="4" style="v" />Xti korik noq naa kikanteesjiik chi q'aslaj ch'ihch' chi korik wach kik'ux, chi je' taqe aj mahk, ar naa rutohq'iik chaloq pantz'eet reh ireelb'aali q'iij korehtaal imponik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit naakinab'iniik reh chi re' hin i Dios naa nukansaniik keh ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha ch'ikaa' ak'ux chi oq'ik chikiwach i tinamit k'uhtb'al reh chi xiik' naah ti'kiil awánima. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh wila' xkipahqaaj aweh chib'ih reet noq suq tioq'ik cha q'or keh chi ruum chi xab'iraj rib'iral i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chikinaah i tinamit. Noq naa ruchaliik taq cha naah i re' ma' k'isiin taq naa ayo'jiik, xati b'arb'otik taq chik, xama' xta chik rukowiil taq ati'jolal taq naa awik'raam, ruum i xa chalik chik reh taq cha naah inki QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw je' wili xuq'or taq chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' q'aslaj ch'ihch' juk'uuj chik cho chi korik, juxuuj chik wach chi korik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh naakiyok'om i ralaq i tinamit,</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' xan reprotik chik i rub'an.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' juk'uuj chik chi korik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh juk'uuj chik wach reh chi naa</para>
  <para style="q">ruye'ariik pan q'ab' i aj kaansoom.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha k'er aachii' chi oq'ik</para>
  <para style="q">ruum re' i nutinamiit naa kikimiik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel naa kik'ulwiik reh,</para>
  <para style="q">junkimiik taqe ruuk' i nutinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">Chayok' wach aati'jolal ruum i ruti'kiil ak'ux.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin xnunik'eej chik taqe i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi neenkikuy ransil re' i ti' k'axik?</para>
  <para style="q">eeh i nuq'or chi naa rehtesjiik i kajaawriik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh cha q'or rib'iral i ti' k'axik</para>
  <para style="q">chaq'oj paam aq'ab' reh chi re' aj kaansoom nee rutoq'aa' kaansanik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh cha q'or chi neerub'an ka'pech oon oxpech-oq i ti' k'axik wili.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' wili naa rukansaniik keh i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' keh naa kiyo'jiik</para>
  <para style="q">ruum ma' k'isiin ikaansanik naa rub'aan ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh chupaam taqe i ookb'al naa kiwihiik</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i naa kib'aniik ikaansanik ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch'</para>
  <para style="q">xan reprotik chik wach.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh ruuk' wo' q'aslaj ch'ihch'</para>
  <para style="q">naakikanteesjiik i wilkeeb' reje pansak'aaj</para>
  <para style="q">i pantz'eet, xa aha' pa' naa kiwihiik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'wiik keh panti' k'axik</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal inwik'saj i nujosq'iil chikinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili xuq'or weh: <verse number="19" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq chakoj rehtaal i kiib' chi b'eeh, reh chi neenik'ik i kireey i aj Babilonia ruch'ihil i ruq'aslaj ch'ihch'. Re' i kiib' chi b'eeh re' re' chupaam i jinaj chi tinamit naa relik chaloq. Eh re' hat i naa akojom rehtalil, reh chi neenk'utinik aha' i tinamit inooj i ju'jun chi b'eeh <verse number="20" style="v" />Jinaj i b'eeh naa rojiik chupaam i tinamit Rabá, re' i kiye'aab' i aj Amonita, eh re' chik i b'eeh jinaj ar naa rojiik chupaam i tinamit Jerusaleem re' i kow kiib' chi q'aq'inik, re' i kitinamiit i aj Judá. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' i kireey i aj Babilonia naa rupab'aam riib' aha' naa rutohq'iik reje i kiib' chi b'eeh, xama' naa ta chik rureqem chi riij aha' wilik b'eeh i naa ruk'amam. Eh naa ruq'ijem ruuk' i flecha, naa rupahqaam i koq reh taqe i rutiyoox, naa wo' ruq'ijem ruuk' i rutamaat i chikop. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh pansak'aaj xtohq'ik reje ikaansanik xk'uhtjik reje i Jerusaleem. Reh chi naa rojiik rub'anam reh ruuk' taqe i rutz'a'amb'aal naa ruq'orom chi naa kitoq'aam kaansanik. Eh re' i reey naa ruk'erem chii' chuq'orariik chi naa kitoq'aam q'aq'inik taqe i ru soldado, naakik'otom kijuul chi junsuut i tinamit. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Jerusaleem ma' xkinimaj taj chi naa rub'aan keh i ruum i kireey i aj Babilonia ruum wilik i kiyejaam wach. Re' wili re' chi naa ruk'uliik cho pankik'ux i kimahk, rehtalil chi naa kichopariik reje.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi je' wili: Re' kimahk, re' ikaansanik inki a'n i aj Israel xti nk'utinik wach. Eh chu'nchel i mahk xkian wilik wach saqum, ruum aj re' naakichopariik reje. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' i kireey i aj Israel xuch'uwa'risaj chik riib' ruuk' i ruyiib' wach na'ojb'al. Ruum aj re' ponik reh i q'iij chi naa ruk'ulum i tz'apaab' wach i ti' k'axik. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios kinq'orik chi naa rehtesjiik reh itz'ihy i rub'ur wach i naah, eh naa rehtesjiik i ru corona. Eh re' i ma' xta rajaawriik naa ruwihiik rajaawriik, eh re' i wilik rajaawriik naa rehtesjiik i rajaawriik. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel naa nusacham wach, xti korik chi naa nusacham wach. Xa re' la' re' re' naa rub'aan noq naa ruk'uliik chaloq inupab'aam chee hin, chi i q'ataj q'orik, eh chu'nchel naa nuq'asam pan q'ab', inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ti k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj amonita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'oreej taqe panub'ihnaal i aj amonita re' taqe i kib'ajwik keh i aj Israel, je' wili i cha q'or keh. Re' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' esamaj chik cho parupaat juk'uuj chik chi korik, eh juk'uuj chik wach, xan reprotik chik, xa re' chik taq akanteesjiik iraaj. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' inkilow pan kisaq wiriik inkiq'or ma' korik taj, re' inkiq'ijej riij inkiq'or xachukuj q'orik inki a'n Yiib' wach i kina'ojb'al. Ruum aj re' ponik reh i q'iij chi naa kitojom wach i kimahk, naa ruyok'ariik i kalaq ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Amonita naa nuq'orom keh chi naa kimolom i kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' parupaat. Re' hin ar naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah xi-aasjik wii'. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' hin xan qop chik i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em chikinaah, je' rukab' noq inqop i q'aaq' yohb'aal wach i k'atoj i rub'an. Eh naa taqe nuq'asam pan kiq'ab' i manlik aj kaansoom. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' keh naakik'ahtiik, naa rusachariik kiwach, re' i kikik'eel naa ruchikiik chupaam i tinamit. Eh ma' jino'q naa ruko'liniik keh. Re' hin kinq'orik reh, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i mahk xkian i aj Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq naa aq'atam i q'orik chikinaah i tinamit kib'anik reh i mahk. Eh neenaq'or keh chu'nchel i xiik' naah yib'kiil wach na'ojb'al inki a'n <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i neenaq'or keh. Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' taq i hat aj Jerusaleem i naakansaj taq aawas achaaq', eh inach'uwa'risaj taq awiib' ruuk' i kiyejeb'jiik i tiyoox, ponik reh i ruq'ijil chi naa taq atojom wach amahk. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruum ikaansanik taq xa a'n xakoj taq amahk, eh ruum chi xach'uwarisaj taq awiib' kuuk' taqe i tiyoox xayejaa' k'ulik iloq reh i ti' k'axik taq cha naah. Xponik i ruq'ijil chi naa rusachariik taq awach. Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi chu'nchel i tinamit ma' holohik ta naa kiq'oriik, eh chi naa ta taq kaat kikaqse'laam. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taq i hat aj Jerusaleem yiib' taq wach ana'ojb'al, xa re' i loq'inik tiyoox taq i na a'n. Ruum i re' naa taq aakaqse'ljiik kuum i tinamit wilkeeb' chi najt chi ma' najt.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj taaq'oom chinaah taq aatinamiit Israel, ruuk' i kajaawriik inkichop kik'ux chukanteesjiik i kas kichaaq'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh ma' inkik'ax taj i kituut kajaaw, eh inki a'n ti k'axik keh i aj pan tokoom tinamit, inkelq'aaj i chib'ih reh taqe ixoq kamnaq kib'ahiil, je' wo' re' inki a'n reh i ma' xta kituut kajaaw. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ma' inkiyeew ta k'isinoq ruloq'il i nuSantolaj ye'aab', je' wo' taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum taqe i chukuj q'orik inki a'n wilik taqe inkikansaj i kas kichaaq'. Eh inkik'ux keh i wi'k inye'arik chi mayiij chikiwach taqe i tiyoox. Inki a'n keh i yiib' wach chi b'anarik. <verse number="10" style="v" />Wilik taqe inkixooqb'eej i rehk'een i kajaaw. Eh inkiq'oreej inkixooqb'eej ixoq noq k'ahchi' i ruyab'ilaal i rub'an reh rajlaal i poh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Wilik wo' taqe inkich'uwarisaj wach i kikaxarohiil ruuk' i rehk'een i kas kichaaq'. Wilik taqe i kixoqb'eej i kil-iib', wilik taqe inkixooqb'eej i rixq'uun i rukab' kajaaw. <verse number="12" style="v" />Wilik inkik'ayej kiib' reh i rukanteesjiik i kas kichaaq'. Eh noq inkiyeew chi kemeel i kitumiin k'ih i tojb'al riij inkipahqaaj, eh inkelq'aaj, inki a'n ti' k'axik reh i kas kichaaq' xinsahchik pankik'ux i hin, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' keh inkijosaj wach i nujosq'iil ruum i leq', ruum i rukanteesjiik i kas kichaaq' inki a'n <verse number="14" style="v" />¿Mi konaa ta wo' kikowb'isam i kik'ux, mi konaa ta wo' kikowb'isam kiib' noq naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk? Re' wili korik chi naa nub'anam re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hin naa nutukem kiwach chupaam chu'nchel i tinamit sut i wach ak'al. Ma' naa ta chik kianam i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh ma' suq ta naakilariik kuum i tokoom tinamit. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achalkiin, tiko'q keh, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="18" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' taqe i aj Israel ma' xta chik k'isinoq kiokik wii' chi weh i hin, xa je' chik kikab' i ruxeer q'an ch'ihch' rax ch'ihch', oon plomo ch'ihch' je' plata noq inkihaab'isaj wach q'aaq'. <verse number="19" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi je' wili: Ruum chi ma' xta chik kiokik wii' re' hin naa wo' chik numolom kiwach pan kitinamiit Jerusaleem. <verse number="20" style="v" />Je' rukab' imb'aan reh i plata, q'an ch'ihch', rax ch'ihch', plomo, noq jinaj ink'atarik wii' chupaam i horna k'atb'al reh noq inhaab'ik. Re' hin jinaj naa numolom wii' kiwach noq naa nuye'em nujosq'iil chikinaah reh i kiye'ariik panti' k'axik. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hin ruum chi xan qop chik i nujosq'iil naa numolom kiwach naa nusacham kiwach chupaam i tinamit Jerusaleem. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh nik' wach noq inhaab'ik ruum i q'aaq' i plata pan horna je' re' noq naa nusacham kiwach panyejaal i tinamit. Chi je' re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios xnuyeew chee nujosq'iil chikinaah, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="24" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi re' hin naa nukanaam i kitinamiit chi je' rukab' i chiq ak'al ma' qajik taj i jab' chinaah. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruum re' taqe i ajaab'ees chinaah i tinamit je' kikab' i josq'laj kaq b'ahlam i ruk'er chii' noq i ruchop i rutiib'. Je' re' inki a'n i keh noq inkisach wach i kitinamiit inkelq'aaj i chib'ih keh re' ruuk' taqe i k'ih tz'aaq, eh inkikansaj taqe kib'ahiil ixoq. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij inkiyoj wach i nuk'uhb'aal, inkich'uwarisaj wach i wilik rusantohiil. Eh xa jinaj wach inkilow i wilik rusantohiil ruuk' i ma' xta rusantohiil. Ma' nkik'uhtaaj ta reh i tokoom aha' wilik i saq wach, aha' wilik i ch'uwa' wach ma' kiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij, ni xata re' hin inkiyeew nuloq'il. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' taqe i ajaab'ees chinaah i tinamit re' re', je' kikab' i josq'laj xojb' i ruxereb'eej i rutiib'. Xa re' ikaansanik kas kichaaq' inkaaj, reh chi kib'ehomrik ruuk' inkelq'aaj. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taqe i jalal nuq'oral inki a'n kiib' xa je' kikab' i winaq i ruchunej wach i tz'aq b'urb'al wach i ch'uwa'. Re' keh inkiq'or chi wilik ink'uhtjik keh pan kisaq wiriik. Eh inkiq'or chi re' hin kinq'orik keh, eh ma' hin ta wo' kinq'orik keh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' i tinamit wilkeeb' ar xa re' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n inkiq'uch i chib'ih keh i neb'aa', je' wo' taqe i ti' wilkeeb'. Eh inkiyeew panti' k'axik i aj tokoom tinamit. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' hin xnusik' naq jino'q holohik runa'ojb'al chi kixilak i tinamit re' re' reh chi naa naq rukojom kina'ojb'al i tinamit. Reh naq chi xupahqaaj weh i hin chi ma' nee ta nusach kiwach xa re' la' ma' jino'q wo' hoq i xnureq. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ruum aj re' naa nuye'em nujosq'iil chikinaah je' rukab' i xaq q'aaq'. Ruuk' i re' naa nusacham kiwach. Reh chi naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk, chi riij i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al xki a'n, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i tinamit Samaria ruch'ihil i Jerusaleem xipajarik ruuk' i ki'ib' chi k'oyoom laj ixoq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' hin xnuq'or aweh chi ki'ib' ixoq xi wihik chaloq xa jinaj kituut. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' keh kok' q'ahxoq taqe noq kitoq'aa' cho k'oyomal ar Egipto xkikanaa' kiib' chi xyot'arik paam i kikok' ch'uuch', ar xkich'uwa'risaj wach i kiq'axoq'iil. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' aasb'ees Ahola rub'ihnaal rujalwaach i tinamit Samaria, eh re' chaaq'b'ees Aholiba rub'ihnaal rujalwaach i tinamit Jerusaleem. Re' hin xnuk'am taqe chi je' wehk'een xwihik wak'uun wixq'uun kuuk'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i Ahola noq nuchopom naah i hin ma' xirunimaj taj, re' chik taqe i ki soldado i aj Asiria i ruka'jaah reje xuk'ax wach chi nujilow. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh kitiq'aam kiib' ruuk' xela itz'ihy, re' taqe i kib'anik taaq'anik, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh soldado, re' taqe i k'ijolaq xa holohaq chik taqe, eh riij kawáyu kiooj. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' Ahola ruyeew riib' pan k'oyomal kuuk' chu'nchel i aj Asiria, re' taqe i q'e' nimaq kajaawriik inki a'n kiib'. Re' i q'e' xuk'ax reje wach, eh xuch'uwa'reej riib' ruum xuloq'ej taqe i kitiyoox i tinamit re' re'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' reh ma' xukanaa' ta chik i k'oyomal xutoq'aa' cho Egipto. Ko k'isa q'ahxoq noq xutoq'aa' chaloq, xuyeew cho chi yot'arik paam i kok' rich'uch' keh chu'nchel i winaq, xuch'uwa'reej wach i ruq'ahxoqiil. <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin xnuq'asaj pan kiq'ab' i aj Asiria, re' i q'e' ruk'ax reje wach i xub'an wii' i k'oyomal. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq ximponik xkik'uhtaaj ruk'ixb'ilaal i Ahola xkiq'uch i rak'uun rixq'uun, eh re' reh xkanteesjik ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch'. Eh aha' ta chik ma' x-ib'irjik rib'iral i xuk'ul ixoq re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i ruchaaq' Aholiba rub'ihnaal xrilow xub'an i ras xuq'asaj wo' chik riib' i reh chub'anariik i yiib' wach. Q'e' chik yiib' wach i xub'an i reh chuwach i xub'an i ras, xub'an i k'oyomal. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh xti xuyeew riib' pan k'oyomal kuuk' taqe i aj Asiria re' i ruka'jaah reje, re' taqe i kib'anik taaq'anik, i k'amal kib'eeh soldado kitiq'aam kiib' chi korik. Wilik kitz'a'amb'aal reh q'aq'inik chi je' taqe k'ijolaq, eh riij kawáyu kiooj. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin xnukoj rehtaal chi re' Aholiba xuch'uwa'risaj wo' riib' ruuk' i k'oyomal, je' rukab' i xub'an i ras eliik wach i kina'ojb'al. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh xiik' wo' chik naah yib'kiil wach i xub'an, noq xrilow chi tz'ihb'amaj kehtalil taqe winaq kijalwaach i aj Babilonia iq'omamaj wach ruuk' i kaqiq'oom <verse number="15" style="v" />B'ak'lik i kipaam chi sincho, b'ak'lik i kinaah chi itz'ihy k'ih wach inka'yik. Re' taqe i ehtalil re' re' je' kiwii' k'amal kib'eeh soldado, je' kiwii' taqe i aj Babilonia re' i kiye'aab' xi-aasjik cho wii'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh noq xrilow i kehtalil i aj Babilonia i Aholiba ma' k'isiin ta xuk'ax kiwach xutaq'aaj raj taqareel chi kiyuq'ub'jiik i aj Babilonia. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Babilonia xi chalik wo' hoq, xkian i k'oyomal ruuk' xuch'uwa'risaj taqe ruuk' i ruk'oyomal. Re' keh xti ma' k'isiin wo' chik xkich'uwa'risaj wach. Eh re' i Aholiba xtohq'ik wo' chik ruyib'um taqe <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruum aj re' xuq'asaj riib' chub'aan i k'oyomal chuwach i tinamit xuk'uhtaaj taqe i ruti'jolal chi t'uslik wach. Eh re' hin ma' xwaaj ta chik wach ruum taqe i xub'an, je' rukab' noq ma' xwaaj ta chik wach i Ahola i ras. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' Aholiba xuq'asaj riib' pan k'oyomal chi jumpech ma' xsahchik ta paruk'ux i xub'an cho paruq'ahxoqiil noq xub'an chee k'oyomal paruyuq'ul i Egipto. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ma' k'isiin ta xuk'ax kiwach i xub'an wii' i k'oyomal xti xuq'asaj riib' keh i winaq xiik' naah kik'oyomal, je' kikab' taqe i winaq kawáyu, je' kikab' taqe i b'uurux. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' i Aholiba koraaj wo' k'acharik pan k'oyomal je' rukab' noq xuyeew chi yot'arik paam ruch'uuch' paruq'ahxoqiil keh taqe i aj Egipto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi re' taqe i xub'an wii' i k'oyomal re' i ruyib'uj chik taqe yu'naak naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kisutinik chi ixowan wach, chi xa aha' yuuq' naa kichaliik chinaah rub'anariik reh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Naa kichaliik i aj Babilonia, i aj Caldeo, i aj Pecaod, i aj Soa, i aj Coa, chu'nchel taqe i aj asirio. Eh je' wo' taqe i k'ijolaq, q'e' holohaq, taqe i aj taaq'oom, taqe i k'amal kib'eeh soldado, taqe i aj q'aq'ineel, riij kawáyu naa kik'uliik iloq. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh ma' k'isa kareta, ma' k'isa soldado naa kichaliik chinaah chi q'aq'inik, naa kikotem riij kiyejaam cho kiib' wilik kich'ihch' puneet, wilik kipulato ch'ihch'. Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' keh chi naa kiq'atam i q'orik chinaah, je' rukab' i ruq'or i kik'uhb'aal i keh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil chinaah. Re' keh naa kib'aniik reh, naakiyok'om i ju', je' wo' xikin, re' taqe i naakikahnik chi k'achaach ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa kikanteesjiik, eh naa ruq'uchariik i kak'uun kixq'uun. Eh nik' chik nimaal i naa kikahniik ruuk' q'aaq' naa rusachariik kiwach. <verse number="26" style="v" />Naa kiq'uchum i ruso', naa kiq'uchum nik' naq nimaal i ruxoyej wii' riib'. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' hin ma' naa ta chik nuye'em q'ab' reh i Aholiba chi naa rub'anam i k'oyomal, je' rukab' i xub'an cho Egipto. Eh ma' naa ta chik rilom kiwach i aj Egipto, ni xata naa chik ruk'uliik taqe paruk'ux. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa ruchaliik b'anroq reh kuum i rixow kiwach, eh ruyib'uj taqe yu'naak. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' keh ma' k'isiin ta naakixowaam wach naa kianam reh, naa kiq'uchum i chib'ih reh, taqe i rureqem tz'aaq ruuk' i rukamaj. Eh naakit'usaam chi jumpech, naa kikanaam chi ma' xta chik wilik reh i xuyeew riib' pan k'oyomal ruum i loq'inik tiyoox. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ruum taqe i re' k'ahchi'rik'iik chi ti' k'axik yu'naak, ruum chi xuq'asaj riib' pan k'oyomal kuuk' taqe i k'ih seht chi tinamit re' re' xkisaj i rajaawriik xokik chi loq'inik tiyoox kuuk'. <verse number="31" style="v" />Xub'an wo' chik ree reh je' rukab' i xub'an i Ahola i ras, ruum aj re' naa wik'sam chi ti' k'axik i reh, re' i je' i k'ah laj ha' xnuyeew reh chi uuk'jik i ras.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or chi riij,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">xiik' naah i ti' k'axik naa ruk'ulum je' rukab' i xuk'ul i ras,</para>
  <para style="q">je' naa pan nimlaj kulk cham paam xnuyeew reh chi uuk'jik i k'ahlaj ha'</para>
  <para style="q">naa rukahniik chi kaqse'lb'al ma' awach ta chik naa rajwaniik wach.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh naa wo' rusachariik wach</para>
  <para style="q">je' rukab' i ti' k'axik xuk'ul i ras,</para>
  <para style="q">naa rukahniik chi je' xohk'reel ruum i je' k'ahlaj ha'</para>
  <para style="q">ruum i ruti'kiil ruk'ux je' awanaab' Samaria.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh je' na naa rukem chu'nchel</para>
  <para style="q">naa rutz'irim paam i ye'aab' reh.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa rutohq'iik ruloch'om riib' ruum ruti'kiil ruk'ux.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">Re' wili korik ruum re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ruum aj re' xnuq'or reh chi je' wili: Ruum chi xinsahchik paruk'ux i Aholiba ma' xiraaj ta chik kiin runimam naa ruk'ulum i tojb'al ru mahk chi riij i xuch'ikaa' cho wii' ruk'ux, eh chi riij taqe i k'oyomal xub'an, kinki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq ¿Mi nawaaj aq'atam q'orik chinaah i Ahola, chinaah i Aholiba? Chaq'or keh panaq'kiwach i yiib' wach i xkian. <verse number="37" style="v" />Re' keh xa re' ikaansanik xa re' i je' k'oyomal inki a'n ruuk' i loq'inik tiyoox. Eh xkik'at chi kimayiij i kak'uun kixq'uun chuwach eh xkik'at wo' chi kimayiij i wak'uun wixq'uun i hin xwihik kuuk'. <verse number="38" style="v" />Eh ma' xata re' re' xkian xkich'uwa'risaj la' wo' paam i nuSantolaj paat, eh ma' xkiyeew ta ruloq'il taqe i hi'limb'al q'iij. <verse number="39" style="v" />Eh noq xkik'at chi kimayiij i kak'uun kixq'uun chuwach i kitiyoox, xi chalik wo' pan nuSantolaj paat xkich'uwa'risaj paam. Re' taqe yiib' wach na'ojb'al wilik xkian panupaat. <verse number="40" style="v" />Eh xkitaq'aaj i taqareel chupaam i tinamit najt wilkeeb' chaloq, xkian kitiin xkiq'omaaj inaq'kiwach, eh xkixoyej kiib' ruuk' karena noq xkik'ul taqe i winaq re' re'. <verse number="41" style="v" />Eh kitzunaa' kiib' naah i mexa chupaam jinaj i ye'aab' ye'jamaj chi korik. Chinaah i mexa re' re' xkiyeew i insensia aseite xkiyeew naq weh i hin. <verse number="42" style="v" />Eh x-ib'irjik chi k'erik kichii' chi ninq'ijinik i ruk'ihaal tinamit. Re' taqe i winaq xi k'amarik cho chupaam i ye'aab' chiq yuuq' xi xoyjik kuum taqe i kiib' chi ixoq xkojarik ch'ihch' ralaq kiq'ab', eh kojarik holohaq corona wach kinaah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Eh re' hin je' wili i xnuq'or chikiij i kiib' chi ixoq wilkeeb' pan k'oyomal: ¿Mi konaa ta wo' kianam i k'oyomal i winaq kuuk' ixoq wili ruum xti yiib' wach inki a'n? kinki. <verse number="44" style="v" />Re' taqe i winaq wili xi chalik ruuk' i Ahola, ruuk' i Aholiba re' taqe i xasuq keh i chopkalil pan kib'eeh, je' rukab' noq kiponik ruuk' i k'oyoom laj ixoq. <verse number="45" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i winaq korik wach kik'ux naa ruq'atwiik i q'orik chikinaah i ki-ib' chi ixoq re' re', je' rukab' noq inq'atarik i q'orik chinaah i ixoq i ruch'uwa'risaj wach i rukaxaro, eh chinaah imb'anik kaansanik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ruum i re', re' i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik je' wili i ruq'or: Kimol cho kiib' i soldado neekichaliik chi yohb'eesjiik, eh neekieljik reje. <verse number="47" style="v" />Eh naa kikanteesjiik chi ab'aj, eh naakitoq'ariik chi q'aslaj ch'ihch'. Nee wo' kanteesjik i kak'uun kixq'uun, neenk'atarik i kipaat. <verse number="48" style="v" />Chi je' re' naa nusacham wach i yiib' wach na'ojb'al chupaam i tinamit. Reh chi chu'nchel ixoq neenkikoj rehtaal chi ma' holohik taj i re', eh chi ma' nee ta nkitijej keh. <verse number="49" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiib' chi ixoq re' re', naa kitojom wach i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al. Naa kitojom i kimahk chi riij i loq'inik tiyoox xkian. Ruuk' i re' neenanab'eej taq i hat chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i jalwaach q'orik chi riij i xun inroqrotik i ha' chupaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh noq lajeeb' rub'eeh i ru lajeeb' poh reh i rub'eleej haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha tz'ihb'aaj rehtalil i q'iij wili ruum chupaam i q'iij re' re' naa rojiik chi peleto i kireey i aj Babilonia naa kikotem riij i tinamit Jerusaleem. <verse number="3" style="v" />Xa re' la' panjalwaach q'orik cha q'or keh taqe i ma' kinimanik taj, chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or taq aweh:</para>
  <para style="q">Chakoj taq jino'q i xun nah q'aaq' chakoj taq ha' chupaam.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chakoj taq i wetz'oj ch'aak chupaam holohaq rutuuq chikop</para>
  <para style="q">je' wo' i ruch'akil jurub',</para>
  <para style="q">chakoj taq i holohaq b'aaq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh cha sik' taq wach i kitib'kaal i tentzun chayeew taq pan xun,</para>
  <para style="q">eh nee taq i naham i sii' chi ri'sil, nee nakanaa' chi neenroqrotik,</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal inchaq' chi korik i ch'aak je' wo' hoq i b'aaq.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Q'e' ti' i naakik'ulum i aj Jerusaleem,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i aj kaansoom. Je' kikab' i xun q'uux paam.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' hat naa awesam chi ju'junaal i tiwik chupaam i xun,</para>
  <para style="q">naa akanaam chi ma' xta paam.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' keh ma' k'isiin ikaansanik xkian chupaam i tinamit, eh re'</para>
  <para style="q">i kikik'eel i xkikansaj xchihkik chinaah ab'aj</para>
  <para style="q">ma' pan pooq ta xchihkik reh chi ma' xb'uhrik ta naah ruum i pooq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin xnukanaa' i kikik'eel chinaah ab'aj t'uslik wach,</para>
  <para style="q">re' ink'utinik wii', reh chi</para>
  <para style="q">naa nuq'ajam wach keh i xkian</para>
  <para style="q">noq naa taqe nuye'em chi tojariik i kimahk.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or rib'iral i ti' k'axik</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruchaliik chikinaah i tinamit aj kaansoom,</para>
  <para style="q">re' hin je' naa jinaj q'aaq' i naa nuluk'um.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Je' naa ma' k'isa sii' i naa nukojom</para>
  <para style="q">chi ri'sil i xun korehtaal inchaq' chi korik i tiwik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naa ruchiqiik i riis korehtaal ink'ahtik i b'aaq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chi riij i re' naa nutzunaam nah q'aaq' i xun</para>
  <para style="q">ma' xta paam korehtaal inkaqb'ik wach q'aaq'</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal i nelik i ruch'uwa'iil wach,</para>
  <para style="q">i ruq'uxil wach.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Xa re' la' xti xiik' wo' chik naah q'uxil wach, ni xata naq ruuk' q'aaq' i nelik i ruq'uxil wach. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Jerusaleem re' hin xwaaj naq nusaqb'isam kiwach. Xa re' la' re' keh xama' xkisaqb'isaj ta wo' kiib'. Korehtaal naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil chikinaah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh chi korik chi naakik'ulum i ti' k'axik wili. Re' hin naa nub'aniik keh ma' naa tarik'iikwach, ma' naa ta nuketelaam kiwach, ma' naa ta nusutem chi riij i nuq'oral. Naa la' nuye'em taqe chi tojariik i kimahk, tiko'q keh inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i rukimiik i rehk'een i Ezequiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="16" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' hin xa chi jumehq'iil naa wesam chawach i xti q'e' inawaaj wach. Xa re' la' i nuq'or aweh chi maa tib'isaj ak'ux chi riij, ma' toq'ik chi riij, maa q'eb' i riis naq'awach ruum. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ma' naa ta k'uhtaam chi ti' naa awik'raam, ni xata naa awesam itz'ihy i nab'ur wii' wach anaah. Eh ma' naa ta awesam axijab' cha wooq ma' naa ta akojom aq'eq' so', ma' k'ux aweh i kaxlanwi'k re' ruuk' ink'uxarik noq imb'aan kimik, inki weh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' hin pan wahq'eq xnub'an nuk'utaaj kuuk' i tinamit, eh paruxq'eqiil xkimik i wehk'een. Eh wahq'eq chi junwaar xnub'an wo' hoq i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh noq xkilow chi je' re' i tinamit xkipahqaaj weh chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">Chach'ob' rub'ehel qeh chib'ih iraaj i ruq'orom chi qeh hoj i k'ahchi' kaat, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hin je' wili i xnuq'or keh:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or weh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Chaq'or keh i tinamit Israel: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa nuch'uwarisam paam i nupaat re' i q'e' inkik'ax i keh, eh re' naq inkich'ikaa' wii' kik'ux, re' i q'e' imponik chikiwach. Eh re' taqe i kak'uun kixq'uun xi kahnik cho ar Jerusaleem naa rukuxiik kikanteesjiik panq'aq'inik, inki. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' keh naa kianam je' rukab' i xnub'an i hin ma' naa ta kik'uhtaam chi ti' kik'ux ma' naa ta kib'urum i kiwach, ni xata naa kik'uxum keh i kaxlanwi'k ink'uxarik noq imb'aan kimik. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta kesam itz'ihy inkib'ak' wii' wach kinaah, ma' naa ta kesam kixijab'. Ma' naa ta koq'iim ruum i ruti'kiil kik'ux, xa re' la' naa kikahniik chi ma' xta chik kaansil ruum kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n k'ul naa kiq'orom i ruti'kiil kik'ux chikiwach. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' i xuk'ul i Ezequiel ink'uhtanik reh chi je' re' i naakik'ulum. Re' i xub'an i reh je' wo' chik re' i naa kianam i keh. Eh noq naa ruk'ulariik taqe i re', re' keh naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' hin naa wesam chikiwach i aj Israel i nupaat re' naq inkich'ikaa' wii' kik'ux, ruum i ruholwochiil insuuqb'ik kik'ux, eh q'e' imponik chikiwach. Eh naa wo' wesam chikiwach i kak'uun kixq'uun. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruk'ulariik taqe i re' wilik i naa ruko'leem cho riib' chuwach i kimik naa ruk'uliik ruq'orom aweh ayu' Babilonia chib'ih i xk'ularik. <verse number="27" style="v" />Chupaam i q'iij re' re' naa wo' chik acholiik q'orik ma' naa ta chik akahniik meem, naa chik aq'oreem naa ruk'uliik iloq chi taqarik. Re' hat naa ak'uhtaniik keh i tinamit i naakik'ulum. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ti' k'axik chalik chikinaah i aj Amonita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq ti tz'ehtanoq reje aha' wilkeeb' cho wii' i aj Amón, cha q'or reje keh i ti' k'axik chalik reh chikinaah. <verse number="3" style="v" />Chaq'or keh chi je' wili: Re' Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' xkik'er kichii' ruum i rusuqkiil kik'ux noq xkilow chi xkich'uwa'risaj paam i nupaat. Eh chi xsacharik wach i tinamit Israel, eh chi xik'amarik reje pan tokoom tinamit i aj Judá. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruum i re' naa taqe nuye'em pan q'ab' i tinamit wilkeeb' reje parelb'aal q'iij, re' chik i keh naa kehchaniik reh i kiye'aab', eh naa kiyejaam kipaat ar, re' chik i keh naakik'uxwiik i wach i kitik, re' keh naak'uk'iniik reh i kilecha. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusutem kiye'aab' i aj Rabá chi kiye'aab' cameyo, eh re' i kiye'aab' i aj Amón naa nusutem chi kiye'aab' tentzun, chi je' re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios, kinq'orik reh chi re' taqe i aj Amón xan kipohq'aaj chik paam kiq'ab', xakipisk'anik chik pankooq ruum i rusuqkiil kik'ux chi riij i ti' k'axik xkik'ul i aj Israel. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin naa nuye'em i ti' k'axik chikinaah, naa nuq'asam taqe pan kiq'ab' i tinamit i nixowanik kiwach, naa ruq'uchariik i chib'ih keh. Eh naa wesam i kajaawriik, naa nusacham kiwach chi kixilak i nimaq tinamit. Ruum i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ti k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' taqe i aj Moab ruch'ihil i aj Seir inkiq'or chi re' taqe i aj Judá xa elik wo' kiwach kuuk' i tokoom tinamit. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin naa nutehem i b'eeh parucheel i tinamit Moab reh chi naa rojiik b'anroq keh i tinamit wilkeeb' ar. Re' taqe i tinamit re' re' inkiyeew ruloq'il i aj Moab, je' wili kib'ihnaal Bet-jesimot, Baal-meón, Quiriataim. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh naa wo' nuye'em q'ab' chi re' i kok' tinamit wilkeeb' reje chi korkiil ireelb'aalq'iij naa ruchopwiik naah i kitinamiit i aj Amón, reh chi ma' naa ta chik ruq'orariik i kib'ihnaal chi jumpech chi kixilak i tinamit. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh naa wo' nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk i aj Moab. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlikiin, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ti' k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw je' wili i xuq'or: Re' taqe i aj Edom xkiq'aj wach keh i aj Judá i xb'aan keh junriim. Ruuk' i re' xkikoj runimaal kimahk. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin naa nuye'em i ti' k'axik chikinaah i aj Edom naa nusacham kiwach i kitinamiit, i chikop. Eh ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa nusacham kiwach, ar naa nutoq'aam reje Temán, eh naa ruponiik ar Dedán. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' hin naa nuq'ajam wach keh i aj Edom i xkian reh i nutinamiit Israel. Eh re' taqe i aj Israel naa rub'aniik keh i aj Edom, ruuk' i nujosq'iil. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin xinq'ajwik wach keh, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' ti' k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj filisteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' taqe i aj filisteo xkian ti' k'axik keh i aj Judá, ma' kisiin ta xkixow wach, ruum i re' xkisach wach. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i naa nusacham kiwach i aj filisteo, je' wo' taqe i aj cereteos. Eh naa wo' rukuxiik nusacham kiwach i konaakikahniik chi k'achalkeeb' wilkeeb' reje chi chii' i palaw. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuq'ajam wach keh i xkian, yohb'aal wach i nujosq'iil naa nuye'em chikinaah. Noq naakik'ulum taqe re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Dios xuq'or rib'iral chi naakik'ulum i ti' k'axik i aj Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh pank'amb'al rub'eeh i peet poh reh i rujunlaaj haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq re' taqe i aj Tiro q'e' insuuqb'ik kik'ux inkik'er kichii' chuq'orariik chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Ma' xta reet chi xsahchik wach i Jerusaleem,</para>
  <para style="q">re' naq i reh q'e' b'ehoom, chikiwach i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">Xa re' la' yu'naak xsacharik chik wach</para>
  <para style="q">re' chik i hoj q'e' naa ruwihiik qab'ehomal, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or keh chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' taq i hat aj Tiro ma' imponik ta chi nuwach taq i na a'n.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum aj re' naa nuk'amam chaloq i k'ih seht chi tinamit taq cha naah,</para>
  <para style="q">xa je' chik rukab' i rub'ohl i palaw</para>
  <para style="q">noq naa kik'uliik iloq.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh naa kikutum wach ak'al i tz'aq wilik chi riij taq aatinamiit, je' wo' hoq</para>
  <para style="q">inajt kinaah tz'aq i ko'lb'al taq awiib'.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ma' xta chik naa nukanaam taq panaye'aab',</para>
  <para style="q">xa je' chik mesooj wach ab'aj naa rukahniik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taq aatinamiit i hat aj Tiro</para>
  <para style="q">naa rukahniik chi chahb'al</para>
  <para style="q">wach kiya'l i aj karineel.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' i nimaq tinamit naa ruchaliik elq'anoq taq i chib'ih aweh</para>
  <para style="q">re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taq aatinamiit wilkeeb' pantaq ab'iix</para>
  <para style="q">naa kikanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i re' naa taq anab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i naa nuk'amam taqe chaloq chi q'aq'inik awuuk' taq i hat aj Tiro i Nabucodonosor re' i kireey i aj Babilonia, re' q'e' nim rajaawriik chikiwach chu'nchel i reey. Re' reh naa ruchaliik ruch'ihil taqe i ruk'ihaal soldado, riij kawáyu, pan kareta wilkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa rukansam</para>
  <para style="q">taq aatinamiit wilkeeb' pantaq ab'iix.</para>
  <para style="q">Naakikotem riij taq aatinamiit naa kiyejaam kiye'aab' ko'lemb'al kiib',</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' ruuk' i rupulato ch'ihch'</para>
  <para style="q">naa kianam taq aweh ru soldado.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh naakipaxib'eem i koraal tz'aq chi riij taq aatinamiit, je' wo'</para>
  <para style="q">inajt kinaah tz'aq inako'leej taq wii' awiib'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq naa kokiik i ki soldado taqe</para>
  <para style="q">i aj Babilonia chupaam taq aatinamiit,</para>
  <para style="q">xaq'equm chik paam i pooq naa kuksam i kikawayu,</para>
  <para style="q">i kikareta xama' naa ta chik taq ak'uhtaniik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa ruk'uyu'jiik paruye'aab'</para>
  <para style="q">i tz'aq kotimaj wii' riij taq aatinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i kikawayu naakiyeq'eb'eem</para>
  <para style="q">paam taq aatinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa kianam kaansanik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naa kituhb'aam wach ak'al i rooq i paat.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh naa taq kiq'uchum ab'ehomal,</para>
  <para style="q">je' wo' taq inayak,</para>
  <para style="q">naa kituhb'aam wach ak'al i koraal tz'aq chi riij taq aatinamiit, je' wo'</para>
  <para style="q">paat imb'aan wii' i q'ataj q'orik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa kikutum pan runimaal ha' taqe ab'aj,</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i chee' korjinaq wii'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh naa nukanaam chi ma' naa ta chik rub'aan i tz'uuy imb'aan naq pan tinamit,</para>
  <para style="q">ma' naa ta chik rub'aan i q'ooj arpa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naa nukanaam taq aatinamiit chi je' rukab' i mesooj wach ab'aj,</para>
  <para style="q">naa wo' nukanaam chi chahb'al wach kiya'l taqe i aj karineel,</para>
  <para style="q">ma' jaruuj chik naa rukorjiik ruka'peech,</para>
  <para style="q">inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or keh i aj Tiro: Re' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw xanaa chik kib'arb'otiik ruum kiyo'jiik noq naa kib'iram i choqik, noq naakik'erem kichii' taqe i ti' naa kiwihiik noq naa kikanteesjiik taq aatinamiit. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i kireey i tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw naakeliik cho pan kiye'aab', naa kesam i kiso' chikiij xankitak'aa' chikiij, eh je' wo' hoq i kinimaq rooq so'. Eh naakitzunaam kiib' wach ak'al xakib'arb'otik chik ruum kiyo'jiik, xanaa chik kokiik meem noq naakilom taq i naa ak'ulum. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh naa taq kitz'uyem aweh i tz'uuy wili reh ruti'kiil k'uxliis:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Ruum chi xsacharik taq awach kuum i tinamit kichalik chi chii' i palaw</para>
  <para style="q">re' aatinamiit xti wilik naq</para>
  <para style="q">rib'iral chi nim kiwach,</para>
  <para style="q">q'e' naq taq kow awiib' chi ik'ik chinaah i palaw,</para>
  <para style="q">eh q'e' naq i naayohb'isaj taqe chu'nchel i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh ruum chi xb'aan taq chik aweh xakib'arb'otik</para>
  <para style="q">chik ruum kiyo'jiik i tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum chi xsacharik taq chik awachxiyo'jik</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i tinamit wilik palaw chi kijunsuut, inko'q taqe.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or keh i aj Tiro: Re' taq aatinamiit naa rukahniik chi ma' xta wilik chupaam, naa rukahniik chi je' rukab' i ye'aab' ma' b'anooj ta patinik chupaam. Re' taq aatinamiit je' na naakitz'apam naah chi palaw. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq kaat numuq'aam chupaam i chaamlaj jul muqulkeeb' wii' taqe i aj najtir q'iij, naa taq kaat nukutum qohoq paruchamiil ak'al. Ar taq naa awihiik chupaam i kiye'aab' i kamnaq taqe chaloq. Eh ma' naa ta chik ruwihiik k'achareel chupaam taq aatinamiit, ma' naa ta chik rukorjiik chi jumpech chinaah i wach ak'al. <verse number="21" style="v" />Xiik' naah ti' kiil taq naa kaat nuye'em wii' ma' naa ta chik rilariik taq awach. Naa naq chik rusik'ariik taq aatinamiit ma' aha' ta chik naa kireqem, tiko'q keh, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' tz'uuy reh ruti'kiil k'uxliis chi riij i tinamit Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, cha tz'uyej i tz'uuy reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis chi riij i tinamit Tiro. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i tinamit Tiro wilik chi chii' i palaw, re' imb'anik reh i yak kuuk' i tokoom tinamit, kuuk' i k'ih seht chi tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw je' wili i nuq'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i aj Tiro inkiq'or chi re' i kitinamiit</para>
  <para style="q">xiik' naah holwochiil, eh chi korik wach kik'ux.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' tinamit re' re' xti wilik naq rajaawriik</para>
  <para style="q">chikiwach taqe i kikamanik chinaah i palaw.</para>
  <para style="q">Je' rukab' jino'q i barco q'e' holohik ruyejeb'jiik imb'aan.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh je' rukab' i barco korjinaq ruuk' rutz'ilomaal i chaj</para>
  <para style="q">ink'amarik cho ar Senir.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' chee' inchopwik reh i ritz'ihyaal</para>
  <para style="q">ar xkesaj ruuk' i chakaltee' ink'amarik cho Líbano.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' perepik chee' inkib'esaj wii'</para>
  <para style="q">re' ruuk' i tz'inuj inchalik ar Basán.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' i b'urb'al naah re' ruuk' i sohchaj</para>
  <para style="q">inchalik pan tz'a'laj yuuq' reh i Chipre</para>
  <para style="q">kojooj xoyb'al wach ruuk' ab'aj Marfil.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' i nimlaj itz'ihy imb'esanik reh</para>
  <para style="q">re' ruuk' i xoyimaj wach itz'ihy lino inkorjik cho Egipto.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' itz'ihy rehtalil wilik kochinaah</para>
  <para style="q">re' ruuk' itz'ihy raxmuqik</para>
  <para style="q">inchalik pan tz'a'laj yuuq' Elisa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq kitz'ainik reh i chee'</para>
  <para style="q">imb'esanik reh i barco Sidón, eh ar Arvad kichalik.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i winaq wilik kina'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="q">aj Tiro kik'amwik b'eeh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i nimaq kiwach aj Gebal,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe inkiyeew kik'ux chi kamanik</para>
  <para style="q">inkitik wach i barco noq i roq'taaj riib'.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe tokoom tinamit</para>
  <para style="q">kik'uloq nah palaw chi yak taq panatinamiit.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' naq taqe i aj Persia, aj Lud, aj Fut</para>
  <para style="q">kikamanik taq chi a soldado reh i q'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh inkit'uyaa' wach tz'aq i kich'ihch' puneet, i kipulato ch'ihch' ko'lenb'al kiib'</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i re' inkiyeew taq aloq'il.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Arvad kuch'ihil taqe a soldado wilkeeb' cho chinaah tz'aq, eh chi junsuut inajt kinaah tz'aq ko'lb'al naq taq wiib' wilkeeb' taqe i winaq aj Gamad. Re' i kipulato ch'ihch' ko'lb'al kiib' inkit'uyaa' wataq koraal tz'aq, re' naq i re' inye'wik ruholwochiil taq aatinamiit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Xti xiik' wo' naq naah b'ehomal taq aatinamiit Tiro. Eh taqe i aj Tarso kik'ulik yakool taq awuuk'. Noq i nayeew taq reje keh aak'aay i hat, plata, q'an ch'ihch', rax ch'ihch' i plomo ch'ihch' inkiyeew taq aweh chi jilow. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh ink'ulik wo' naq kian kiyak taq awuuk' i aj Grecia, aj Tubal taqe i aj Mesec, eh kulk re' ruuk' q'an ch'ihch' ink'ulik taq kiyeew aweh chi tojb'al riij i moso i nak'ayej taq reje keh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Togarma ruuk' kawáyu aj ihqoom inkojarik reh i q'aq'inik ruuk' kawáyu inkitoj taq riij aweh chib'ih jariik i nak'ayej naq taq reje keh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Dedán, eh chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw kik'ulik wo' naq yakool taq awuuk'. Eh chib'ih jariik i nayeew taq reje keh re' ruuk' i holohaq b'aaq, re' ruuk' i holohaq chee' Ebano inkik'am taq cha weh chi riij. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Edom kik'ulik yakool taq awuuk' ruum yohb'aal wach i tik i nelik taq panaye'aab'. Eh perla ab'aj, itz'ihy rax muqik, kaq muqik, xela itz'ihy wilik ruch'ikojal wach, holohaq ch'ihch' re' ruuk' inokik chi karena holohaq ab'aj inkik'am taq cha weh chi jilow taqe re'. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh kichalik wo' naq taq yakool awuuk' i aj Judá, je' wo' taqe i aj Israel, eh trigo re' ruuk' i nelik cho pan kiye'aab' Minit, suq laj kaxlanwi'k, riiskaab', aseite, ink'ohnik laj iq'oom inkik'am taq cha weh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Damasco yohb'aal wach i xa chib'ih jariik ink'ulik kiloq' taq awuuk' re' i nelik taq panatinamiit, re' naq taq i tib'ehoomrik wii', eh vino inchalik Helbón, riij chikop inkik'am taq cha weh chi jilow. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Dan, i aj Javán, kik'ulik wo' naq yakool taq awuuk' pantaq ninq'iij, kowlaj ch'ihch', ink'ohnik laj riij chee', ink'ohnik laj mirra inkik'am taq cha weh chi jilow chib'ih i nayeew taq reje keh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Dedán kik'ulik wo' yakool taq awuuk' holohaq itz'ihy reh riij kawáyu inkik'am cho chi jilow i nayeew taq reje keh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Arabia re' taqe i nimaq kajaawriik ar Cedar kik'ulik wo' naq taq yakool awuuk'. Eh tentzun, imas tentzun, imas kaprax inkik'am cho chi jilow i nayeew taq reje keh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i yakool wilkeeb' ar Sabán, eh ar Raama kik'ulik wo' naq taq yakool awuuk'. Eh ink'ohnik laj iq'oom holohaq ab'aj, oro inkik'am taq chaaweh chi jilow i nayeew taq reje keh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Harán, aj Cane, aj Edén, aj Sabán, aj Asiria, aj Quilmad, kik'ulik wo' naq yakool taq awuuk'. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' keh ink'ulik wo' naq taq kik'ayej aweh i holohaq itz'ihy nimaq wach, itz'ihy raxmuqik inka'yik, eh ch'ikooj wach itz'ihy, nimaq itz'ihy k'ih b'uhr wach ink'ayjik, eh itz'ihy jitz'ooj wach, chee chakaltee'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' taqe i barco kichalik Tarsis kichalik kiooj chuk'amariik chaloq i,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">chib'ih ink'ulik taq kik'ayej aweh korehtaal i nujik taq aaye'aab'</para>
  <para style="q">wilkeeb' chi chii' palaw yohb'aal wach i b'ehomal inkik'am chaloq.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' taq i hat aj Tiro</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusachariik taq awach kuum i aj ixowaal</para>
  <para style="q">naakichaliik parelb'aal q'iij, je' rukab'</para>
  <para style="q">noq ink'amarik qohoq i barco paruchamiil i palaw ruum i kowlaj teew.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' taq ab'ehomal,</para>
  <para style="q">re' i chib'ih jariik taq inayak,</para>
  <para style="q">eh re' taqe i kib'esanik reh i barco, re' taqe i kik'amwik rub'eeh,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i kiq'olinik wach taq aa barco, re' taqe i yakool,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i awaj q'aq'ineel</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusachariik kiwach naah palaw.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Noq naakik'erem kichii' taqe i kib'esanik</para>
  <para style="q">reh i barco naa ruk'uyu'jiik i palaw.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taqe i kib'esanik reh ruuk' i chee',</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i kik'amwik rub'eeh,</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i kijalwik rub'eeh i barco</para>
  <para style="q">naakipisk'aniik cho chi chiq yuuq'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh naakik'erem cho kichii'</para>
  <para style="q">chi oq'ik ruum taq i naa ak'ulum,</para>
  <para style="q">naakipukem pooq wach kinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naakitolem kiib' pan chaaj.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ruum i ruti'kiil kik'ux taq</para>
  <para style="q">chawiij naa kijoyom i rismaal kinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naa kikojom i kiq'as wach so',</para>
  <para style="q">xasuq chik naa koq'iim taq chawiij.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh naa kitz'uyem i tz'uuy reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis je' wili i naa kiq'orom:</para>
  <para style="q">Xti xsahchik inche wach i kitinamiit i aj Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q">xanaah re' xti ma' awach ta wo' naq chi je' rukab' i reh,</para>
  <para style="q">re' i tinamit wilik chi chii' i palaw.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Noq i nak'am taq reje pan barco aak'aay</para>
  <para style="q">ma' k'isiin taqe i tinamit i nayeew taqe chi suq ruuk' taq ab'ehomal.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ruuk' taqe i re' kib'ehomrik taqe i reey</para>
  <para style="q">wilkeeb' sut i wach ak'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruk'amariik qohoq paruchamiil i palaw,</para>
  <para style="q">chu'nchel taq inayak, eh re' taqe</para>
  <para style="q">i kib'esanik taq reh aa barco</para>
  <para style="q">hat taq junojiik qohoq kuuk' paruchamiil i palaw naa rub'anam.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' chi chii' i palaw</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusahchiik kik'ux ruuk' taq i naa ak'ulum.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' taqe i kireey ma' k'isiin ta naa kiyo'jiik,</para>
  <para style="q">naakiyojom i kiwach.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Re' taqe i yakool aj pan tokoom tinamit</para>
  <para style="q">i naa kiyo'jiik noq naakilom taq i naa ak'ulum, eh</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusahchiik taq awach chi jumpech,</para>
  <para style="q">inko'q taqe aweh, inki Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">Re' i Dios xuq'or chi naa ruchaliik i ti' k'axik chinaah i kireey i aj Tiro.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq je' wili i cha q'or reh i kireey i aj Tiro: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' reh q'e' xunimb'isaj riib',</para>
  <para style="q">noq tzunlik paruye'aab', xukoj riib' chi Dios,</para>
  <para style="q">xa ruum chi kotimaj riij chi plata i rutinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">Xanaah re' xa winaq wo' hoq ma' re' ta Dios,</para>
  <para style="q">xukapaaj chi je' rukab' i</para>
  <para style="q">runa'ojb'al i Dios i runa'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />¿Mi xiik' naah re' i runa'ojb'al i reh chuwach i Daniel?</para>
  <para style="q">¿Mi chu'nchel re' i na'ojb'al reht'al?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruum chi wilik runa'ojb'al, eh chi q'e' kow i rub'an riib'</para>
  <para style="q">ma' k'isiin xb'ehomb'rik.</para>
  <para style="q">Xunujisaj taqe i ru kaxa ruuk' i oro, ruuk' i plata.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh ruum chi wilik runa'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="q">chi yak xumol wach i rub'ehomal,</para>
  <para style="q">eh ruuk' i rub'ehomal ma' k'isiin ta xunimb'isaj riib'.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin i Dios i nuq'or,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">chi ruum chi xukoj riib' chi dios.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuk'amam taqe chaloq i tokoom tinamit chub'anariik reh.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i q'e' kow kiib',</para>
  <para style="q">eh ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa rub'aan keh</para>
  <para style="q">atoob' ta naq q'e' holohik,</para>
  <para style="q">naakiye'em wach ak'al i ruholwochiil.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' reh naa kikutum</para>
  <para style="q">paruchamiil i palaw</para>
  <para style="q">xiik' nah ti'kiil i kimik naa ruk'ulum.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />¿Mi konaa ruq'orom re' chikiwach taqe i aj ixowaal</para>
  <para style="q">chi re' reh i Dios?</para>
  <para style="q">Re' reh ma' re' ta Dios xa winaq wo' hoq</para>
  <para style="q">ma' nee ta ruko'leej riib' chikiwach i naa rukansaniik reh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' reey re' re' naa rukanteesjiik</para>
  <para style="q">kuum i tokoom tinamit,</para>
  <para style="q">chi xa je' kikanteesjik ma' kinimanik ta weh, tiko'q reh, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha tz'uyej i tz'uuy reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis reh i kireey i aj Tiro, je' wili i cha q'or reh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' reh korik naq wach ruk'ux,</para>
  <para style="q">wilik naq runa'ojb'al, eh q'e' naq holohik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Je' naa chupaam i ye'aab' ru Edén i Dios wilik.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' reh xixoyej riib' ruuk' taqe ab'aj kirob' rotik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' ruuk' taqe i crisolito, jade,</para>
  <para style="q">topacio, kornalina,</para>
  <para style="q">jaspe, zafiro granate, esmeralda,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i chib'ih i wilik reh, ka'xikin re' ruuk' i oro,</para>
  <para style="q">xa re' wo' rukorjiik i rutz'uhk'riik chee reh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin xnukoj chi rilariik i tinamit chi je' jinaj ánjel.</para>
  <para style="q">Je' naa chinaah i nuSantolaj yuuq' xnuyeew,</para>
  <para style="q">je' naa xilak ab'aj xan rob'rotik chik xnuyeew chi b'ehik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noq xokik chi taaq'anik</para>
  <para style="q">xti manlik wo' naq wach i runa'ojb'al xub'an,</para>
  <para style="q">xa re' la' korehtaal xutoq'aa' rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ruum chi yohb'aal wach i yak i xub'an</para>
  <para style="q">xutoq'aa' rub'aan i yiib' wach na'ojb'al</para>
  <para style="q">je' wo' taqe i mahk.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum i re' xwesaj wo' chik chinaah i nuSantolaj yuuq'</para>
  <para style="q">xwesaj chi kixilak i ánjel incha'jinik naq reh,</para>
  <para style="q">eh xwesaj wo' chi kixilak ab'aj xan rob'rotik chik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ruum i ruholwochiil q'e' xunimb'isaj riib',</para>
  <para style="q">ruum chiyohb'aalchik wach i rub'an riib'</para>
  <para style="q">xsahchik paruk'ux i runa'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' hin naa nuye'em wach ak'al xa se'lb'al chik</para>
  <para style="q">naa nukanaam wii' chikiwach taqe i reey.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' reh yohb'aal wach i mahk xub'an,</para>
  <para style="q">i leq' ruuk' i yak xub'an, xich'uwarisa paam i ye'aab' kinlooq'jik wii'.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruum aj re', re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa ruqopiik ruq'aq'al i rutinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh chu'nchel naa kilwiik reh chi xchajrik chik ruum i q'aaq'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit ineht'alinik wach</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruchaliik kiyo'jiik</para>
  <para style="q">ruum i naa ruk'ulum.</para>
  <para style="q">Xa ma' xta chik kamaj naa rukahniik</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusahchiik wach, tiko'q reh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik chi xkik'ul i ti' k'axik i aj Sidón</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq ti tz'ehtanoq reje i wilik wii' i tinamit Sidón cha q'or rib'iral reh i naa ruk'ulum, je' wili i cha q'or reh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili xuq'or chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' hin ma' k'isiin i nujosq'iil chikinaah i aj Sidón</para>
  <para style="q">naa kiin kiloq'em noq naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naakilom i nuSantohiil.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i</para>
  <para style="q">kaq yab'ilaal chikinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">naa rub'eeh kik' pan kitinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i kamnaq xa aha' naa kikahniik chi tuch'ulkeeb',</para>
  <para style="q">xa aha' naakikanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Israel keh ma' naa ta chik rub'aan ti' k'axik keh.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' i je' rutoq' k'iix imb'aan keh kuum</para>
  <para style="q">i tinamit wilik chi kijunsuut inixowanik kiwach.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naakinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi naa wo' chik numolom kiwach i aj Israel pan kitinamiit naa wesam taqe chaloq chupaam i tinamit nutukem reje wii' kiwach. Naa nuk'uhtaam i nuSantohiil chikiwach i nimaq tinamit. Re' taqe i aj Israel naa wo' chik nuye'em taqe pan kitinamiit, re' wo' i tinamit nuye'em cho reh i Jacob re' waj kamanoom. <verse number="26" style="v" />Ar naa kik'achariik chi ma' xta chik ti' naa rub'aan keh. Eh ar naa kiyejaam kipaat, naa kitikim i ki uuva. Eh re' hin naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk i tinamit chi kijunsuut, re' taqe i ixowinik i kiwach i aj Israel. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios inkinimaj i aj Israel, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruq'orariik i ti' k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh chupaam kab'laj rub'eeh i ru lajeeb' poh reh i ru lajeeb' haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq chatz'ehtaaj reje i kireey i aj Egipto cha q'or reje ree reh, eh keh chu'nchel i tinamit Egipto, i ti' k'axik naakik'ulum, je' wili i cha q'or keh: <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' hin q'e' inwixow wach i kireey i aj Egipto.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' reh je' rukab' i qamaan k'ap wilik pan nim ha' je' wili i ruq'or:</para>
  <para style="q">Re' nim ha' Nilo weh hin,</para>
  <para style="q">re' hin xinyej-anik reh, inki.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin naa wesam chi reyil</para>
  <para style="q">ruch'ihil taqe i raj kamanoom.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa nub'anam reh je' rukab' imb'aan reh i josq'laj chikop</para>
  <para style="q">pan nim ha' inkojarik chee loklok laj ch'ihch' panchii'</para>
  <para style="q">inqerjik chaloq inlechlojik taqe chaloq i kar chi riij.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuk'amam reje i panchiq yuuq' i reh, eh</para>
  <para style="q">chu'nchel i rutinamiit naa kikahniik tuuch' chinaah i wach ak'al</para>
  <para style="q">ma' naa ta rumolariik ni xata naa rumuhqiik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' la' taqe i josq'laj chikop,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i k'uch naa ruk'uxwiik reh i ruti'jolal.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruuk' i re' chu'nchel i tinamit Egipto</para>
  <para style="q">naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh noq xkisik' kitoob'jiik i aj Israel ruuk' i kireey i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="q">re' reh xkahnik chi xa je' rukab' i ma' kow ta laj kaxlan aaj.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noq xkisik' naq toob'al kiib' ruuk' ma' kow ta k'isinoq xuyok' taqe,</para>
  <para style="q">je' rukab' i kaxlan aaj xa re' yu' intoq.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh noq xkaaj naq kichopom kiib' ruuk'</para>
  <para style="q">ma' kow ta k'isinoq, je' rukab' i kaxlan aaj xa re' yu' impaxik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi naa nuk'amam taqe chaloq i aj ixowaal, ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa taq kaat kikansam i hat, je' wo' taqe i aachikoop. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i tinamit Egipto naa rukahniik chi xan tz'irik chik paam. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem i chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. Ruum re' i kireey i xuq'or chi je' wili: Re' nim ha' Nilo weh hin, re' hin xinyej-anik reh, inki. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' hin yohb'aal wach i nujosq'iil chikinaah, je' wo' chinaah i kinim haa'. Re' hin naa nukanaam i Egipto chi xan tz'irik chik paam, xa je' chik rukab' i ye'aab' chiq yuuq'. Ar naa rutohq'iik reje Migdo naa ruponiik Sevene, eh naa ruponiik Etiopía. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh ma' jino'q chik i tinamit, ma' jino'q chik i chikop naa rik'iik chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' chuwach i ka'winaq haab'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hin naa nukanaam i Egipto chi xan tz'irik chik paam chuwach i ka'winaq haab'. Re' taqe i tinamit ruchopom naah naa nusacham kiwach ma' xata je' rukab' i naakik'ulum i tokoom tinamit. Eh naa wesam taqe reje pan tinamit, naa nutukem reje kiwach chupaam taqe i nimaq tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Noq ik'inaq chik i ka'winaq haab' naa wo' chik wesam taqe chaloq i aj Egipto, chupaam i nimaq tinamit nutukem reje wii' kiwach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh naa wo' chik wesam taqe chaloq ar naa wo' chik nuk'amam taqe reje chupaam i ye'aab' Patros re' i aasjinaq taqe wii'. Ar naa kiyejaam kitinamiit, xa re' la' naa rukahniik chi xama' xta kajaawriik. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i kitinamiit xa k'isiin chik i rajaawriik naa ruwihiik chuwach i kajaawriik i tokoom tinamit, naa wesam i rajaawriik ma' awach ta chik i tinamit naa ruq'atam wach. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel ma' naa ta chik kich'ikaam kik'ux kuuk' i aj Egipto. Ar naa kinab'eem i aj Israel chi sahcheel taqe noq xponik kipahqaaj chi toob'jiik ar. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achalkiin, tiko'q inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh pan k'amb'al rub'eeh i peet poh reh i wuquub' ru ka'winaq haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia je' wili i xuq'or weh i Dios: <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq i nuq'or aweh chi re' i Nabucodonosor kireey i aj Babilonia re' taqe i ru soldado xkian i kowlaj q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit Tiro. Re' taqe i ru soldado xelik i rismaal kinaah xch'ol i kiij ruum i ihq, xa re' la' xama' xta wo' hoq i xkik'ax ruuk' i q'aq'inik xkian kuuk' i aj Tiro. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Naa nuye'em q'ab' chi re' chik i Nabucodonosor naa ruchopwiik naah i tinamit Egipto. Eh naa ruq'uchum chu'nchel i kib'ehomal, je' wo' chu'nchel i chib'ih keh, ruuk' taqe i re' naa rutojom taqe i ru soldado. <verse number="20" style="v" />Naa nuye'em q'ab' chi re' i Nabucodonosor naa ruchopwiik naah i tinamit Egipto re' re' i rutojb'aal chi riij i q'aq'inik xub'an kuuk' i aj Tiro. Ruum re' wo' hin xinkojwik reh chi numoso noq xub'an i re', inki QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh chupaam ponoq i q'iij re' re' naa wo' chik nuye'em kajaawriik i aj Israel. Eh re' hat Ezequiel naa aq'orom wib'iral keh. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki weh.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik rib'iral i ti' k'axik xchalik chikinaah i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or rib'iral keh i aj Egipto i naakik'ulum je' wili i cha q'or keh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kik'er kichii' ruum ruti'kiil kik'ux</para>
  <para style="q">chi riij i q'iij k'ulik iloq reh</para>
  <para style="q">noq naa nuye'em i runimaal</para>
  <para style="q">ti' k'axik chikinaah i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naa ruchaliik i q'aq'inik chikinaah i aj Egipto,</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusachariik kiwach chi jumpech,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naa relq'jiik kib'ehomal,</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' taqe i aj Etiopía ma' k'isiin ta naa kiyo'jiik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit naa ruko'liniik keh i aj Egipto,</para>
  <para style="q">naa wo' kikanteesjiik panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Naa wo' rub'aan keh i aj Etiopía i aj Fut, i aj Lud,</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i aj Arabia, i aj Lidia.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or i QaJaaw:</para>
  <para style="q">chu'nchel i tinamit naakitowiik keh i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="q">naa kikanteesjiik panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' i runimaal wach tinamit Egipto naakiye'em panak'al,</para>
  <para style="q">ar naa rutohq'iik cho Migdol, eh naa ruponiik ko ar Sevene, inki.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' i Egipto xa re' wo' reh naa rukahniik chi xan tz'irik chik paam. Re' taqe i tinamit ruchopom naah naa wo' rukahniik chi xan tz'irik chik kipaam. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin naa nukojom ruq'aq'a i tinamit Egipto, eh naa wo' nusacham kiwach chu'nchel i naa ruko'liniik reh. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noq naa ruk'ulariik taqe re' naa nutaq'aam reje i taqareel pan barco, chi ruyohb'eesjiik i tinamit Etiopía, re' i ma' rukapaaj taj chi naa ruk'ulariik taqe re'. Noq naa rib'iram rib'iral ma' k'isiin ta naa ruyo'jiik. Re' taqe re' xailook' chik ink'ularik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi re' i Nabucodonosor i kireey i aj Babilonia naa nukojom chi rusachariik wach i rub'ehomal i tinamit Egipto. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i reey re' re' naa ruk'amam taqe reje chi riij i ru soldado xiik' nah kijosq'iil noq naa rojiik kisacham wach i tinamit Egipto. Eh naa kia'nam reh i tinamit re' re' naakinujisam paam chi kamnaq. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' hin naa nuchiqsam taqe i nim ha' ar Egipto. Eh naa nuq'asam i pan kiq'ab' i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al. Pan kiq'ab' i tokoom tinamit chi rusachariik kiwach i keh je' wo' i kiye'aab'. Re' wili re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusacham wach i kitiyoox i aj Egipto,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">je' wo' i kitiyoox i aj Menfis.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' i tinamit Egipto ma' naa ta chik</para>
  <para style="q">ruwihiik jino'q i aj taaq'oom chinaah,</para>
  <para style="q">ma' k'isiin ta naa kiyo'jiik ruum i naa ruk'ulariik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh naa nusacham kiwach i aj pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh Egipto.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh naa nuk'atam i tinamit Zoán, naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk i aj Tebas.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hin naa wik'sam i nujosq'iil chikinaah i aj Sin, re' inye'wik rukowiil kik'ux i aj Egipto. Naa wo' rusacham wach i kib'ehomal i aj Tebas. <verse number="16" style="v" />Naa nukojom ruq'aq'al i tinamit Egipto, eh ma' k'isiin i ti' naakik'ulum i aj Sin. Eh naa rusachariik kiwach aj Tebas, eh re' taqe i aj Menfis juneliik naa kiwihiik panti' k'axik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'ijolaq aj Avén, taqe i aj Pibeset ar naa kikanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. Eh re' taqe i ixoq naa kik'amariik reje pan tokoom tinamit. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh noq naa wesam i kajaawriik i aj Egipto naa ruqequmriik wach i q'iij chi keh i aj Tefnes. Re' i tinamit Egipto ma' naa ta chik rub'anam i taaq'anik je' na naa rutz'apam naah chi suutz'. Re' taqe i tinamit kichopom naah naa kik'amariik reje pan tokoom tinamit. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah i aj Egipto reh i kiye'ariik panti' k'axik. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh noq wuquub' q'iij chik ruk'amam rub'eeh i peet poh reh i ru lajeeb' haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia, re' i QaJaaw Dio, je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="21" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' hin xwesaj chik i rajaawriik kireey i aj Egipto je' naa xtoq i q'ab' ma' awach ta naa ruq'omaniik reh, ma' awach ta wo' chik imb'ak'wik wach reh, reh chi nee wo' chik inchol ruchopariik i ruq'aslaj ch'ihch' reh i q'aq'inik. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi yohb'aal wach i nujosq'iil chinaah i kireey i aj Egipto. Naa wesam i rajaawriik chi jumpech je' naa nutoqom kab'chel i q'ab' reh chi ma' nee ta chik i rub'an ruchopariik i ruq'aslaj ch'ihch'. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin xa aha' naa nutukem kiwach i aj Egipto chupaam taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' sut i wach ak'al. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' chik i kireey i aj Babilonia naa nuye'em rajaawriik. Je' naa nuye'em q'aslaj ch'ihch' pan q'ab', reh chi naa rukansam i kireey i aj Egipto. Korehtaal i ruk'er chii' chikiwach i nixowanik wach. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin korik i nuq'or chi re' chik i kireey i aj Babilonia naa nuye'em rajaawriik naa wesam i rajaawriik i kireey i aj Egipto. Eh noq naa nuye'em pan q'ab' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' ruuk' i re' naa rub'anam keh i aj Egipto. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh naa nutukem reje kiwach i aj Egipto, chi je' pankok' tinamit, chi je' pan nimaq tinamit. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">Re' i kireey i aj Egipto xpajarik ruuk' i chee' chakaltee'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh chupaam i peet q'iij reh i roox poh reh i rujunlaaj haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia, je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or reh i kireey i aj Egipto, je' wo' keh i rutinamiit chi je' wili: Re' i Dios je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">¿Chib'ih aj uuk' naa nupajam i runimaal wach?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i runimaal wach i kireey i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="q">je' rukab' i chakaltee' wilik Líbano</para>
  <para style="q">xa holohik chik taqe i q'ab' i rumujej taqe cho naah i ch'ahn</para>
  <para style="q">imponik kopan taxaaj i ju'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' jab' inqajik chaloq xtowik reh chi xk'ihik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh wilik taqe i rooq i ha' chi junsuut.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' ha' re' re' int'aqsanik reh chu'nchel</para>
  <para style="q">i chee' wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' re' re'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruum chi ma' k'isiin i ruha'iil wilik</para>
  <para style="q">q'e' xk'ihik chikiwach</para>
  <para style="q">i chee' wilkeeb' panch'ahn.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh ma' k'isiin i q'ab' xwihik nimaq xi ponik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh k'ih b'uhr wach i chikop inkiyejaa' i kisuuq' nah taq q'ab'.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh k'ih b'uhr kiwach i josq'laj chikop</para>
  <para style="q">inasjik i kak'uun chi ri'sil.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' taqe i nimaq tinamit kihi'lik chi ri'sil i rumuuj.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' chee' re' re' rujalwaach</para>
  <para style="q">i kireey i aj Egipto,</para>
  <para style="q">xanajt chik naah, xa nimaq chik rooq taqe i q'ab',</para>
  <para style="q">eh ha' taqe paam ak'al wilik wii' i raa'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' i chakaltee' wilik chupaam i ye'aab'</para>
  <para style="q">xuyeew wii' i peet winaq i Dios ma' xureq ta chi je' rukab' i chee' re' re'.</para>
  <para style="q">Ma' jino'q i chee' xureq chi je' k'ihaal i q'ab', chi je' re' i xaq,</para>
  <para style="q">wilik chupaam, i ye'aab' Edén</para>
  <para style="q">xureq chi je' holwochiil i chee' re' re'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hin q'e' holohik xnukanaa',</para>
  <para style="q">ma' k'isiin i q'ab',</para>
  <para style="q">ruum chi q'e' naq holohik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe i chee' wilkeeb' panye'aab' Edén</para>
  <para style="q">xtohq'ik kikaqwachem.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or i Dios re' chee' re' re' xiik' naah najtiil naah, xponik ko taxaaj i ju' ma' k'isiin ta xk'ihik ruum i re' q'e' xunimb'isaj riib'. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' chee' re' re' rujalwaach i kireey i aj Egipto, ruum aj re' naa nukanaam pan q'ab' i k'amal b'eeh inchalik pan tokoom tinamit. Eh naa nuye'em panti' k'axik je' rukab' i ruk'ul chi reh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i tokoom tinamit xiik' naah kijosq'iil naa kiyok'wiik reh, i naakiq'eb'em chi rutkeel. Noq naa ruq'ehb'iik naa rutoqib'iik chinaah taqe i rax chee', chinaah taqe i yuuq' pan rooq yuuq' wilkeeb' panruyuq'ul i tinamit. Eh chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' chi ri'sil i rumuuj naakimolom chi elik, naa kikanaam chi rutkeel. <verse number="13" style="v" />Noq q'eb'lik chik wach ak'al naa kichaliik wih-oq chinaah taqe i chikop kirupinik pan taxaaj, je' wo' chu'nchel i chikop wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh yu'naak reje chi qawach ma' jino'q chik i chee' naa ruk'ihiik chi je' rukab' noq xk'ihik i chee' re' re' atoob' ta wilik ruha'il, atoob' ta kojooj ruha'iil chi korik, ma' jaruuj chik naa ruponiik ko taxaaj i ju'. Naa la' rusachariik kiwach naakik'ulum keh je' rukab' inkik'ul i winaq noq kikimik kimuhqik panjul, inooj kireq taqe i kamnaq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios i nuq'or noq re' chee' re' re' naa nutaq'aam reje pan kiye'aab' i kamnaq. Eh naa nuchiqsam i palaw, ruum ruti'kiil k'uxliis, eh naa wo' nupab'aam i nim ha', ma' naa ta chik rub'eeh rooq. Ruuk' taqe wili naa nuye'em ruti'kiil kik'ux i aj Líbano, eh chu'nchel i chee' naa rukuxiik kichiqiik. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruqehb'iik i nimlaj chee' wili naa kiyo'jiik i nimaq tinamit. Chu'nchel i chee' sik'ooj wach wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' Edén naa rusuuqb'iik kik'ux noq naa rojiik pan kiye'aab' kamnaq. Eh naa wo' rusuuqb'iik kik'ux i chee' wilkeeb' Líbano re' taqe i kojooj kiha'iil chi korik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Je' wo' taqe i keh naa wo' kimuhqik naa rojiik kireqem taqe i kamnaq panq'aq'inik. Re' taqe i tinamit wilkeeb' chi ri'sil i rajaawriik naa kitukem kiib' chupaam i ju'jun chi tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ma' jino'q i chee' xwihik panye'aab' Edén xureq i ruholwochiil, i rajaawriik i chee' re' re'. Xa re' la' naa wo' ruq'ehb'iik wach ak'al je' rukab' noq xq'ehb'ik wach ak'al i chee' xwihik panye'aab' Edén. Eh naa ruwihiik chi kixilak i ma' kinimanik ta ree Dios, chi kixilak i xikimik panq'aq'inik. Re' i chee' re' re' rujalwaach i kireey i aj Egipto, ruch'ihil i rutinamiit, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i kireey i aj Egipto xpajarik ruuk' i josq'laj chikop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh pampeet q'iij reh i rukab'laaj poh reh i rukab'laaj haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha tz'uyej reh i kireey i aj Egipto i tz'uuy reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis, je' wili i neenaq'or reh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' hat je' akab' i kaq b'ahlam</para>
  <para style="q">chi kixilak i nimaq tinamit,</para>
  <para style="q">je' wo' akab' i josq'laj chikop wilik panim ha'</para>
  <para style="q">i rut'axlom paam i ha' ruuk' i rooq,</para>
  <para style="q">eh i ruch'uwa'risaj wach.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' hin naa nutaq'aam reje i ma' k'isa tinamit naa ruchopariik kuum je' naa ruxirob' i naa kikojom.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kiqerem wach ak'al,</para>
  <para style="q">naa rukahniik chi kutlik i ruti'jolal.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' taqe i k'uch naa ruk'uxwiik i reh,</para>
  <para style="q">korehtaal naakinujiik i josq'laj</para>
  <para style="q">chikop noq naa kik'uxum keh.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi xa aha' naa rukahniik</para>
  <para style="q">chi tuch'lik i ruti'jolal wataq yuuq' k'ixkaab'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i rukik'eel naa rut'aqsam wach aak'al,</para>
  <para style="q">naa runujiik wataq yuuq',</para>
  <para style="q">wataq k'ixkaab', pantaq rooq ha'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh noq naa nusacham wach</para>
  <para style="q">naa ruq'equumriik paam i taxaaj,</para>
  <para style="q">ma' naa ta chik kisihq'iniik i ch'umiil, i q'iij, ruum i suutz'.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh re' poh ma' naa ta chik rusihq'iniik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ruum i ru mahk i reh</para>
  <para style="q">ma' naa ta chik kisihq'iniik i saqum wilkeeb' cho pan taxaaj,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nuq'equm b'risam paam i taxaaj, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh ma' k'isiin i tinamit naa ruchaliik kiyo'jiik noq naa kib'iram chi naa ruk'amariik reje i reh, je' wo' taqe i rutinamiit pan tokoom tinamit, re' i ma' keht'al ta naq. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ma' k'isiin i tinamit naa rusahchiik kik'ux noq naa kib'iram i naa ruk'ulum noq naa rukimiik, naa ruchaliik kiyo'jiik taqe i kireey. Eh noq naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naakesam chaloq i kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' taqe i aj ixowaal chikiwach naakib'arb'otiik ruum kiyo'jiik. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Dios je' wili i xuq'or:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i ruq'aslaj ch'ihch' i Nabucodonosor naa rukanteesjiik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i ru soldado xiik' naakijosq'iil</para>
  <para style="q">ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa kikansam i</para>
  <para style="q">rutinamiit i kireey i aj Egipto</para>
  <para style="q">atoob' ta xiik' wo' naq naah kik'ihaal.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin naa nukansam</para>
  <para style="q">taqe i ruwaakaax i nuk'inik reh i ruhaa',</para>
  <para style="q">eh ma' naa ta chik kiyeq'em chii' i ha',</para>
  <para style="q">ni xata re' taqe i tinamit naakiyeq' wiik chii'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chi je' re' naa nusaaqb'isam wach i ha',</para>
  <para style="q">xa je' chik saqiil wach aseite naa rukaniik,</para>
  <para style="q">eh naa rub'eeh rooq i ha' chi korik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq naa nusacham wach i tinamit Egipto,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nukanaam chi xan tz'irik chik paam.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa runab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios,</para>
  <para style="q">tiko'q reh panatz'uuy, inki weh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i tz'uuy wili reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis, inaakitz'uyem chu'nchel ixoq wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i tinamit ruum i ruti'kiil kik'ux chi riij i tinamit Egipto, chikiij taqe i wilkeeb' ar, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ho'lajuuj rub'eeh i poh reh irukab'laaj haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia, je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="18" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha tz'uyej i tz'uuy reh i ruti'kiil k'uxliis chikiij i rutinamiit i Egipto, je' wo' chikiij taqe ixoq wilkeeb' ar, chikiij taqe i k'amal kib'eeh, je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' taqe i wilik kajaawriik xkuxik kikimiik xkik'ul keh je' rukab' i xkik'ul i kansamaj taqe chaloq.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />¿Mi xiik' taq naah aholwochiil re' chi ma' naa ta taq akanteesjiik?</para>
  <para style="q">Xti korik la' chi naa taq akanteesjiik chi je' rukab'</para>
  <para style="q">i ma' kinimanik ta reh i Dios, tiko'q keh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Egipto junkimiik taqe kuuk'</para>
  <para style="q">naa kikanteesjiik panq'aq'inik ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch',</para>
  <para style="q">eh je' wo' taqe i ruk'ihaal tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh q'e' kow kiib' wilkeeb' pan kiye'aab' i kamnaq,</para>
  <para style="q">naa kik'ulwiik keh i aj Egipto, je' wo' intowik naq keh,</para>
  <para style="q">je' wili i naa kiq'orom: Re' taqe i re' xi chalik kahnoq ayu'</para>
  <para style="q">kuch'ihil taqe i xi kanteesjik panq'aq'inik re'</para>
  <para style="q">i ma' kinimanik ta reh i Dios, inko'q taqe.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' kireey i aj Asiria ar wilkeeb'</para>
  <para style="q">kuch'ihil taqe chu'nchel i ki soldado wilkeeb' pan kijuul</para>
  <para style="q">chu'nchel i re' panq'aq'inik xikimik.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh xiik' naah chamiil muqulkeeb' ruum i ki soldado,</para>
  <para style="q">eh xkiyohb'isaj taqe i tinamit kok'achalkeeb' wo' naq,</para>
  <para style="q">xa re' la' xa xkuxik wo' kikimiik panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh yu'naak panyejaal i muqulkeeb' wii' i aj Asiria muqulkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' kireey i aj Elam kuch'ihil taqe i ki soldado muqulkeeb' pan kijul.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh chu'nchel i re' panq'aq'inik xikimik,</para>
  <para style="q">re' taqe re' xkiyohb'isaj taqe i tinamit noq kok'achalkeeb',</para>
  <para style="q">eh yu'naak ti' xkik'ul,</para>
  <para style="q">ruum xi muhqik chik chupaam i ye'aab'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh yu'naak kamnaq chik i kireey i aj Elam</para>
  <para style="q">muqlik chik chi kixilak taqe i ru soldado.</para>
  <para style="q">Chu'nchel taqe i re' ma' nkinimaj taj i Dios,</para>
  <para style="q">xkuxik kikimiik panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh xkiyohb'isaj chee tinamit noq kok'achalkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="q">Xa re' la' yu'naak q'e' ti' xkik'ul ruum xi muhqik chik,</para>
  <para style="q">jinaj xi kahnik wii' chi kixilak taqe i kamnaq.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' taqe i kireey i aj Mesec,</para>
  <para style="q">je' wo' hoq i kireey i aj Tubal, kuch'ihil taqe i ki soldado.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh chu'nchel taqe i re' ma' xkinimaj taj i Dios.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh panq'aq'inik xi kanteesjik</para>
  <para style="q">ruum xkiyohb'isaj i tinamit noq kok'achalkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' keh ma' xi muhqik taj</para>
  <para style="q">chi je' rukab' noq kimuhqik i aj q'aq'ineel najtir.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' keh junqajiik taqe panjul ruuk' i kitz'a'amb'aal reh i q'aq'inik,</para>
  <para style="q">inye'arik chikinaah i kiq'aslaj ch'ihch'.</para>
  <para style="q">Je' re' noq xi muhqik atoob' ta ma' k'isiin wo' naq</para>
  <para style="q">xkiyohb'isaj i tinamit noq kok'achalkeeb'.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Egipto je' re' i naakik'ulum</para>
  <para style="q">naa rusahchiik kiwach chi kixilak</para>
  <para style="q">i ma' kinimanik ta reh i Dios,</para>
  <para style="q">jinaj naakimuhqiik wii' kuuk' i kamnaq taqe chaloq panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taqe i kireey i aj Edom ruch'ihil taqe i k'amal</para>
  <para style="q">kib'eeh, atoob' ta xwihik wo' cho kajaawriik</para>
  <para style="q">xa xiooj wo' wih-oq chi kixilak i kansamaj taqe</para>
  <para style="q">chaloq panq'aq'inik ar wilkeeb' wii'</para>
  <para style="q">i kamnaq ma' xinimanik ta reh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ar wilkeeb' i ajaab'ees xi wihik cho</para>
  <para style="q">pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, je' wo' taqe i aj Sidón.</para>
  <para style="q">Re' keh xti wilik wo' naq kajaawriik,</para>
  <para style="q">xkiyohb'isaj wo' chaloq taqe i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="q">Eh yu'naak jinaj chik wilkeeb' wii' kuuk' i kansamaj taqe chaloq panq'aq'inik.</para>
  <para style="q">Q'e' ti' xkik'ul ruum jinaj xi muhqik wii' kuuk' i ma' xinimanik ta reh i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh noq naa rilom i kireey i aj Egipto wilkeeb' pan kiye'aab' i kamnaq taqe i rutinamiit taqe i ru soldado xikimik panq'aq'inik naa ruch'iklojiik ruk'ux. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' i kireey i aj Egipto i ruyohb'isaj taqe i tinamit. Xa re' la' re' hin naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa rojiik muhqoq chi kixilak taqe i kamnaq ma' kinimanik ta reh i Dios, re' taqe i xi kanteesjik panq'aq'inik, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i rukamaj naa rub'anam i aj cha'joom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 3:16-21">Ez 3.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq je' wili i cha q'or keh aatinamiit: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or: Noq naa nuye'em i q'aq'inik chinaah jino'q i tinamit, re' keh naa k'isik'im wach jino'q i winaq chi kixilak, eh naa kikojom chi kaj cha'joom. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' reh noq nee rilow chi xiooj chik k'oloq aj q'aq'ineel ma' najt ta ruuk' i tinamit jumehq'iil neeruxulej i tuun, reh chi neenkinab'eej i tinamit. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh awach i xrib'iraj chi xuuljik i tuun, eh ma' xta raaj reh, eh wila' xiooj k'oloq i aj ixowaal, eh xkanteesjik xa re' reh naa ruye'em riib' chi kimik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruum xrib'iraj wo' naq noq xuuljik i tuun, eh ma' xta xraaj reh. Eh awach i xrib'iraj noq neenxuuljik i tuun, neerusik' ko'lemb'al riib' neeruko'leej riij i ruk'achariik. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i aj cha'joom xrilow wo' naq chi xiooj k'oloq i aj q'aq'ineel chinaah i tinamit, eh ma' xuxulej taj i rutuun reh chi neenkeht'aliij, eh wila' wilik jino'q i xkimik ru mahk i reh. Eh re' hin wach naah i aj cha'joom re' re' naa nuye'em i rukimiik, re' reh naa rutojwiik riij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq hat wo' nukojom chi cha'jen keh i tinamit Israel, je' wo' re' noq naa animam taqe i nuk'uhb'aal naa nuq'orom aweh, ruuk' i re' naa akojom kina'ojb'al. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh noq neenuq'or i hin chi naa rukimiik i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al, wila' re' hat ma' xaq'or reh chi naa rukanaam i ruyiib' wach na'ojb'al re' reh ruum i ru mahk naa rukimiik. Xa re' la' re' hin wach anaah i hat naa nuye'em i rukimiik, eh re' hat naa atojwiik riij. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh raaj wila' re' hat xaq'or reh i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al chi chukanaa' rub'aan i ma' holohik taj. Eh wila' re' reh ma' xraaj taj re' reh ruum i ru mahk naa rukimiik, eh re' hat naa ako'leem riij ak'achariik, inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i rub'eeh i Dios korik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 18:21-32">Ez 18.21-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' hat rak'uun winaq je' wili i cha q'or keh i aj Israel: Re' taq i hat je' wili taq inaq'or: Re' hoj xiik' naah i qamahk yohb'aal wach i ma' holohik taj inqa a'n ruum i re' naa rusachariik qawach, ¿nik' chik wach noq neeqohk'achariik? tiki taq. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' hin i k'achlik Dios ma' nwaaj ta chi neenkimik parumahk i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al, inwaaj la' chi nee rukanaa' reh chi neen wihik ruk'achariik. Re' taqe i aj Israel inchol kianaam i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. ¿Chib'ih reet noq naa kikimiik pankimahk? <verse number="12" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or keh i aatinamiit: Re' i korik wach ruk'ux wila' xmahkunik wo' chik ma' naa ta ruko'leem riij i ruk'achariik, eh wila' re' i yiib' wach na'ojb'al xukanaa' i mahk naa ruko'ljiik. Eh raaj wila' re' korik wach ruk'ux i xmahkunik wo' chik ma' nee ta ruko'leej riij i ruk'achariik, ni xata ruum i holohik rub'anam chaloq. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh noq neenuq'or i hin chi naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik i korik wach ruk'ux, eh xuch'ikaa'-oq ruk'ux ruuk' i rukorkiil wach ruk'ux xooj-oq wo' chik chub'anariik i mahk, re' hin ma' naa ta nukojom paruman i holohik xub'an. Naa la' rukanteesjiik ruum taqe i ru mahk xub'an wo' chik ruka'peech. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh wila' xnuq'or reh i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al chi naa rukimiik nee wo' inkimik. Eh wila' xukanaa' i mahk, re' chik taqe i holohik xub'an xti korik chi ma' naa ta rukanteesjiik. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh nee wo' chik i rusutej i kanamaj ruuk' chi riij i kemeel tumiin, oon taqe i relq'aam. Eh wila' xub'an i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal inye'wik k'acharik, eh wila' xukanaa' rub'aan chu'nchel i yiib' wach, xti korik i chi ma' naa ta rukanteesjiik, naa la' ruwihiik ruk'achariik. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh ruum chi holohik chik imb'anik, re' chik taqe i rub'ehel i rub'aan naa ruwihiik ruk'achariik. Ma' jino'q chik i ru mahk rub'anam naa ruk'uliik panuk'ux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i aatinamiit naa kiq'orom chi ma' re' ta rub'ehel i k'ahchi' kiin. Xanaah re', re' keh ma' re' ta rub'ehel i k'ahchi' keeb'. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh wila' re' korik wach ruk'ux xukanaa' wo' chik rub'aan i korik, xutoq'aa' wo' chik rub'aan i ma' i holohik taj, ruum i re' naa rukanteesjiik. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i yiib' wach runa'ojb'al re' chik i korik, re' chik i rub'ehel i rub'an naa wo' ruwihiik ruk'achariik ruum i re'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel naa kiq'orom chi ma' re' ta rub'ehel i k'achi' kiin. Xa re' la' re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah, re' q'oreel chib'ih i xkian, chib'ih i xkiq'or, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' noq xchoparik naah ruka'peech i tinamit Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh pan ho'oob' rub'eeh i ru lajeeb' poh reh irukab'laaj haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia, Jinaj i winaq xub'an reje elik Jerusaleem xooj k'oloq wuuk' ar xuq'or weh chi re' i tinamit Jerusaleem xkichop wo' chik naah i aj ixowaal. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios xuyeew chee q'ab' chi nunaah paruxq'eqiil noq komajaa' inooj k'oloq i winaq xub'an chee elik Jerusaleem, xuteh i nuchii'. Eh noq xponik i winaq re' re' wahq'eq ma' xin kahnik ta chik meem xnub'an chik ruq'orob'jiik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or weh QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="24" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, re' taqe i aj Israel wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' k'ahchi' wii' ti' k'axik, je' wili inkiq'or: Re' i Abraham xa jinaj wo' chi riib' noq wihik chaloq rehchaaj i ye'aab' wili. Re' aj naa chik re' hoj ma' neenqehchaaj ruum xiik' naah qak'ihaal, inki taqe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' i hat je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' keh inkik'ux i tiwik chi kik' paam, inkiloq'ej i tiyoox, eh inkikansaj kas kichaaq', ruum taqe re' ma' ruk'ul taj neenkehchaaj i ye'aab' re' re'. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' keh inki a'n ikaansanik ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch' inki a'n i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inkich'uwarisaj wach i kikaxaro, ruum taqe i re' ma' ruk'ul ta chi neenkehchaaj ye'aab' re' re'. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios kinq'orik reh i chi re' taqe i wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' k'ahchi' wii' i ti' k'axik naa kikanteesjiik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch'. Eh re' taqe i inkikeb'aa' kiib' chupaam taqe i paat ko'lb'al iib' eh pantaq ruhopil ab'aj, naa kikimiik ruum yab'ilaal, re' taqe i aj panab'iix re' i josq'laj chikop naa rukansaniik keh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusacham wach i kitinamiit, naa nukanaam chi xan tz'irik chik paam. Naa nusacham wach i runimaal kiwach, i kajaawriik. Re' taqe i ye'aab' Israel ma' jino'q chik i naa rik'iik chupaam. <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh noq naa nusacham wach i kitinamiit noq naa nukanaam chi ma' xta chik i wilik chupaam ruum chu'nchel i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al xkian. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, tiko'q keh inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wilik i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq, re' taqe i tinamit inkipab'aa' kiib' wataq tz'aq, wataq ru puertahiil i kipaat, eh k'ul inkiq'or chikiwach chi je' wili chawiij: Kim taq qib'iraj i holohik laj ruk'uhb'aal i Dios i ruq'or, inki taqe. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taqe nutinamiit kiooj wo' naq chi rib'irjiik i nuk'uhb'aal inaq'or inkitzunaa' kiib' chawach je' rukab' i okrinaq taqe wii'. Xa re' la' xama' nkian ta wo' hoq xa chi kichii' kinkiloq'ej, eh re' kánima najt wilik wuuk', ruum chinaah i b'ehomal inkiyeew kik'ux. <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh chi kekeh aha' wilik inaq'or xa je' rukab' jino'q i tz'uuy reh k'axaj iib', je' rukab' inkitz'uyej i xa holohik chik paam i kalaq q'e' kichol tz'uuy. Inkib'iraj wo' naq taqe inaq'or xa re' la' xama' inki a'n ta wo' rub'aan. <verse number="33" style="v" />Xa re' la' chu'nchel inaq'or keh naakik'ulum, eh noq chi k'achi' chik kik'ulum kora'j naakinimam re' chi re' hat, hat jalal nuq'oral tiko'q keh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik chi naakik'ulum i ti' k'axik i cha'jen keh i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or keh i cha'jen keh i aj Israel chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios, je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' taqe i aj cha'jen keh i aj Israel q'e' ti' i naakik'ulum ruum xa re' keh inkicha'jeej kiib'. Xanaah re', re' naq i nutinamiit i naakicha'jeem re' taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb'. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' keh inkuk'ej keh i kilecha i je' tentzun, eh inkiyejaa' chi kiso' i kiij, eh inkik'ux keh i q'e' q'ina', xa re' la' xama' inkicha'jeej ta wo' hoq. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' keh ma' nkiyeew ta rukowiil kik'ux i je' taqe nutentzuun ma' kow ta kik'ux. Eh ma' kiq'omaaj ta taqe i wilik kiyab'ilaal, ma' nkib'ak ta wach i kiti'kiil inkitoq kiib', ma' nkiq'unej ta wach taqe i sahchinaq, ni xata nooj kisik' inkiq'eb' kiib'. Kow la' chik inche kiq'oreej, inki a'n ti' k'axik reh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe i je' nutentzuun xi kahnik chi ma' xta cha'jen keh, xkitukej kiib' xa aha' yuuq'. Re' taqe i josq'laj chikop k'uxwik keh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' taqe nutentzuun noq wilkeeb', xisahchik chupaam taqe i yuuq' k'ixkaab', je' wo' hoq chikinaah taqe inajt kinaah yuuq' wilkeeb' sut i wach ak'al. Korik noq xkitukej kiib' ma' awach ta xsik'wik i xkapeb'inik keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' taqe i aj cha'jen naq keh kib'iraj i naa nuq'orom keh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios xti korik i nuq'or chi josq'laj chikop chi re' taqe i chikop wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn xi k'amwik, xik'uxwik keh taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb', ruum ma' xta cha'jen keh. Re' taqe i nukojom naq chi cha'jen keh xama' kiooj ta wo' chi rusik'ariik, ma' re' ta wo' chik inkicha'jeej, re' la' chik i keh inkichajeej kiib'. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' taqe i aj cha'joom kib'iraj i naa nuq'orom keh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' i nuq'or i hin, hin Dios re' i wili: Re' chi yohb'aal wach i nujosq'iil chikinaah, naa nupahqaam keh aha' xiooj taqe i je' nutentzuun noq wilkeeb'. Eh naa wesam taqe chi kicha'jaljiik ruum xa re' wo' keh inkicha'jeej kiib'. Naa wo' chik nuko'leem kiij i nutinamiit, reh chi ma' nee tan kuxik kisacham wach, tiko'q keh, inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or i QaJaaw Dios: Re' hin i nuq'or chi re' chik i hin naa nucha'jiniik keh i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb'. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hin naa nub'anam keh je' rukab' i rub'an i cha'jen tentzun ti' rik'raaj taqe i rumol kiwach noq inkitukej kiib'. Je' wo' re' i naa nub'anam i hin kuuk' i nutinamiit naa numolom kiwach, naa wesam taqe chaloq panti' k'axik chupaam i q'iij noq wilkeeb' panq'equm paam ye'aab' kitukem wii' kiib'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin naa wesam taqe chaloq pan i tokoom tinamit, naa wo' chik numolom kiwach pan kitinamiit. Eh naa nuye'em taqe chupaam i ye'aab' aha' naa ruwihiik k'uxumb'al keh, re' wilik wii' taqe i rooq naakipatiniik wii'. <verse number="14" style="v" />Naa nub'anam kuuk' je' rukab' noq kik'amarik reje taqe tentzun chinaah taqe inajt kinaah yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel, re' i wilik wii' k'im inkik'ux. Ar naakihi'liik chi suq, naa kianam rusuqkiil i kiwa' i kihaa'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' chik i hin naa nucha'jiniik keh i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb'. Re' hin naa nuye'wiik keh chi hi'lik, inki QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hin naa nusik'im i nutentzuun i sahchinaq taqe naa numolom cho kiwach i q'ehb'inaq. Naa nu b'ak'am wach i kitoqeel, naa nutob'eem taqe i ma' kow ta kik'ux. Re' taqe i q'ina' ruch'ihil taqe i kow kiib' naa nucha'jeem taqe je' rukab' i ruk'ul chi keh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' hin taq awajaaw je' wili i nuq'or: Chab'iraj taq i hat, hat taq nutentzuun noq wilkaat, naa wesam taqe reje i je' imas tentzun chi kixilak i je' taqe kaprax. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taq i hat k'amal b'eeh ma' manlojik ta taq aweh i suq atoob' taq inak'ux, inayeq' la' taq panawooq aha' wilik taq inakanaa'. Eh re' i saq wach ha' taq inawuk'ej, inach'uwa'risaj taq wach ruuk' aawooq. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'uxumb'al inayeq' taq panawooq, re' tii taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb' kik'uxwik reh. Eh re' wo' keh kiuk'inik reh i ha' inach'uwa'risaj taq wach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik chikinaah taqe nutentzuun noq wilkeeb', naa wesam i q'ina' chi kixilak taqe i xab'aaq taqe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe nutentzuun noq wilkeeb' ma' kow ta kik'ux, re' taq i hat i kow awiib' je' xamihnaj taq reje, je' naa ruuk' uk'aa' xa kuhraaj taq reje wii', korehtaal taq xatukej reje kiwach. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuko'leem taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb', ma' naa ta chik kelq'jiik. Re' hin naa nuq'atam i q'orik chinaah naa wesam i q'ina' chi kixilak i xab'aaq taqe. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' hin naawuksam chaloq jinaj i riih rumaam i David re' i waj kamanoom. Re' chik i reh naa nukojom chi cha'jen keh chi k'amal kib'eeh i taqe nutentzuun noq wilkeeb'. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' hin naa nukahniik chi ki Dios, re' riih rumaam i David i waj kamanoom naa rukahniik chi k'amal kib'eeh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin wilik i naa nuyejaam wach kuuk' i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb', reh chi nee kikahnik pansuqkiil k'uxliis. Eh naa wesam taqe reje i josq'laj chikop reh chi suq nee kiwihik, chupaam i ye'aab' chinaah taqe yuuq'. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb' chi junsuut i nuSantolaj ye'aab', naa nukuxisam taqe xiik' naah wotob'il naa nuye'em chikinaah noq naa rureqem i ruq'ijil. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' chee' naa chik kiwachiniik, je' wo' taqe i tik chuwach aak'al. Re' taqe i nutentzuun noq wilkeeb' suq chik naa kik'achariik pan kitinamiit. Eh noq naa wesam taqe chaloq i pan kiq'ab' inchopwik kinaah, ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta chik ruchopariik kinaah kuum i tokoom tinamit, ni xata naa chik kik'uxarik kuum i josq'laj chikop. Suq la' chik naa kik'achariik ma' awach ta chik naa ruyohb'isaniik keh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em keh i holohik laj ak'al reh chi naa ruwachiniik chi korik i kitik. Re' ma' naa ta wo' chik kikaqse'ljiik kuum i tokoom tinamit. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ruuk' i re' naa kikojom rehtaal i aj Israel chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios chi re' hin naa nuwihiik kuuk'. Re' keh nutinamiit taqe, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taq i hat aj Israel hat taq nutentzuun noq wilkaat. Re' taq i hat, hat taq nutinamiit, eh re' hin, hin taq aaDios, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruq'orariik rib'iral i ti' k'axik xchalik chikinaah i wilkeeb' ar Seir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, ti tz'ehtanoq reje i wilik wii' i tinamit Seir, cha q'or reje keh i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chikinaah. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">Re' hin ma' k'isiin i nuk'aah chikinaah i wilkeeb' Seir,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nuye'em taqe panti' k'axik,</para>
  <para style="q">naa nusacham wach i kitinamiit.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' tinamiit Seir ruch'ihil taqe i tinamit ruchopom naah</para>
  <para style="q">naa nukanaam chi xan tz'irik chik paam.</para>
  <para style="q">Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' keh ma' k'isiin ta xkixowaaj wach i tinamit Israel. Eh xkiyeew chi kimik ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' noq wilkeeb' pa runimaal ti' k'axik ruum i mahk xkian. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' hin i k'achlik Dios korik i nuq'or chi re' taqe i aj Seir naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naakikanteesjiik, korehtaal imb'aan keh kuum i aj kaansoom. Ruum chi xkian ikaansanik i keh naa wo' chik kikanteesjiik i keh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' i kitinamiit i aj Seir naa nukanaam chi ma' xta chik i wilik chupaam naa nusacham wach ma' naa ta chik nuye'em q'ab' chi awach i naa rokiik i naa reliik ar. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin naa taqe nukansam, chi je' chinaah taqe inajt kinaah yuuq', taqe i rub'ol yuuq', wataq k'ixkaab', pantaq rooq ha' naa rukahniik chi tuch'lik i kiti'jolal i naa kikanteesjiik panq'aq'inik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i kitinamiit naa nukanaam chi ma' xta chik i naa ruwihiik chupaam. Eh ma' jino'q chik patineel naa ruwihiik chupaam taqe i tinamit ruchopom naah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Seir je' wili i xkiq'or: Re' taqe i ki'ib' chi tinamit re' i Israel re' i Judá naa rukahniik chi qeh atoob' ta wilik ar i Dios inki taqe. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' hin i Dios i nuq'or i korik chi naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil je' rukab' i kijosq'iil, je' rukab' ixowaal, je' rukab' i kaqwachiil xkian i keh reh taqe i aj Israel. Eh noq naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik i kimahk i keh naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh naa wo' kinab'eem chi re' hin xb'iraj chu'nchel i rub'ajariik i ye'aab' Israel xkian. Eh je' wili i xkiq'or chi riij: Yu'naak xama' xta chik i wilik chupaam neerub'an chi neenkuxik qasacham wach, inki taqe. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ma' holohik ta wo' xiq'orik chi wiij i hin, ma' k'isiin i yiib' wach q'orik xkiq'or chi wiij. Eh re' hin ti xb'iraj. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i xnuq'or chikiij: Chu'nchel i tinamit naa rusuuqb'iik kik'ux noq naa kib'iram chi naa nusacham wach i tinamit Seir. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruum re' keh xsuuqb'ik kik'ux noq xsahchik wach i tinamit Israel. Re' i tinamit Seir je' wo' re' i naa ruk'ulum, naa wo' rukahniik chi ma' xta chik i naa ruwihiik chupaam. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem taqe i aj Edom chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, tiko'q keh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik chi naa wo' chik kehteesjiik panti' k'axik i aj Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq cha q'oreej taqe inajt kinaah yuuq' je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' taq i hat najt taq aanaah yuuq' wilkaat taq Israel chab'iraj taq i ruq'oral i QaJaaw Dios: <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' reh je' wili i xuq'or taq chawiij: Ruum chi re' i nixowanik taq awach je' wili inkiq'or: Atoob' tiih naa qaq'uchum keh inajt kinaah yuuq' korjinaq cho najtir, inki taqe. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Xak'ul chik kichalik imb'anik ti' k'axik keh, k'ahchi' rusachariik kiwach, eh re' taqe tokoom tinamit inchopwik kinaah inq'uchwik i chib'ih keh. Eh ma' najawjik ta kiwach kikojariik chi se'lb'al kuum i tinamit. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe najt kinaah yuuq' wilik Israel cha q'or keh chi kib'iraj i naa nuq'orom i hin, hin Dios chikiij taqe i rax chee', taqe i rooq yuuq', taqe i wataq k'ixkaab', taqe i rooq ha', taqe i ye'aab' xi kahnik chi ma' xta chik wilik chupaam, re' taqe tinamit xi kahnik chi ma' xta chik i wilik chupaam. Re' taqe i xeljik chib'ih keh kuum i tokoom tinamit wilkeeb' chi kijunsuut, eh xa kikaqse'ljik kuum. <verse number="5" style="v" />Je' wili cha q'or keh, re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or: Ruum aj re', re' hin xiik' naah i nujosq'iil noq kinq'orik chikiij i aj Edom, je' wo' noq kinq'orik chikiij i tinamit junch'uq ruum xasuq chik kik'ux noq xkichop naah i nutinamiit, ruuk' ixowaal xkichop naah, inki. <verse number="6" style="v" />Chaq'oreej taqe chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' Israel je' wili i cha q'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or: Re' hin ma' k'isiin i nujosq'iil chikinaah i tokoom tinamit ruum xkik'uhtaaj ruk'ixb'ilaal i nutinamiit noq xq'ucharik keh inajt kinaah yuuq' ruch'ihil taqe i rooq taq yuuq', i rooq ha'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin xti korik i nuq'or chi re' taqe i tokoom tinamit wilik chi kijunsuut ma' k'isiin ta naa nuk'uhtaam kik'ixb'ilaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe inajt kinaah yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel naa wo' chik ruk'ihiik taqe chee' chuwach. Eh ma' k'isiin ta naa kiwachiniik, i naa kik'uxum taqe i nutinamiit Israel, re' taqe i ilook' wo' chik kisutinik cho pan kitinamiit. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' wo' hin naa nuko'liniik reh i kiye'aab' naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kab'ixem wach, eh chi naa kitikim paam. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh naa wo' chik nuk'ihaaxb'isam taqe i aj Israel chupaam taqe i ye'aab' re' re', eh ar naakipatiniik. Re' taqe i tinamit ruchopom naah naa wo' chik runujiik tinamit chupaam aha' wilik taqe i xyojarik wach naa wo' chik kikorjiik ruka'peech. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chupaam taqe i ye'aab' re' re' naa wo' chik nuk'ihaaxb'isam taqe i aj Israel, je' wo' taqe i chikop. Eh ma' k'isiin i patineel naa kiwihik ar. Re' keh xiik' chik naah suq kiil naa kiwihiik chuwach i pampeet. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="12" style="v" />Naa wo' chik nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kichaliik i nutinamiit Israel chupaam i kitinamiit. Re' wo' chik i keh naa kehchaniik reh taqe rax chee' ma' awach ta chik i naa rukimiik ruum i ruwa' ruhaa'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' taqe i tokoom tinamit inkib'aj taqe i aj Israel, je' wili inkiq'or: Re' i kiye'aab' i ruk'ux i rutinamiit i rukanaa' chi ma' xta chik tinamit chupaam, inki taqe. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin i nuq'or chi re' kiye'aab' ma' naa ta chik rukansam i rutinamiit ma' naa ta wo' chik rukanaam chi ma' xta chik patineel chupaam i rutinamiit, inki i Dios. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ma' naa ta chik nuye'em q'ab' chi naa taq ab'ajariik, chi naa kiq'orom i ma' holohik ta laj q'orik chawiij i tokoom tinamit. Ruum re' taq aa ye'aab' ma' naa ta rukanaam i rutinamiit chi ma' xta patineel chupaam, tiko'q keh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i aj Israel xi k'acharik pan kitinamiit xkich'uwa'risaj paam ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Re' i yiib' wach k'acharik xkian re' re' xiik' naah ch'uwa'iil wach, ma' xponik ta chi nuwach. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruum aj re' xti xnuyeew i nujosq'iil chikinaah, ruum wo' hoq ikaansanik xkian pan kitinamiit. Eh ruum wo' hoq chi xkich'uwa'risaj paam ruum i kilooq'jiik taqe i tiyoox xkian. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ruum i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al re' re' xnuyeew taqe chutojariik i kimahk, xnutukej reje kiwach chupaam taqe i tokoom tinamit. <verse number="20" style="v" />Xa re' la' noq xi ponik chupaam taqe i ju'jun chi tinamit imb'ajarik i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal kuum, je' wili inkiq'or i tinamit: Re' wili rutinamiit i Dios wo' naq taqe xa re' la' xi ehteesjik wo' cho pan kitinamiit, inki taqe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hin q'e' ti' inwik'raaj chi kuum i aj Israel imb'ajarik i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal kuum i tinamit aha' kiwihik wii'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' hat cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Ma' ruum taj i ti' k'axik k'ahchi' taq ak'ulum naa nub'anam otob'il taq aweh, ye'b'al la' ruloq'il i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal ruum re' taq i hat i nayeew taq chi b'ajarik i nub'ihnaal chupaam taqe i tinamit. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruuk' i re' naa nuk'uhtaam chikiwach i k'ih seht chi tinamit i rusantohiil i nub'ihnaal, re' i xayeew taq chi b'ajarik i hat chupaam taqe i tinamit. Eh noq naa nuk'uhtaam i nuSantohiil naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq kaat wesam chaloq chupaam taqe i tokoom tinamit i hat taq k'amooj reje wii' naa wo' chik numolom taq awach panatinamiit. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin je' naa ruuk' saq wach ha' naa rutz'ajam taq wach awánima, ruuk' i re' naa wesam iloq i ch'uwa' wilik taq panawánima ruum i kilooq'jiik i tiyoox taq ina' a'n. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' hin naa nujalam taq wach awánima je' kowiil ab'aj, eh naa nuye'em taq aweh jinaj i ma' kow ta laj ánima. Eh naa wo' nuye'em taq panawánima i jinaj ak' laj uxlab'al. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ruum re' i wuxlab'al naa rutoob'iniik taq aweh chi naa taq a'nam panak'achariik aha' wilik i nuq'or taq aweh, eh chi naa taq animam i taqe i ruq'or nuk'uhb'aal. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh naa wo' chik taq aak'achariik chupaam taq aatinamiit nuye'em cho keh taq aamaam awati't. Eh naa taq akahniik chi hat taq chik nutinamiit, eh re' i hin naa nukahniik taq chi aaDios. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' hin naa taq kaat wesam chuwach inch'uwa'risanik wach taq ak'achariik, eh naa ruwachiniik taq atrigo reh chi ma' naa ta chik ruchaliik i wi'jaleel taq cha naah. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh naa wo' nuye'em q'ab' chi naa kiwachiniik taqe i tik chee', je' wo' chu'nchel i tik mu'uun reh chi ma' nee ta chik inchalik i wi'jaleel taq cha naah. Eh ma' nee ta chik inak'uhtaaj taq ak'ixb'ilaal chikiwach taqe i nimaq tinamit. <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruk'uliik taq cho panak'ux i yiib' wach na'ojb'al, i ma' holohik ta taq i na a'n, je' wo' chu'nchel i mahk taq i na a'n ma' k'isiin ta naa ruchaliik taq ak'ixiik cha wib'il awiib'. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' taq i hat inchol taq anab'eem chi re' taqe i otob'il naa nub'anam taq aweh wili ma' ruum ta chi ruk'ul ta taq cha weh, inchol la' ruchaliik taq ak'ixiik ruum taq ayiib' wach na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Noq nutz'ajam chik iloq i ch'uwa' taq panawánima naa nuye'em q'ab' chi naa wo' chik taq aak'achariik chupaam taq aatinamiit, naa wo' chik kiyejaam aha' wilik i xyojarik. <verse number="34" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' xkanab'jik chi ma' xta chik wilik chupaam naa wo' chik rab'ixjik wach, eh naakilom chu'nchel i naakik'iik ar. <verse number="35" style="v" />Eh k'ul naa kiq'orom chikiwach chi je' wili: Re' i ye'aab' wili ma' xta naq chik i wilik chupaam, yu'naak je' chik rukab' i ye'aab' Edén. Eh re' taqe i tinamit xiyojib'ik, yu'naak korjinaq wo' chik taqe, wilkeeb' chik patineel chupaam, inko'q taqe. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit naakikahnik chi k'achalkeeb' re' i wilkeeb' taq cha junsuut ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios i nuyejaa' aha' wilik taqe i yojinaq, eh i nuyeew q'ab' chi neentikarik paam aha' wilik i ma' tikooj ta chik paam, inki i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Re' hin ma' xata re' re' naa nub'anam kuuk' i aj Israel, wila' xkipahqaaj kak'uun kixq'uun weh naa wo' nuye'em keh, korehtaal kik'ihaaxb'iik je' rukab' noq kik'ihaaxb'iik taqe i tentzun. <verse number="38" style="v" />Re' taqe i kitinamiit xsacharik wach ma' k'isiin chik i patineel naa kiwihiik chupaam, xa je' chik k'ihaal i tentzun kik'amarik reje Jerusaleem chi mayiij paninq'iij. Eh ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem i aj Israel chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, tiko'q keh inki weh.</para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i chiq b'aaq xk'uhtjik reh parusaq wiriik i Ezequiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin xwilow parusaq wiriik chi xuyeew chee q'ab' chi nunaah i QaJaaw Dios xiruk'am reje ruuk' i Ruxlab'al ximponik b'ila' rupab'aa' wach jinaj k'ixkaab' nujinaq chi b'aaq. <verse number="2" style="v" />Xiruk'am reje xponik b'ila' chik nusutej riij i juntuhb' chi b'aaq, eh re' hin xwilow chi yohb'aal wach k'ihaal i b'aaq tub'lik wach k'ixkaab', eh xiik' naah kichiqkaal. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh:</para>
  <para style="p">Hat rak'uun winaq ¿Mi konee inwihik kik'achariik i chiqb'aaq wili noq inaq'or i hat? inki.</para>
  <para style="p">Eh re' hin je' wili xnuq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Xa re' hat aweht'al Jaaw, kinki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or weh:</para>
  <para style="p">Yu'naak cha q'oreej taqe panub'ihnaal i chiq b'aaq wili je' wili i cha q'or keh: Chab'iraj taq i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw i hat taq chiq b'aaq. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' reh je' wili i xuq'or taq chawiij: Re' taqe i chiq b'aaq naa wo' chik nuye'em kuxlab'al reh chi nee wo' chik inwihik kik'achariik. <verse number="6" style="v" />Naa wo' chik nukojom kib'otzaal, rutib'kaal, rutz'uhmal wach taqe i b'aaq re' re'. Eh naa wo' chik nuye'em kuxlab'al reh chi naa wo' chik ruwihiik kik'achariik. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' hin xnuq'or b'ila' keh i chiq b'aaq i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw. Noq k'ahchi' nuq'orom i re' jinaj i choqik xb'aan, xan yulujinik chik, eh re' taqe i chiq b'aaq xtohq'ik chik kik'ulaam kiwach ruuk' i kik'uliil. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh xwilow b'ila' chik noq xtohq'ik cho ruwihiik rib'otz'aal, rutib'kaal, rutz'uhumal kiwach taqe i chiq b'aaq, xa re' la' xama' xta wo' kuxlab'al inye'wik kik'achariik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq je' wili i cha q'or reh i uxlab'al inye'wik k'achariik: Hat uxlab'al ti ye'wik k'acharik ti chaloq chi junsuut i wach ak'al, i k'oq ahupej naah taqe b'aaq wili reh chi nee wo' chik inwihik kik'achariik, inki weh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' hin xnuq'or wila' reh i uxlab'al i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw xokik i uxlab'al kuuk' i chiq b'aaq xi k'acharik wo' taqe i kamnaq xipa'lojik ruuk' kooq. Eh yohb'aal chik wach kik'ihaal xa je' chik taqe ruk'ihaal soldado.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' taqe i aj Israel je' kikab' taqe i chiq b'aaq re' re', ruum je' wili inkiq'or: Re' hoj chiqik chik i qab'aqil q'e' ti' qak'ux xama' naa chik qakuyum inqik'raaj, inki taqe. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh cha q'or keh i aj Israel chi je' wili: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or taq chawiij: Re' keh je' naa parujuleel kamnaq naa wesam taqe chaloq noq naa wesam taqe cho Babilonia. Eh naa wo' chik nuk'amam taqe pan kitinamiit. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' noq naa wesam taqe cho ar je' naa pankijuleel naa wesam taqe chaloq, ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem i nutinamiit chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em keh i Wuxlab'al, reh chi naa wo' chik ruwihiik kik'achariik, naa wo' chik nuye'em taqe pan kitinamiit. Ruuk' i re' naakinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, eh re' i nuq'or i nub'an wo' hoq, inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik chi xkian jinaj kiwach i aj Israel kuuk' i aj Judá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="16" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq neenatz'ihb'aaj chuwach jino'q i chee' taqe i q'orik wili: Re' i Judá, reh taqe i rutinamiit, inko'q. Eh nee wo' chik natz'ihb'aaj chuwach jino'q chik i chee' taqe q'orik wili: Reh i José, re' Efraín, re' taqe i rutinamiit Israel, inko'q. <verse number="17" style="v" />Chi riij i re' neenalaaq'aa' wach i chee' kab'chel, xa je' chik jinaj chi chee' noq neenkahnik panaq'ab'. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh wila' xkiq'or aweh taqe i aatinamiit chi je' wili: Chach'ob' rub'ehel qeh chib'ih iraaj ruq'orom i ki'ib' chi chee' re' re', inko'q taqe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Je' wili i neenaq'or keh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios xq'orik weh chi naa nuchopom jino'q i chee' reh i José re' ruchopom naah i Efraín. Re' chee' re' re' rehtalil chu'nchel i tinamit ruchopom naah. Re' i chee' jinaj rehtalil i rutinamiit ruchopom naah i Judá. Eh kab'chel xnulaaq'aa' awach reh chi xkahnik chi xa jinaj chik chi chee'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' chee' xatz'ihb'aaj wach xa jinaj aq'ab' naa alaq'aam wii' wach chuwach i tinamit. <verse number="21" style="v" />Chaq'or wo' keh i aj Israel chi naa wo' chik wesam taqe chaloq pan tokoom tinamit k'amooj taqe reje wii' naa numolom kiwach, naa wo' chik nuk'amam cho pan kitinamiit. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuk'ulaam kiwach i kiib' chi tinamit xa jinaj chik naa kikahniik chinaah taqe i yuuq' Israel, je' rukab' noq xak'ulaa' kiwach i ki'ib' chi chee'. Eh xa jinaj wo' chik chi reey i naa rukahniik chikinaah, ma' ka'seht ta chik chi tinamit naakeliik. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta chik kich'uwa'risam kiib' ruuk' i kilooqjiik taqe i tiyoox, ruuk' i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al, je' wo' ruuk' i nuja'waachjiik i hin. Re' hin naa wesaniik reh taqe i kimahk naa nutz'ajam wach i kánima. Re' keh naa kikahniik chi nutinamiit taqe, eh re' hin naa nukahniik chi ki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' i riih rumaam David i waj kamanoom naa nukojom chi reyil chikinaah, eh chi kunchelaal i aj Israel xa jinaj chik i cha'jen keh naa ruwihiik. Eh naa chik kianam i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, eh naa kik'amam naah i nuq'or keh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh naa wo' chik nuye'em taqe chi k'acharik pan kitinamiit, nuye'em cho reh Jacob i waj kamanoom. Re' xpatinik cho wii' kimaam kati't, eh ar naa kik'achariik i keh chi juneliik je' wo' kiih kimaam. Re' chik i riih rumaam i David i waj kamanoom naa ruk'amwiik kib'eeh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' hin jinaj i na'ojb'al naa nuyejaam wach kuuk' re' i wihik pansuqkiil. Re' i naa nuyejaam wach kuuk' reh juneliik, eh naa nuk'ihaaxb'isam taqe. Eh naa nukojom i nupaat chi juneliik chupaam i kitinamiit. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' chik i hin naa nuk'achariik kuuk', re' chik i hin naa nukahniik chi ki Dios, eh re' keh naa kikahniik chi nutinamiit taqe. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taqe i nimaq tinamit naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i nuyeew kisantohiil i nutinamiit Israel, eh chi re' i nuSantolaj paat juneliik naa ruwihiik chi kixilak tiko'q keh, inki i Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruq'orariik chib'ih i xuk'ul i reey Gog rub'ihnaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Hat rak'uun winaq, chatz'ehtaaj reje i tinamit Magog cha q'or reje reh i ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chinaah i reey Gog, re' i kow chi taaq'anik chinaah i tinamit Magog, i Mesec, i Tubal. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' wili i cha q'or reje reh, re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or chawiij: Re' hin inwixow wach i rub'an i Gog re' kow chi taaq'anik chinaah i tinamit Mesec, Tubal. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' hin naa kaat nusutem chawiij, je' naa nanukojom i loklok laj ch'ihch' panchii'. Eh naa wesam chawach i ruk'ihaal a soldado, je' chi kooq kiooj, je' riij kawáyu kiooj, ye'ooj kikowiil chi korik wilik kiq'aslaj ch'ihch' kuuk' reh q'aq'inik, wilik wo' kipulato ch'ihch', xa reh reh chik wach i kitz'a'amb'aal wilik kuuk'. <verse number="5" style="v" />Naa wo' rojiik haa' chawiij i ki soldado aj Persia, i aj Cus, i aj Fut, wilik kipulato ch'ihch' kuuk', eh wilik kich'ihch' puneet. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh naa wo' rojiik haa' chawiij i ki soldado i aj Gomer, chu'nchel i ruk'ihaal i tinamit kichalik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij re' taqe i wilkeeb' chawiij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hat Gog chakowb'isaj awiib', chayeew wo' kikowiil taqe i asoldaldo i naa kojiik chawiij, eh re' hat naa akahniik chi taaq'anik chikinaah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh ik'inaq-oq chik jarub'-oq haab' re' hat naa ataq'ab'jiik reje chi q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit ruko'leem cho riib' panq'aq'inik. Re' taqe i naa rumolariik cho kiwach chupaam taqe i tinamit. Re' taqe i tukimaj reje kiwach chupaam i tinamit, chu'nchel i re' chinaah taqe i yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel, suq chik i k'acharik nakianam ar. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' hat xa je' chik pan kaq suut teew, xa je' chik q'equm paam suutz' naa aye'em chikinaah i tinamit noq naa rojiik achopom naah awuch'ihil taqe a soldado, awuch'ihil taqe i ruk'ihaal tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Je' wili i ruq'or i QaJaaw Dios chawiij i hat Gog chupaam taqe q'iij re' re', naa ruk'uliik cho panak'ux taqe i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="11" style="v" />Je' wili i naa aq'orom: Re' hin naa wojiik chi q'aq'inik chinaah i tinamit ma' nee ta rub'an ruko'ljiik riib'. Re' i tinamit suq wilik ch'iklik ruk'ux, ma' kotimaj ta riij chi tz'aq, ma' xta ru puerta, ma' xta lutz'b'al reh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuchopom naah naawelq'aam i chib'ih reh. Eh naa nusacham kiwach i tinamit korjinaq chik taqe ruka'peech, re' taqe i tinamit xmolarik cho kiwach chupaam taqe tinamit. Re' taqe wilik kiwakax, i wilik chib'ih keh, eh k'acharik chik inki a'n panyejaal i ye'aab', tiko'q. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj Sabá, aj Dan, re' taqe aj yakool wilkeeb' Tarsis, re' taqe i Demas, re' taqe i tinamit naa kipahqaam aweh chi je' wili: ¿Mi xamol cho kiwach re' taqe i aa soldado chi q'uchariik i chib'ih qeh, re' i qa oro, i qa plata, i qawakax, taqe i xa chib'ih jariik i wilik qeh, reh chi naa ak'amam reje ab'ehomal ayu'? inko'q taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hat rak'uun winaq cha q'oreej i Gog panub'ihnaal je' wili i cha q'or reh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili ruq'or chawiij: Noq re' i nutinamiit Israel suq chik wilkeeb' re' reh naa ruk'amam taqe reje. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hat naa achaliik chupaam i ye'aab' wilkaat cho wii' pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh naa ruchaliik chawiij i ma' k'isa soldado, je' wo' ma' k'isa tinamit xiik' naah kowiil kiib' riij kawáyu naa kichaliik. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hat Gog je' akab' i q'equm paam suutz' noq naa awojiik k'oloq chinaah i nutinamiit Israel. Re' hin naa kaat nutaq'aam reje chi q'aq'inik chinaah i nutinamiit Israel. Reh chi ruuk' i naa a'nam re' re' naa kinab'eem i nimaq tinamit chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, re' noq naa nuk'uhtaam i nuSantohiil chikiwach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or reh i Gog: Re' hin, re' hat i nuq'or chawib'iral ruuk' kichii' taqe i jalal nuq'oral xi wihik Israel noq xub'an re' hin nuq'orom cho rib'iral chi re' hat naa achaliik chi q'aq'inik chinaah i nutinamiit Israel. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' hin nuq'orom chi noq naa ruchopom naah i nutinamiit Israel i Gog ma' k'isiin ta naa ruchaliik i nujosq'iil. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh ruum chi ma' k'isiin i nujosq'iil naa ruchaliik xti korik i nuq'or chi jinaj i runimaal yihk naa nuye'em Israel. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruum i re' ma' k'isiin ta naa kiyo'jiik taqe i kar pantaq palaw, je' wo' taqe i chikop kirupinik pan taxaaj, je' wo' taqe i chikop wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn, je' wo' taqe i aaq'. Eh chu'nchel i tinamit wach ak'al naa kiyo'jiik chi nuwach, eh naakib'oqib'ik taqe i yuuq' k'ixkaab', naa kiq'ehb'iik wach ak'al taqe i koraal tz'aq. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh naa nuye'em cho chinaah i Gog i k'ih b'uhr wach chi ti' k'axik, xa re' reh naa rupletoheem riib' panq'aq'inik naa rukimiik, eh xa chi kib'il kiib' naa kikansam kiib' i ru soldado. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuye'em i nujosq'iil chinaah i reh, i chinaah rutinamiit, i ru soldado ruuk' q'aslaj ch'ihch' naa rukanteesjiik naa nuye'em runimaal yab'ilaal chinaah, je' naa nimaq taq saqb'och, je' naa teew jab', je' naa q'aaq', je' naa asufre i naa nuye'em cho chinaah. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruuk' taqe re' naa nuk'uhtaam chikiwach taqe i k'ih seht chi tinamit chi wilik wajaawriik, chi wilik nuSantohiil. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios, tiko'q reh, inki weh.</para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruq'orariik chi naa rub'aan reh i reey Gog rub'ihnaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or reh i Gog i naa ruk'ulum, je' wili i cha q'or reh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i ruq'or chawiij: Re' hin inwixow wach i rub'an i Gog re' intaaq'anik chinaah i tinamit Mesec, i Tubal. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hin naa wesam cho chupaam inajt laj ye'aab' wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, ar chik naa nuk'amam chaloq chupaam i rax chee' wilkeeb' Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Chi riij i re' naa nutoqom i flecha wilik parutz'eet q'ab', eh naa wo' nuq'uchum i q'aslaj ch'ihch' wilik parusak'aaj q'ab'. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh chinaah i yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel naa rukanteesjiik, ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado, ruch'ihil taqe i tinamit naa kokiik haa' chi ko'ljiik. Ar naa ruk'uxariik i ruti'jolal kuum taqe i k'uch, kuum taqe i josq'laj chikop wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn. <verse number="5" style="v" />Xti korik wo' hoq chi chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' naa rukanteesjiik ruum re' hin i k'achlik Dios kinq'orik reh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' hin naa nutaq'aam i q'aaq' chinaah i tinamit Magog, je' wo' chikinaah i tinamit xasuq i k'acharik inki a'n wilkeeb' pan tz'a'laj yuuq' chi chii' i palaw. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' hin naa nuk'uhtaam i nuSantohiil pan kixilak i nutinamiit Israel. Ma' naa ta chik nuye'em q'ab' chi naa ki ch'uwa'reem wach i nub'ihnaal. Ruuk' i re' naa kinab'eem i nimaq tinamit chi re' hin i kisantolaj Dios i aj Israel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Xti korik i nuq'or chi xailook' chik imponik i q'iij chi naa ruk'ulariik taqe re'. Re' wili re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel noq naakeliik chi b'ehik, naa kik'atam i kitz'a'amb'aal reh i q'aq'inik inkamanik reh i Gog. Re' taqe nimlaj pulato ch'ihch', taqe kiflecha, taqe i xa chib'ih chik jariik manlik kisii' chuwach i wuquub' haab'. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chuwach i haab' re' re' ma' kota chik ruman naa rojiik kisik'im kisii' pantaq ch'ahn, ruum chu'nchel i kamamb'al re' re' naa kikojom chi kisii'. Naa ruq'uchariik keh kuum i aj Israel aha' naq wilik taqe i xkiq'uch i keh pampeet. Re' wili re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re' naa nuye'em chi muq'umb'al reh i Gog jinaj i ye'aab' wilik Israel wach k'ixkaab', re' i ki-ik'ik wii' i aj b'iyajo chii' palaw. Eh ar ma' naa ta chik rub'aan ik'ik ruum ar naa rumuhqiik i Gog ruch'ihil taqe i ru soldado. Re' i ye'aab' re' re' wach k'ixkaab' Hamón, eh Gog i rub'ihnaal naa kikojom. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel wuquub' poh naakimuq'aam wii' taqe i naa kikanteesjiik re' re' ruuk' i re' naakisaqb'isam paam i tinamit. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit Israel naa rumuq'aniik keh i kamnaq re' re'. Re' q'iij re' re' naakininq'ijeem noq naakiye'em nuloq'il i hin, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="14" style="v" />Chi riij i wuquub' poh re' re' naakipa'ab'jiik i juntzuhb' chi winaq naa kojiik chupaam i tinamit chi kisik'ariik taqe i kamnaq i ma' naa ta kimuq'ub'jiik re' chik i keh naakimuq'aniik, reh chi naa kisaqb'isam paam i tinamit. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq naakib'ehum paam i tinamit wixkireq jino'q b'aaq ar naa kikojom rehtalil chi chee' korehtaal inkimuq'aa' i aj muuq'oom ar wach k'ixkaab' Hamón, eh Gog. <verse number="16" style="v" />Je' wo' re' i nakianam chupaam i tinamit Hamona chi je' re' naa rukahniik chi saq kiwach chu'nchel i tinamit, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' hat rak'uun winaq cha q'or keh taqe i chikop kirupinik pan taxaaj, keh chu'nchel i josq'laj chikop, wilkeeb' pantaq ch'ahn, kichaloq chinaah taqe i yuuq' wilkeeb' Israel. Reh chi naakilom ikaansanik naa nub'anam ar, reh chi neen k'ulik kik'ux keh i kitib'kal i kamnaq, eh neen k'ulik kuk'ej i kikik'eel. <verse number="18" style="v" />Naa wo' kik'uxum i kitib'kaal i soldado, eh naa kuk'em i kikik'eel taqe i k'amal b'eeh. Nen k'ulik kik'ux keh je' rukab' noq ink'uxarik i kitib'kal imas tentzun, i kok' tentzun, i kaprax, i q'ina' laj rak'uun wakax ink'ihteesjik ar Basán. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe i chikop re' re' korehtaal kinujik noq naa kik'uxum i kiq'ina'iil taqe i kamnaq re' re'. Eh korehtaal inchalik kimemriik ruum i kinujiik noq naa kuk'em i kikik'eel. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' keh naa kik'uxum i rutib'kaal i kawáyu, i kitib'kaal i iqilkeeb' chi riij, re' taqe i kow kiib', i kitib'kaal chu'nchel i aj q'aq'ineel korehtaal naakinujiik chi korik taqe i chikop, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chi je' re' naa nuk'uhtaam i nujosq'iil chikiwach taqe i k'ihseht chi tokoom tinamit. Eh chu'nchel i tinamit naakilom chi parub'ehel xnuq'at i q'orik chikinaah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh chupaam taqe i q'iij re' re' naa rutohq'iik kikojom rehtaal taqe i aj Israel chi re' hin kaJaaw i ki Dios. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'ih seht chi tinamit naa kinab'eem chi re' taqe i aj Israel xi k'amarik reje pan tokoom tinamit ruum i kimahk ruum chi ma' xinkinimaj taj. Ruum i re' xnuq'eb' taqe chi riij nuk'ux, xnuq'asaj taqe pan kiq'ab' i nixowanik kiwach, ruum i re' ma' k'isiin i xikimik panq'aq'inik. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' hin xnub'an kuuk' je' rukab' i ruk'ul chi keh ruum i kich'uwa' wach na'ojb'al. Eh ruum chi ma' xinkinimaj taj xnuq'eb' taqe chi riij nuk'ux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios je' wili i nuq'or: Re' hin naa wo' chik nuketelaam kiwach i tinamit Israel, re' taqe i riih rumaam Jacob. Naa wo' chik wesam taqe panti' k'axik, naa nuq'orom keh chi kiyeew wo' chik ruloq'il i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh noq wilkeeb' chik pan kitinamiit ma' awach ta chik naa rujot'wiik keh, naa ruk'uliik cho pankik'ux i ma' holohik taj inki a'n Eh naa ruchaliik kik'ixiik noq naa ruk'uliik cho pankik'ux chi ma' xinkinimaj taj. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh noq naa wesam taqe chaloq i nutinamiit chupaam i kiye'aab' i nixowanik kiwach, naa wo' chik numolom kiwach pan kitinamiit. Ruuk' i re' naa nuk'uhtaam i nuSantohiil chikiwach i k'ih seht chi tinamit. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' wo' hin xinye'wik q'ab' chi xik'amarik reje pan tokoom tinamit. Eh re' wo' chik hin naa numolwiik kiwach pan kitinamiit, ma' jino'q chik keh i naa nukanaam cho ar. Ruuk' i re' naakinab'eem chi re' hin i k'achlik Dios. <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta chik nuq'eb'em taqe chi riij nuk'ux. Ruum naa nuye'em i Wuxlab'al chikinaah chu'nchel i tinamit Israel, inki i QaJaaw Dios,</para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i Ezequiel xk'uhtjik reh parusaq wiriik i rupaat i Dios korjik koq'uun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pan lajeeb' rub'eeh i peet poh noq xuk'am rub'eeh i ho'oob' ru ka'winaq haab' qak'amariik reje Babilonia. Re' noq kajlaj haab' chik kichopom naah i tinamit Jerusaleem taqe i aj ixowaal, xchalik i rajaawriik i Dios chi nunaah xiruk'am reje ar. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xwilow panusaq wiriik chi xiruk'am reje Israel xinooj rupab'aa' chinaah jinaj i yuuq' xiik' nah najtiil naah. Eh ar wilik jinaj i paat je' nimaal i nimlaj tinamit, ar wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="3" style="v" />Noq wilkiin chik ar jinaj chik i winaq xwilow wach xanrob'rotik chik, xa je' chik rukab' i q'an ch'ihch'. Eh jinaj chik i pajb'al k'ahaam ruyohq'eem re' ruuk' i lino, eh jinaj chee' re' ruuk' pajb'al ruyohq'eem, ar pa'lik i koq chii' puerta. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq re' re' je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq xti chawilow ruuk' naq'awach, chab'iraj ruuk' axikin, xti chakoj rehtaal chib'ih taqe i naa nuk'uhtaam aweh. Re' hat xat k'amarik chaayu' reh chi wilik naa nuk'uhtaam aweh, chu'nchel i nee nawil nee wo' chik inooj ak'utjaaj keh i aj Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh xwilow wach i tz'aq kotimaj wii' riij i rupaat i Dios. Re' i winaq re' re' ruuk' i chee' pajb'al ruyohq'eem ixib' b'ara rooq, ruuk' i re' xupaj i tz'aq jinaj rooq i chee' re' re' i runimaal rooq, je' wo' hoq i runajtiil naah xelik chuwach. <verse number="6" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xchalik chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij, xjohtik chuwach i ixkaleria tz'aq, xupaj i wach i puerta jinaj rooq chee' reh i pajb'al xelik chuwach, xelik reje ruuk' i chee' ch'ilik wii' xponik ruuk' i chee' chi juntar re' i ch'ilik wii' <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh chucheel i puerta k'ul wilkeeb' i kok' ye'aab' tasooj kipaam ixib' b'ara kooq, je' wo' re' i runimaal kiwach. Re' i runajtiil kixilak taqe i ju'jun chi ye'aab' wilik roox b'ara. Eh re' i kiib' chi chee' choplik wii' i puerta jinaj rooq chee' pajb'al runimaal kiwach. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' hoq i puerta wilik i koq panookb'al, i jinaj rooq chee' pajb'al xelik chuwach. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' hoq i puerta reh i ookb'al wilik reje chi muuj i paat kijib' b'ara xelik chuwach, eh ki'ib' i rooq paat wilik ar ju'jun b'ara runimaal paam. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh k'ultar reh i ru puerta re' re' wilkeeb' i kok' paat eliik wach kininqaal, jinaj wo' wach kininqaal i rooq i paat re' taqe i wilkeeb' k'ultar chel. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq xupaj wo' hoq i wach i puerta wilik panookb'al ho'oob' b'ara xelik chuwach, eh re' ookb'al waqiib' b'ara ruuk' yejal xelik chuwach. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chuwach taqe i ju'jun chi kok' paat wilik taqe i ju'jun chi koraal tz'aq yejaal i b'ara runimaal kiwach k'ultar chel. Re' taqe i ju'jun chi kok' paat ixib' b'ara i runimaal kooq, je' wo' hoq i runimaal kiwach. <verse number="13" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xupaj nik' najtiil kixilak i ki'ib' chi puerta xutoq'aa' cho ruuk' i ru puertahiil i k'isa paat jinaj, eh xponik ruuk' i ru puertahiil i k'isa paat jinaj, eh kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal xelik chuwach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' hoq i rooq i paat wilkeeb' chi muuj, eh lajeeb' ru ka'winaq b'ara xelik chuwach i ju'jun. Eh re' i chee' q'e'lik chinaah i puerta imponik rureq i rooq i paat chi juntar. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq re' re' xutoq'aa' i koq pajooj ruuk' i puerta wilik chuwach xponik ruuk' i puerta wilik i koq chupaam, ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara xelik chuwach. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i ju'jun chi kok' paat wilik ki ventana re' ruuk' i kok' taq wach, wilik i wilkeeb' chi muuj i paat. Wilik taqe i ventana ki-ik'ik wii' chupaam i paat noq kiooj chi muuj. Eh chuwach taqe i rooq i paat och'imaj wach kojooj rehtalil i xaq ipak' chikiwach noq xwilow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq re' re' xiruk'am b'ila' reje pantehlik chi riij i paat. Eh inwilow tusulkeeb' wach tz'aq i lajeeb' ru ka'winaq chi kok' paat, tasooj paam, eh tusuuj i xan chupaam chi ju' junaal, xan worwotik chik paam. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' xaan tusuj panookb'al i koq reh i rumuuj i paat panqajik wilik chuwach i wilkeeb' wii' i kok' paat, xooj reje chi junsuut i paat. Re' i runimaal rooq eliik wach ruuk' i runimaal wach. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq xutoq'aa' chee pajooj chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij, xponik ko ruuk' i puerta wilik reje chi muuj chi juntar lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' i winaq xupaj wo' hoq i puerta wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij re' i wilik chi muuj i paat. Eh xupaj i rooq je' wo' i wach noq xwilow. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh chupaam taqe i ookb'al k'ultar chel wilkeeb' i ox ox chi ye'aab'. Re' taqe i rooq i paat, re' taqe i kotlik chinaah eliik wach runimaal ruuk' i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij xi elik chuwach i ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal rooq, eh kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal i runimaal wach. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i ru ventana hiil i paat, elik wach kinimaal. Re' i och'imaj wii' wach taqe i rooq i paat eliik wach kininqaal, ruuk' i puerta inilwik reje chi muuj i rupaat i Dios je' wo' hoq i chee' ruq'e'liik, wilik i wuquub' chi ixkaleria tz'aq imb'aan wii' johtik. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' i winaq xupaj wo' xilak i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij ruuk' i ru puertahiil i rumuuj i paat i wilik i koq ko chupaam, eh lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara rooq xelik chuwach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am b'ila' reje i winaq i pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, eh ar wilik jinaj i puerta, xupaj wo' hoq i puerta, je' wo' taqe i rooq paat wilkeeb' chi muuj. Eh eliik wach kinimqal ruuk' taqe i ruk'uliil xelik chuwach. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' i wilik wii' i puerta re' re' wilik wo' taqe i ventana je' rukab' i wilkeeb' chi chii' i puerta wilkeeb' chi juntar. Re' i runimaal i ye'aab' i wilik wii' i puerta ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara rooq, xelik chuwach, re' i wach kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal i wach. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh wuquub' wo' hoq i ixkaleria tz'aq johtb'al wilik chi chii' i puerta re' re'. Eh re' taqe i och'imaj wii' wach taqe i rooq i paat k'ultar wilkeeb' rehtalil i xaq ipak'. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq xupaj wo' xilak i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, ruuk' i puerta wilik i koq ko chupaam. Eh lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xilak xelik chuwach i koq ko chupaam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am b'ila' i koq ko chupaam i paat, re' i wilik wii' i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Xupaj eliik wach kininqaal ruuk' taqe i ruk'uliil xelik chuwach. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taqe i kok' paat, re' taqe i rooq i paat, re' taqe i ventana, eliik wach ruuk' taqe i kik'uliil. Re' i runimaal rooq xelik chu'nchel taqe re' ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara xelik, eh re' wach kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal xelik chuwach. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' wilik wii' i puerta re' re' ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara i runimaal rooq, eh kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal i runimaal wach xelik chuwach i winaq. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' re' re' ar inilwik reje chupaam i tehlik wilik reje chi riij i paat. Re' taqe i rooq i paat och'imaj wach ruuk' i xaq ipak'. Re' i puerta re' re' waxiqiib' ixkaleria tz'aq johtb'al wilik chi chii'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am wila' reje i winaq chupaam i ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam i paat wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij. Eh xupaj i puerta eliik wach ruuk' iruk'uliil xelik chuwach. <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' taqe i kok' paat, ruch'ihil taqe i ventana, re' taqe i rooq i paat eliik wach kininqaal ruuk' taqe i ruk'uliil xelik chuwach. Re' i ye'aab' wilik chii' ookb'al ruch'ihil i chii' paat reje ruch'ihil taqe i ru ventana xupaj taqe ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara rooq xelik chuwach, eh re' wach kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal. <verse number="34" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' re' re' ar inilwik reje kochiriij i paat tehlik reje wii', re' taqe i rooq i paat och'imaj kiwach ruuk' xaq ipak'. Re' i puerta re' re' waxiqiib' i ixkaleria tz'aq johtb'al wilik chi chii'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Eh xiruk'am b'ila' reje i wilik wii' i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh noq xupaj, eliik wach kininqaal ruuk' taqe i ruk'uliik xelik chuwach. <verse number="36" style="v" />Wilik wo' taqe i kok' paat ar wilik ru ventana, wilik kooq. Re' i ye'aab' re' re' ruuk' taqe i ru ventana, ruuk' chu'nchel i wilik reh ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara rooq, eh re' wach kab'laj b'ara ruuk' yejaal i xelik chuwach noq xupaj. <verse number="37" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' re' re' ar inilwik reje chi riij i paat, re' i tehlik reje. Eh chi chii' i puerta re' re' wilik waxiqib' i ixkaleria tz'aq johtb'al. Eh och'imaj wach ruuk' xaq ipak' i ju'jun chi rooq i paat wilkeeb' k'ultar chel reh i ookb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Eh wilik wo' jinaj i k'isa paat ar re' i ru puertahiil, re' inooj ruuk' i puerta wilik ko chupaam. Eh ar inkitz'aj wach i tiwik inkiyeew chi mayiij. <verse number="39" style="v" />Re' i wilik wii' i puerta re' re' k'ul tar chel wilkeeb' i ka'kab' chi mexa. Chinaah taqe i mexa re' re' inkiyok' ralaq taqe chikop inkiyeew chi kimayiij chi riij taqe i kimahk. <verse number="40" style="v" />Eh chi riij i ye'aab' re' re' ma' najt ta ruuk' i ixkaleria tz'aq ki'ib' wo' chik i mexa wilkeeb' ju'jun chi ju'juntar. <verse number="41" style="v" />Eh kijib' i mexa wilkeeb' chupaam i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aj reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eh kijib' i wilik reje chi chii' i paat waxiqiib' chu'nchel i mexa. Eh ar inkiyok' ralaq taqe chikop inkiyeew chi kimayiij. <verse number="42" style="v" />Re' i kijib' chi mexa inkiyok' wii' ralaq i chikop ab'aj i ruyej-aal k'isiin ma' jinaj b'ara runimaal kooq, je' wo' hoq i runimaal kiwach eh yejaal i b'ara i runajtiil kinaah. Eh chinaah taqe i mexa re' re' wilkeeb' i ch'ihch' inkamanik keh chi yok'b'al kalaq i chikop inkik'at chi kimayiij. <verse number="43" style="v" />Eh chi junsuut i tz'aq re' re' wilkeeb' i loklok laj ch'ihch' ju'jun k'itub' kooq, ar inkich'ilaa' i tiwik, eh chuwach taqe i mexa inkiyeew i tiwik inkiyeew chi kimayiij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eh chi riij i puerta wilik chupaam, eh ki'ib' b'ila' i kok' paat wilkeeb' ar, jinaj i wilik chucheel i puerta wilik i koq ko chupaam wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, ar inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. Eh re' i k'isa paat jinaj ar wilik chucheel i puerta wilik i koq ko chupaam, ar inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'ij. <verse number="45" style="v" />Re' i winaq je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: re' i k'isa paat inawil wach wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij kiye'aab' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij kikamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="46" style="v" />Eh re' i k'isa paat inawil wach wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij kiye'aab' taqe i kajaaw aj tiij kik'atwik i mayiij wach artaal re' taqe i ruuk' chaloq i riih rumaam i Sadoc xa re' wo' chik taqe i keh i aj Levíta inki a'n i rukamaj i Dios, inki. <verse number="47" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' i winaq xupaj wo' hoq i chii' paat wilik i koq ko chupaam, re' re' i kajtz'u'k noq wilik lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara chi ju'juntar xelik chuwach. Re' i artaal ar wilik reje chuwach i rupaat i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am reje chupaam i ye'aab' wilik wii' i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios, eh xupaj i rooq i paat ar, eh ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal runinqaal paam xelik chuwach, re' i puerta wuquub' b'ara wach. Re' taqe i chee' ch'ilik wii' i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios jinaj b'ara ruuk' yejaal runimaal wach i ju'jun. <verse number="49" style="v" />Eh re' i ye'aab' wilik wii i puerta xupaj wo' hoq i winaq lajeeb' b'ara wach, eh waqiib' b'ara rooq xelik chuwach. Eh lajeeb' chi ixkaleria tz'aq johtb'al wilik chi chii' i puerta, eh ju'jun i rooq i paat wilik chi ju'juntar.</para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chi riij i re', re' i winaq xiruk'am i koq chupaam i rupaat Dios xupaj wo' taqe i rooq i paat ox ox b'ara paam i ju'jun, je' nimaal santo laj itz'ihy naah paat. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' i puerta xupaj wo' hoq i k'isiin ma' ho'oob' b'ara xelik chuwach. Re' taqe i chee' ch'ilik wii' i puerta ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal runimaal wach chi ju'jun tar xupaj wo' ye'aab' wilik panyejaal juninaq b'ara rooq, lajeeb' b'ara wach xelik chuwach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am i koq ko chupaam i ye'aab' xupaj taqe rooq i paat wilkeeb' ar suut chi ju'jun b'ara i runinqaal paam i ju'jun. Re' i runimaal wach i puerta ixib' b'ara, re' ookb'al ixib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal runimaal wach. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq xupaj wo' hoq i ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam, eh suut chi lajeeb' b'ara xelik chuwach. Je' b'ila' chik wili i xuq'or weh: Re' i ye'aab' wili xti wilik rusantohiil, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' winaq xupaj wo' hoq i tz'aq wilik chi junsuut i rupaat i Dios, ixib' b'ara rupimiil. Eh chuwach i tz'aq re' re' yej-amaj taqe i kok' paat tasooj paam. Ki'ib' b'ara runimaal paam i ju'jun xelik chuwach. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taqe kok' paat re' re' oxch'iht chik noq wilkeeb' i ju'jun. Re' i peet ch'iht lajeeb' ru ka'winaq chi kok' paat i wilkeeb' chupaam i ju'jun ch'iht. Re' i koraal tz'aq wilik chi riij i rupaat i Dios xti najt naah ar ch'ikilkeeb' i rib'ojal kok' paat, ma' re' ta wach tz'aq reh i rupaat i Dios ch'ililkeeb'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh chuwach taqe i kok' paat wilkeeb' chi junsuut i rupaat i Dios wilik i johtb'al reh reh runimb'iik wach intohq'ik johtoq ruuk' i peet ch'iht korehtaal xponik paroxch'iht. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin xwilow panusaq wiriik chi junsuut i rupaat i Dios wilik taqe i tz'aq korjinaq ixib' b'ara runajtiil naah, chinaah i re' ch'iklik taqe kok' paat. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i tz'aq wilik chikiij i kok' paat ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal runimaal wach, je' wo' re' nimaal i tehlik inkahnik ruuk' i paat. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' xilak i tz'aq ruuk' i kok' paat re' re' lajeeb' b'ara i tehlik chikiij i kok' paat, eh je' wo' chi junsuut i rupaat i Dios ruuk' i paat jinaj chik. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i ookb'al reh taqe i kok' paat re' re' ar wilik reje i tehlik wii' ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejal i runimaal wach. Re' taqe i kok' paat ka'kab' i ru puertahiil jinaj i wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, eh jinaj i wilik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chi' paat reje wilik wo' chik jinaj i paat ho'lajuuj ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal wach, ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal rupimiil i tz'aq, ka'winaq ruuk' ho'oob' b'ara rooq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh xupaj b'ila' i rupaat i Dios lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara runimaal rooq xelik chuwach. Re' i wach haa' i paat, haa' reje i chi' paat re' i tz'aq lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' i runimaal wach i rupaat i Dios haa' reje i chii' paat wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara wo' xelik chuwach.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' hoq i paat wilik reje chi riij i rupaat i Dios, haa' reje i chii' paat, haa' taqe i tz'aq, lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara rooq xelik chuwach. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i tz'aq wilik i koq ko chupaam, haa' taqe i ventana, haa' taqe i kok' paat ixib' ch'iht noq wilkeeb' kojooj taqe tz'ilom chuwach. Ar xtohq'ik johtoq ko wach ak'al koxponik i wilik taqe i wii' i ventana, je' wo' taqe i ventana kojooj wo' tz'ilom chikiwach. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i winaq xupaj wo' hoq i naah i puerta, je' wo' hoq i chupaam i chi riij i paat, eh je' wo' hoq chu'nchel i tz'aq wilik chi junsuut, chi je' chi riij chi je' chupaam xupaj. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh och'imaj kiwach ruuk' i je' ruwii' ánjel, eh pankiyejaal wilik rehtalil i ju'jun chi xaq ipak'. Eh re' i je' kiwii' ánjel k'ultar wilik kiwach. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' i kiwach juntar je' inka'yik winaq, k'ahchi' rilom reje i xaq ipak', eh re' i kiwach juntar je' inka'yik kaq b'ahlam, k'achi' rilom reje i rehtalil i xaq ipak'. Je' re' i och'imaj wii' wach i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tz'aq reh i rupaat i Dios och'imaj wach ruuk' i je' kiwii' ánjel, je' wo' ruuk' i xaq ipak'. Ar xtohq'ik johtoq wach ak'al koxponik kochinaah i puerta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' i ju'jun chi rooq i rupaat i Dios kajtz'u'k noq wilik. Eh chuwach i ookb'al reh i santo laj ye'aab' kajtz'u'k wo' noq wilik, ar wilik jinaj i artaal. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' i artaal tz'ilom korjinaq wii' ki'ib' b'ara ruuk' yejaal runajtiil naah, eh jinaj b'ara runimaal rooq je' wo' hoq i runimaal wach. Re' i rutz'u'kaal re' wach, re' rooq tz'ilom wo' ruyej-aal. Re' i winaq je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' i mexa wili i wilik i koq chuwach i QaJaaw Dios, inki. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' i rupaat i Dios ruch'ihil i santo laj ye'aab', ju'jun i ru puertahiil. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' taqe i puerta ka'kab' pehr noq wilkeeb' k'ul kiteh reje wataq tz'aq. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' i puerta wilik panyejaal och'imaj wach ruuk' i je' kiwii' ánjel, eh ruuk' xaq ipak'. Je' wo' rukab' i och'imaj wii' wach i koraal tz'aq. Eh re' i rumuuj i paat tz'aplik ruuk' tz'ilom. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh k'ul tar i rumuuj i paat wilkeeb' i kok' ventana, eh och'imaj kiwach ruuk' xaq ipak'.</para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh re' winaq re' re' xiresaj b'ila' chaloq parupaat i Dios, xiruk'am reje i wilkeeb' wii' i kok' paat tasooj kipaam wilkeeb' reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij chuwach reje i paat re' i tehlik wii'. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i paat wilik reje chuwach i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara rooq, eh ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal wach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh chi juntar reje i kok' paat ki ilwik reje chi chii' i paat re' i ye'aab' re' re' lajeeb' b'ara runimaal wach, chi juntar reje ar wilik i ye'aab' tusuj xaan paam, oxch'iht noq wilik i ju'jun. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh chuwach taqe i kok' paat re' re' wilik jinaj i tehlik ho'oob' b'ara runimaal wach, eh lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara runimaal rooq, re' inokik i koq chupaam. Eh re' i kipuertahiil i kok' paat ar ki-ilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kok' paat wilkeeb' paroxch'iht k'isiin chik kipaam ruum re' i johtb'al xq'uchwik reh i runimaal, ruum aj re' k'isiin kipaam chuwach i wilkeeb' paruka'ch'iht, eh je' wo' chikiwach i wilkeeb' pampeet. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruum re' taqe i wilkeeb' paroxch'iht ma' xta kooq' kojooj, ma' je' ta rukab' i wilkeeb' pampeet ch'iht. Ruum aj re' kok' taq kiwach chuwach i wilkeeb' panyejaal, je' wo' chikiwach i wilkeeb' pampeet ch'iht. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' tz'aq wilik chikiwach taqe i kok' paat re' re' eh imponik reje ko chi chii' i paat ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal rooq. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ruum re' i runimaal wach i wilkeeb' wii' i kok' paat ho'oob' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal rooq. Eh re' runimaal wach i rupaat i Dios lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i kok' paat wilkeeb' pampeet ch'iht ar wilik kipuertahiil parelb'aal reje i q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i runimaal wach i ye'aab' chuwach reje i paat wilik reje parelb'aal q'ij, wilik wo' taqe i kok' paat wilkeeb' ar chuwach i tz'aq wilik reje chikiij. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chuwach taqe i kok' paat wilik i rumuuj i paat, je' wo' rukab' taqe kok' paat wilkeeb' reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eliik wach runimaal kooq, i runimaal kiwach, je' wo' hoq i runajtiil kinaah. Eh eliik wo' wach i kipuertahiil. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i kok' paat re' re' eliik wach kipuertahiil ruuk' i kok' paat wilkeeb' reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh wilik jinaj i puerta wilik chuwach i tz'aq wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij, re' imb'aan wii' okik chi' paat wilik chi riij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' winaq je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'ij, i wilkeeb' pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij, i wilkeeb' reje chi' paat santo laj ye'aab' taqe. Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij raj kamanoom i Dios ar naa kik'uxum i santo laj mayiij. Eh ar naakiye'em i santo laj mayiij, taqe i lemóxna, taqe i chikop naakiye'em chi mayiij chi riij taqe i kimahk. Ruum re' i ye'aab' wilik rusantohiil. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij noq naa kokiik i koq ar, ma' nee ta kielik reje chi' paat wila' majaa' inkesaj i kiso' reh i rukamaj i Dios chupaam i santo laj ye'aab'. Ar naa kikanaam chee kiso' ruum re' i kiso' wilik rusantohiil. Noq naa kichaliik i wilkeeb' wii' i tinamit tokoom chik i kiso' naa kikojom chaloq, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh noq re' i winaq xukohlaaj rupajariik i ye'aab' chupaam i wilik wii' i rupaat i Dios xiresaj cho chi chii' i puerta wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij. Eh xupaj wo' hoq i ye'aab' wilik chi junsuut i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Xupaj wo' reje i chii' paat ruuk' i ruchee' rupajb'aal, eh kiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' reje i chii' paat wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij kiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara wo' chik xelik chuwach. <verse number="18" style="v" />Xupaj wo' reje ruuk' i ruchee' i paat wilik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, eh kiib' siento wo' ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh noq xooj kuxoq xupaj reje i chii' i ye'aab' wilik reje parookb'aal q'iij kiib' siento wo' ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' i winaq xupaj i chii' i ye'aab' kajtarchel re' i wilik wii' i rupaat i Dios kiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara xelik chuwach chi ju'juntar. Eh re' i rupaat i Dios sutimaj riij chi tz'aq q'atb'al paam ruuk' i ye'aab' ma' xta rusantohiil.</para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios xinujisaj paam i rupaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am b'ila' wo' chik reje chi chii' i puerta wilik reje pareelb'aal q'iij. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xwilow i ruloq'il i qaDios i hoj, i hoj aj Israel chalik i rub'an parelb'aal i q'iij. Xan choqik chik, xa je' chik rukab' i choqik i rub'an i ma' k'isa ha', eh xan saquminik chik wach aak'al i rub'an i ruloq'il. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' xwilow panusaq wiriik wili je' rukab' xwilow panusaq wiriik noq xwilow chi re' i QaJaaw xchalik chi rusachariik wach i Jerusaleem. Eh je' wo' rukab' xwilow wach panusaq wiriik chi chii' i nim ha' Kebar, re' i hin xnupach'aa' qohoq wiib' wach ak'al. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh re' i ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij xokik, noq xokik chupaam i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' i Dios xiruk'am reje i Ruxlab'al ko chupaam i ye'aab' wilik i koq ar, ruuk' i ruloq'il xunujisaj paam chu'nchel i rupaat noq xwil.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq xpa'lojik b'ila' chik chi nucheel, eh xb'iraj chi xiruq'o'reej chee QaJaaw Dios ko parupaat. <verse number="7" style="v" />Je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq re' wili naa rukahniik chi nuye'aab', noq naa nuwihiik chi kixilak i aj Israel, chi juneliik. Re' keh ma' naa ta chik kich'uwa'risam wach i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal ayu' ruuk' i kilooq'jiik taqe i tiyoox, ni xata re' taqe i kireey naakib'aniik taqe i yiib' wach na'ojb'al re' re'. Eh ma' naa ta chikruchaliik kimuq'aam i ruti'jolal i kireey chinaah taqe yuuq' wilkeeb' ma' najt ta ayu'. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ma' naa ta kiyejaam i rupaat i reey chuk'ulwaach i nupaat i hin, ma' naa ta rukahniik chuk'ulwaach i nupuerta i hin i ru puertahiil i paat re' re'. Ma' nee ta rub'an chi xa jumpehr chi tz'aq i neenq'atwik paam i paat re' re' ruuk' i wee hin. Re' keh i xkich'uwa'risaj wach i nuSantolaj b'ihnaal ruuk' kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al. Ruum i re' xnusach kiwach ruum i nujosq'iil. <verse number="9" style="v" />Yu'naak i ruk'ul chi naa kiq'eb'em reje wulu' i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al, eh chi najt chik naa rojiik kimuq'aam i kiti'jolal i kireey. Eh re' chik i hin naa nuwihiik pankiyejaal pan kixilak chi jumpech. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' hat rak'uun winaq hiy cha k'uhtaaj keh i aj Israel i ruwii' i rehtalil i runimaal i nupaat xawilow wach panasaq wiriik, reh chi neenchalik kik'ixiik ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n <verse number="11" style="v" />Wila' xik'ixiik ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. Neenach'ob' rub'ehel i rehtalil i nupaat, eh chib'ih jariik i wilkeeb' chupaam nik' wach noq wilkeeb' i ookb'al, i elb'aal. Eh neena ch'ob'om rub'ehel i k'uhb'aal naa runimjiik ayu', eh neenatz'ihb'aaj rehtalil keh reh chi neenkireq chi riij, eh neenkian rub'aan. Eh chatz'ihb'aaj keh taqe i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal reh chi neenkinimaj. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i wili i k'uhb'aal chi riij i nupaat, chu'nchel i ye'aab' wilik chinaah inajt naah yuuq', chu'nchel i wilik chi junsuut xti wilik rusantohiil, eh xiik' naah loq'il, inki Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aha' wilik i xpajarik wii' i rupaat i Dios re' wo' chik i re' xpajarik wii' i artaal, eh chi junsuut i artaal wilik jinaj i jul paam tz'aq, yejal i b'ara runimaal wach, yejal wo' b'ara ruchamiil paam. Eh chi chii' i jul re' re' wilik jinaj i q'atb'al jinaj nimlaj k'itub' runajtiil naah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' i rehtalil i artaal ixib' ch'iht noq wilik: Re' peet ch'iht jinaj b'ara runatiil naah, yejaal i b'ara i rumeetz' elinaq chaloq. Eh re' i rukab' ch'iht jinaj b'ara wo' runajtiil naah yejaal i b'ara wo' elinaq chaloq i rumeetz'. Eh re' i roxch'iht kiib' b'ara runajtiil naah yejaal b'ara elinaq chaloq i rumeetz'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh paroox ch'iht i artaal kiib' b'ara runajtiil naah, eh pantaq rutz'u'kaal i artaal pa'alkeeb' johtoq i ju'jun chi ruk'aa'. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i runimaal i roxch'iiht i artaal kajtz'u'k noq wilik waqiib' b'ara wilik reh i chi ju'juntar. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' i ch'ilik wii' i raa' kajtz'u'k wo' noq wilik wuquub' b'ara i wilik reh chi ju'juntar, re' i jul wilik chi rujunsuut yejaal i b'ara i runimaal wach, re' i q'atb'al jinaj mama' k'itub' i runajtiil naah. Eh re' i ixkaleria johtb'al ar wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' i winaq je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Noq naa rukuxiik rukorb'eesjiik i artaal, naa rusulariik, naa kik'atam i chikop chi kimayiij chinaah, eh naa kikihraam i kik' chinaah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh naakiye'em jinaj i komanlik laj imas wakax chi kimayiij chinaah i artaal pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk. Re' naa kib'aniik reh i nukamaj re' re', re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj tiij re' ruuk' taqe i aj Levíta, re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Sadoc, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' hat naa akihraam i kik' chinaah i kijib' chi ruk'aa' i artaal, je' wo' pantaq rutz'u'kaal, eh naa wo' akihraam i kik', chinaah i q'atb'al johtinaq naah i sutimaj wii' riij. Chi je' re' naa kikanaam chi saq wach i artaal. <verse number="21" style="v" />Chi riij i re' neenawesaj chaloq imas wakax xye'arik chi mayiij chi riij i mahk neenooj ak'at chi riij i rupaat i Dios. Re' wo' hoq i ye'aab' korjinaq chi k'atb'al reh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh chi junwar jinaj imas kaprax manlik wach i ruti'jolal naa aye'em chi mayiij reh i chi riij mahk. Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij ruuk' i re' naakisaqb'isam wach i artaal, je' wo' rukab' i naa kianam ruuk' i k'isa imas wakax. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh noq naa akohlaam i ye'ej mayiij saqb'eesb'al wach i artaal, neenachop jino'q i k'isa imas wakax. Eh nee wo' nachop jino'q imas tentzun re' ruuk' i manlik wach i kiti'jolal. <verse number="24" style="v" />Neenayeew chi mayiij, eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij neenkitileej aatz'aam chinaah neenkik'at chi kimayiij chi ye'b'al nuloq'il. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh eqal eqal chuwach i wuquub' q'iij naa aq'asam chi mayiij jinaj imas kaprax pahqb'al kuyb'al mahk. Jinaj imas wakax, jinaj i imas tentzun chi mayiij, re' ruuk' taqe i manlik wach kiti'jolal. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij i iqal i iqal chuwach i wuquub' q'iij naakiye'em i mayiij chinaah i artaal ruuk' i re' naa rukahniik chi saq wach, eh naa kikuxisam. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh noq ik'inaq chik i wuquub' q'iij re' re', eh chupaam i ruwahxaaq q'iij, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naa rutohq'iik kiye'em i mayiij chinaah i artaal, je' wo' taqe i k'atoj chikop chi mayiij. K'amb'al taq awiib' panotob'il wuuk' Eh re' hin nee taq ti nuk'ul wuuk' chi suq nuk'ux, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i xq'orarik chi riij i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am b'ila' reje chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal i q'iij wilik reje chi riij i rupaat i Dios. Re' i puerta re' re' tz'aplik. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or weh i QaJaaw Dios: Re' i puerta wili naa rukahniik chi tz'aplik chi jumpech ma' naa ta rutehiik. Ma' awach taj i naa rokiik i koq ar ruum re' i hin i ki Dios i aj Israel xi nokik ar. <verse number="3" style="v" />Xa re' wo' i reey naa rokiik ar naa rojiik rutzunaam riib' chi nuwach, eh naa ruk'uxum i kaxlanwi'k kuxisamaj, xa re' la' xa pan jinaj ookb'al wilik chucheel i puerta naa rokiik, ar wo' chik naa reliik chaloq, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' i winaq xiruk'am b'ila' reje chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij wilik chuwach i rupaat i Dios. Re' hin xwilow chi xnujik i rupaat i Dios ruuk' i ruloq'il, eh xnupach'aa' qohoq wiib' wach ak'al. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or weh: Hat rak'uun winaq chawil chi korik i naa nuk'uhtaam chawach. Chab'iraj chi korik i naa nuq'orom aweh, re' taqe i k'uhb'aal naa ruk'amariik naah panupaat. Xti naa akojom rehtaal awach taqe i nee ruyeew riib' chi naa kiokik, chi nee kielik panupaat. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i hat je' wili i naa aq'orom keh i aj Israel ma' kinimanik taj: Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or taq chawiij: Manlik chik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al taq xa a'n. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' keh inkich'uwa' risaj paam i nupaat ruum inkikoj i koq ar taqe i tokoom tinamit ma' poch'ooj ta naah i kik'achab', ma' kik'ulum taj i rehtalil i nuk'uhb'aal pankanima. Eh inkiyeew chi kimayiij i kaxlanwi'k i kixeb'ohiil, kikik'eel taqe i chikop, ruum taqe i yiib' wach inki a'n re' re' ma' kinimaj taj i nuk'uhb'aal. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taq i hat aj Israel ma' na a'n ta taq chi korik i looq' chi b'anarik panupaat i nayeew la' taq q'ab' chi re' taqe i tokoom tinamit kib'anik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin i Dios i nuq'or chi ma' jino'q chik i tokoom tinamit naa rokiik panupaat wila' ma' poch'ooj naah i ruk'achab', eh wila' ma' chih rehtalil paránima i nuk'uhb'aal nuyejaam wach. Eh ni xata re' jino'q i tokoom tinamit k'acharik i rub'an chi kixilak i aj Israel naa rokiik ar. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Levíta ruch'ihil taqe i aj Israel kuch tinamit kiib' xin kiq'eb' chi riij kik'ux i xiooj chi kilooq'jiik i tiyoox naa nuye'em taqe chutojariik riij i kimahk. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' keh xa aj cha'joom chik reh i ru puertahiil i nupaat naa kikahniik wii', xa aj kamanoom chik naa kikahniik wii'. Re' chik i keh naakikansaniik taqe i chikop naakiye'em chi kimayiij i tinamit, naa wo' kikahniik chi kimoso. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' keh xi kamanik chi k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel reh i kilooq'jiik taqe i tiyoox. Ruuk' inki a'n re' re' xkikoj kimahk. Ruum aj re', re' hin xti korik i nuq'or chi naa kitojoom riij i kimahk, re' hin i Dios kinq'orik reh <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh ma' nee ta kikamanik chi k'amal b'eeh aj tiij. Ni xata neenkijil i koq kiib' ruuk' i chib'ih weh wilik kiloq'il. Eh ni xata neerub'an chi neenkijil i koq kiib' ruuk' taqe i xti wilik kisantohiil, juneliik la' pank'ixb'ilaal naa kiwihiik ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n <verse number="14" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin naa nukojwiik keh panupaat chi xa aj cha'joom chik taqe, reh chi naa kianam chu'nchel i kamanik iraaj b'anarik ar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij aj Levíta re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Sadoc. Re' taqe i ma' xkikanaa' ta rub'aan i nukamaj panupaat noq re' taqe i aj Israel xin kiq'eb' chi riij kik'ux, re' keh ra'j neerub'an re' chi naa kianam i nukamaj. Eh neen kiyeew i kixeb'ohiil i kikik'eel chikop chi mayiij chi nuwach, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Xa re' wo' keh i ruk'ul chi naakokiik panupaat, eh neenkijil i koq kiib' ruuk' i numexa chub'anariik i nukamaj. Eh naa kianam i naa nuq'orom keh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq naa kokiik i koq chi chii' i puerta wilik i koq ko chupaam i nupaat re' ruuk' itz'ihy lino i kiso' naa kikojom. Eh noq naa kianam i nukamaj chupaam i koq i nuye'aab', ma' naa ta kikojom i kiso' re' ruuk' i rismaal riij chikop ruyej-aal. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' i b'ak'b'al kinaah naa kikojom re' ruuk' itz'ihy lino, je' wo' hoq i paam i kiso' naa kikojom re' wo' ruuk' i lino, ma' naa ta kikojom chikiij i kiso' re' ruuk' i kielik chi ha' ruum. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh noq komajaa' kielik cho chupaam i ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam i nupaat, noq komajaa' kichalik i wilkeeb' wii' i tinamit naa kesam chee kiso' ar, reh i nukamaj, naa kikanaam cho chupaam taqe i kok' ye'aab' wilkeeb' ar. Tokoom chik i kiso' naa kikojom chaloq reh chi ma' nee ta runej taqe i tinamit i rusantohiil i kiso'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh ma' naa ta wo' kijoyom i rismaal kinaah, ma' naa ta wo' kik'isam i kinaah xanaa la' kianam chii'. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh ma' jino'q keh i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij naa ruk'em reh i vino noq naa kokiik i koq ko chupaam i ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ma' naa ta kianam kaxáro ruuk' ixoq kamnaq rub'ahiil, ni xata ruuk' ixoq kanamaj ruum i rub'ahiil, komajaa' la' reht'al wach q'orinik winaq i naa kik'amam chi kehk'een, re' ruuk' taqe i aj Israel oon rukanab' wo' kahnoq jino'q i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij xkimik reje. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij naakik'uhtaam reh i nutinamiit i wilik rusantohiil, eh i ma' xta rusantohiil, eh aha' wilik i saq wach, aha' wili i ch'uwa' wach. <verse number="24" style="v" />Noq naa ruchaliik i peleto re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij naakiq'atwiik i q'orik chikinaah parub'ehel, je' rukab' i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, eh naa kianam i ruq'or i nuk'uhb'aal, naa wo' kik'uhtaam chi naa rub'aan taqe i nuninq'iij. Eh naakiye'em ruloq'il i hi'limb'al q'iij. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh maa naa ta kich'uwa' risam kiib' ruuk' i kitz'a'jik i kamnaq. Neerub'an chi neenkitz'a'j wila' re' i kituut kajaaw xkimik, oon kak'uun kixq'uun, oon kas kichaaq' winaq, oon ixoq ma' xta kib'ahiil. <verse number="26" style="v" />Xa re' la' koruman chi naa rusaqb'isam riib' eh ko wuquub' chik q'iij naa ruye'em. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh noq naa rokiik i koq chupaam i nuSantolaj ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam koruman chi naa ruye'em i numayiij pahqb'al kuyb'al ru mahk, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' re' ma' naa ta ruye'ariik kak'aal ar Israel, re' la' hin jilow kak'aal. Eh ma' naa ta ruye'ariik chi kikooch, re' la' hin i jilow kikooch. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' i kimayiij naakiye'em chi naq'wach, re' taqe i chikop naakiye'em chi kimayiij, re' i mayiij naakiye'em chi pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk i aj Israel naa kik'uxlaam wii' kiib'. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naa wo' kehchaam i peet wach tik mu'uun, je' wo' i holohaq mayiij naa ruk'amariik cho chi nuwach i hin. Eh noq re' taqe i aj Israel naa kiyejaam i kaxlanwi'k, re' xti holohik naa ruye'ariik keh. Eh re' hin naa nuye'em i wotob'il chikinaah i chib'ih keh awach i naakiye'em i kimayiij. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij re' re' ma' naa ta kik'uxum i chikop wilik kixiik' oon xa chib'ih chik jariik chopkaal xanaa kikimiik chi kib'il kiib', oon neenkanteesjik ruum i josq'laj chikop, inki Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruch'aqariik i ye'aab' kuxisamaj chi reh i QaJaaw Dios</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZK 48:9-20">Ez 48.9-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh noq sik'ooj chik chi riij, naa ach'aqam aak'al keh i ju'jun ch'uq chi Israel naa akanaam reh i Dios junseht-oq aak'al q'e' looq kab'laj miil ruuk' waqiib' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh lajeeb' miil b'ara runimaal wach. Eh re' i runimaal i ye'aab' re' re' naa rukahniik chi wilik rusantohiil. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ar naa reliik i ye'aab' reh i rupaat i Dios kiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' rok'ahl b'ara i runimaal chi ju'juntar. Eh chi junsuut i ye'aab' re' re' naa ruwihiik i k'im, hoob' ru ka'winaq b'ara wach. <verse number="3" style="v" />Naa wo' apajam i ye'aab' kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara rooq, hoob' miil b'ara runimaal wach. Ar naa ruwihiik i rupaat i Dios, je' wo' i ye'aab' xti naa ruwihiik rusantohiil. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' re' re' naa rukahniik chi kiye'aab' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij raj kamanoom i Dios parupaat. Re' taqe i naa kokiik i ruuk' chub'aan i rukamaj jinaj i ye'aab' naa rukahniik chi keh wilik i rusantohiil, ma' najt ta ruuk' i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh naa awesam pareh aak'al kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh hoob' miil b'ara runimaal wach. Ar naa rutz'aqarik i kitinamiit i aj Levíta, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naakikamaniik parukamaj i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh naa awesam pareh i ye'aab' i tinamit re' naakehchaam chu'nchel i aj Israel, kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh kiib' miil ruuk' hoob' Siento runimaal wach. Ar naa ruwihiik reje chuwach i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik rusantohiil.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh naa awesam pareh i rak'aal i reey, chucheel i ruye'aab' i rupaat i Dios. Ar naa reliik reje chi korkiil ireelb'aali q'iij naa ruponiik chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij. Eh ar naa rukahniik chucheel i ruye'aab' i tinamit Jerusaleem ar naa reliik reje chi korkiil i reelb'aal i q'iij konaa ruponiik chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij re' i runimaal eliik wach ruuk' i naakik'ulum i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' aak'al re' re' naa rukahniik chi reh i naa rokiik chi ajaab'esil chikinaah i aj Israel, eh re' taqe i naakokiik chi ajaab'esil ma' nee ta chik inkiq'uch i kak'aal i nutinamiit. Naa la' kikanaam i ye'aab' keh i aj Israel re' q'oreel jar ch'uq chi kiib'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Hat taq ajaab'ees chinaah i nutinamiit Israel manlik i ti' k'axik i leq' taq xa a'n keh i nutinamiit. Re' taq chik i rub'ehel, i korik taq cha a'n kuuk', maawelq'aaj taq chik i kak'aal i nutinamiit, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh manlik taq tipajwoq ruuk' chib'ih taq i naa apajam, manlik taq tipajwoq ruuk' taq apexú. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i pajb'al bato inapaj taq wii' i ha', re' i pajb'al efa inapaj taq wii' chi naq'wach taq atik eliik wach kipajwik. Re' i pajb'al re' re' imponik parulajeeb' i pajb'al homer, ruuk' taq i pajb'al re' re' naa taq apajwiik. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' i juninaq Gera rahliil re' re' jinaj siklo, eh re' i junlaj gramo oxk'ahl siklo, re' re' imponik jinaj mina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' taq i hat je' wili taq amayiij naa aye'em naa taq ach'aqam i wach i trigo, je' wo' hoq i wach taq asebada, oxk'ahl tzuhb' taq i naa awesam, eh juntzuhb' keh i re' naa taq aye'em chi amayiij. <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh je' wo' re' i naa taq a'nam ruuk' taq aawaseite naa wo' taq ach'aqam jinaj siento tuhq taq naa awesam, eh juntuhq keh i re' naa taq aye'em chi amayiij. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i kiib' siento chi tentzun jinaj chi tentzun i naa taq aye'em chi amayiij chi riij. Re' i xti q'ina' taq naa aye'em chi ak'atoj mayiij re' taq i xak'isaj Israel. K'amb'al taq aweh panotob'il ruuk' i Dios. Eh reh wo' pahqb'al kuyb'al taq amahk, inki i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i aj Israel ye'ooj chikinaah chi naa kiye'em i mayiij re' re' reh i naa ruwihiik chi ajaab'esil chikinaah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' reh naa ruq'asaniik reh taqe chikop chi k'atoj mayiij, taqe i mayiij naa ruye'ariik chi naq'wach naa wo' ruye'em i riis uuva chi mayiij. Re' taqe inye'arik chupaam i runinq'ijiik i ak' poh, i hi'limb'al q'iij, eh chupaam chu'nchel i ninq'iij naakik'sam i aj Israel. Eh naa ruye'em i chikop naa ruq'ahteesjiik chi k'atoj mayiij k'amb'al kiib' panotob'il i aj Israel ruuk' i Dios, reh chi naa rukuyariik i kimahk inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' i runinq'ijiik i elik chaloq Egipto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' hin i nuq'or chi pank'amb'al rub'eeh i peet poh, naa taq aye'em chi amayiij jinaj imas wakax manlik wach i ruti'jolal, reh chi naa rukahniik chi saq paam i nupaat. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, re' i rukik'eel imas wakax naa ruye'ariik chi mayiij chi riij i mahk naa ruch'ulem chuwach i rooq i paat, chuwach taqe i ruche'el i ru puertahiil, chupaam i kajtz'u'k reh i artaal, je' wo' chuwach taqe i ruche'el i ru puertahiil i ye'aab' wilik i koq ko chupaam. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh paruwuuq q'iij reh i peet poh naa aye'em taq amayiij pahqb'al kuyb'al reh i ru mahk awach i xmahkunik chi ma' reht'al, oon xaxraaj chi xmahkunik. Ruuk' i re' naa taq asaqb'isam paam i nupaat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh chupaam i kajlaj rub'eeh i peet poh naa taq atoq'aam ninq'iij taq i na a'n ruum taq aweliik chaloq Egipto. Wuquub' q'iij taq naa ak'uxum i kaxlanwi'k ma' kojooj ta ch'amb'esb'al reh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh chupaam i q'iij re' re', re' ajaab'ees naa ruq'asam chi mayiij jinaj imas wakax chi pahqb'al kuyb'al ru mahk i reh, eh pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk chu'nchel i tinamit Israel. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chuwach i wuquub' q'iij chi ninq'iij, re' ajaab'ees ju'jun imas wakax naa ruye'em chi k'atoj mayiij rajlaal q'iij, eh ju'jun i tentzun naa ruq'asam chi k'atoj mayiij chi nuwach i hin, eh ju'jun kaprax naa ruq'asam chi mayiij chuwach i wuquub' q'iij re' ruuk' manlik wach i kiti'jolal pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' ju'jun chi chikop naa ruye'em chi mayiij naa ruye'em haa' juninaq nimaq lemeta chi naq wach trigo, eh naa ruye'em haa' i k'isiin ma' kijib' nimaq lemeta chi aseite. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh noq naa rub'aan i wuquub' q'iij chi ninq'iij chi riij i rukorjiik i kok' paat, i naa rutohq'iik chupaam i ho'lajuuj rub'eeh i ruwuuq poh. Re' i ajaab'ees je' wo' re' k'ihaal i chikop naa ruye'em chi mayiij pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk, je' wo' re' k'ihaal i mayiij chi naq'wach, je' wo' re' k'ihaal aseite naa ruye'em chi mayiij, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' i puerta wilik i koq chupaam inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij naa rutz'ahpiik chuwach i waqiib' q'iij paruq'ijil kamanik. Xa re' wo' naa rutehiik chupaam i hi'limb'al q'iij, eh noq naa runinq'ijiik i ak' poh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' ajaab'ees naa rokiik i koq chi chii' puerta wilik reje chi' paat. Ar naa rupab'aam riib' wach i ruche'el i puerta noq re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij naa kiq'asam i k'atoj mayiij, eh i mayiij k'amb'al keh panotob'il wuuk' i hin, hin Dios. Eh chii' puerta naa kinkiloq'em pankomonil, eh naa wo' chik keliik cho ar xa re' la' koxq'eq naakitz'apam i puerta. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit naa kinkiloq'em chi chii' i puerta re' re' chupaam i hi'limb'al q'iij, eh noq naakininq'ijeem i ak' poh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh panhi'limb'al q'iij i ajaab'ees waqiib' rak'uun tentzun naa ruk'atam chi rumayiij, eh jinaj imas tentzun re' ruuk' taqe i manlik wach kiti'jolal. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chi ruk'uliil i ju'jun chi imas tentzun juninaq nimaq lemeta chi naq'wach i tik naa ruye'em. Eh chi k'uliil i rak'uun tentzun xanik' pa' nimaal i neenchalik paruk'ux. Eh chi k'uliil i juninaq chi nimaq lemeta i wach i tik naa ruye'em i k'isiin ma' kijib' nimaq lemeta chi aseite. <verse number="6" style="v" />Noq naa taq aninq'ijeem i ak' poh re' ajaab'ees naa ruq'asam chi mayiij i k'isa imas wakax, waqiib' i kok' tentzun, jinaj imas tentzun, manlik wach i kiti'jolal. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh noq naa ruye'em chi rumayiij i k'isa imas wakax, naa ruye'em haa' i juninaq lemeta chi naq wach i tik, je' wo' re' k'ihaal i naa ruye'em haa' ruuk' taqe i ju'jun chi imas tentzun. Eh re' i naa ruye'em haa' ruuk' taqe i kok' tentzun nik' pa' k'ihaal i neenb'aan ruye'ariik, naa ruye'em haa' i k'isiin ma' kijib' nimaq lemeta chi aseite. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' i ajab'ees ar naa rokiik i koq chupaam i b'eeh wilik chucheel i puerta, eh ar wo' chik nareliik chaloq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh noq naa rub'aan i ninq'iij, re' i tinamit naa kokiik chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, ar chik naakeliik reje chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. Re' taqe i naa kokiik i koq chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij, ar chik naakeliik reje chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. Ma' ar ta chik naakeliik chaloq aha' naa kokiik i koq. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' i ajaab'ees ar wo' naa rokiik i naa kokiik wii' tinamit, ar wo' naa reliik naakeliik wii' i tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chupaam taqe i chi ninq'iij naa ruye'ariik chi mayiij i juninaq nimaq lemeta chi naq'wach i tik, chi kik'uliil i ju'jun chi imas wakax, eh je' wo' re' k'ihaal i naa ruye'ariik chi ruk'uliil i ju'jun chi imas tentzun. Eh re' i ju'jun chi kok' tentzun xanik' pa' k'ihaal i neenb'aan ruye'ariik. Eh re' i juninaq nimaq lemeta chi naq'wach i tik, naa ruye'ariik chi ruk'uliil i k'isiin ma' kijib' nimaq lemeta i aseite. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh noq re' ajaab'ees xanaa ruchaliik paruk'ux chi naa ruye'em jino'q i k'atoj chikop chi mayiij, oon jino'q i mayiij k'amb'al taq aweh panotob'il wuuk' i hin, hin Dios, neenteh i puerta inilwik reje parelb'aal q'iij, neeruq'asaj i rumayiij chi je' rukab' i rub'an pan hi'limb'al q'iij. Eh noq elinaq chik ar naa wo' chik rutz'ahpiik i puerta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' ajaab'ees re' re' rajlaal q'iij naa ruq'asam chi rumayiij i ju'jun chi kok' tentzun ju'jun haab' i wilik keh manlik wach i kiti'jolal, reh chi neenk'atarik chi mayiij chi nuwach i hin. <verse number="14" style="v" />Raaj laal wahq'eq wuquub' nimaq lemeta chi naq'wach tik naa taq aye'em chi amayiij chi nuwach i hin. Eh jinaj lemeta chi aseite taq i naa ajalk'iim chinaah i ke'emaj trigo, re' taqe i mayiij re' re' xti koruman chi naa rub'aan. <verse number="15" style="v" />Noq naa taq aq'asam chi k'atoj mayiij i tentzun komanaan, je' wo' taq i amayiij chi naq'wach taq atik, ruch'ihil i aseite pantaq wahq'eq taq naa aq'asam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh wila' re' i ajaab'ees xusiij rak'aal i rak'uun, eh re' i rak'uun, reh wo' chik taqe i rak'uun rixq'uun nee rukanaa' i reh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh wila' re' ajaab'ees xuyeew rak'aal jino'q i rumoso, xa re' wo' reh noq k'ahchi' chi kamanik ruuk', eh noq naa wo' chik rumayam i kamanik ruuk' naa wo' chik ruq'asam reh i ajaab'ees. Xa re' wo' ak'al naa ruye'em keh i rak'uun rixq'uun naa rukahniik chi keh chi jumpech. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' reey i ruk'ul chi naa ruye'em kak'aal i rak'uun rixq'uun, xa re' la' re' ruuk' i rak'aal i reh naa ruye'em keh ma' naa ta ruq'uchum i kak'aal i nutinamiit. Reh chi ma' naa ta chik kielik reje pan kiye'aab' i nutinamiit, inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i paat inch'aq wii' i mayiij wilik i koq ruuk' i rupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' winaq xwil wach xiruk'am b'ila' reje chupaam i ookb'al wilik chucheel i puerta, eh xiruk'am i koq chupaam i kok' paat wilkeeb' reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij re' i kuxisamaj chik i kiye'aab' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. Eh xuk'uhtaaj weh jinaj i ye'aab' wilik reje parookb'aal i q'iij chi riij i paat. <verse number="20" style="v" />Je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij chupaam i paat wili naakichaq'sam i chikop naa kiq'asam chi mayiij, pahqb'al kuyb'al mahk. Ayu' wo' naakik'ilem inaq'wach i tik reh chi ma' nee ta nelik cho riij paat taqe i mayiij re' re'. Eh ma' naa ta kitz'a'am i tinamit ruum wilik rusantohiil, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh xiresaj wo' chik reje riij paat, eh xiruk'am reje chupaam i kajtz'u'k reh i tehlik chii' paat. Eh chupaam taqe i ju'jun chi rutz'ukaal wilik i ju'jun chi tehlik, je' rukab' i chi' paat. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i tehlik reje chii' paat eliik wach kininqaal kikajcheel i juninaq b'ara runimaal kooq ho'lajuuj b'ara runimaal kiwach. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh kotimaj kiij chi tz'aq chi kiju'junaal, eh paraa' taqe i ju'jun chi tz'aq wilik taqe i luk'b'al q'aaq'. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh re' winaq je' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh aj tiij chupaam taqe i ye'aab' wili naa kiq'asam i naa kik'amam cho chi kimayiij i tinamit, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ha' inaasjik cho parupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' winaq xiruk'am b'ila' wo' chik reje chi chii' i rupaat i Dios. Eh xwilow chi jinaj i ha' inaasjik chaloq chi ri'sil i puerta xb'ehik chik reje rooq chi korkiil ireelb'aalq'iij, re' inilwik reje wii' i rupaat i Dios. Ar xqajik reje pansak'aaj reh i rupaat i Dios, pansak'aaj reje reh i artaal. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xiresaj chaloq i wilik wii' i rupaat i Dios, ar xiresaj cho chi chii' i puerta inilwik reje pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij. Ko ar xponik qakotej imb'aan wii' okik chi riij wilik reje parelb'aal q'iij. Eh inwilow jinaj wo' chik i k'isa ha' inaasjik chaloq pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' i winaq xooj b'ila' chik reje chi korkiil ireelb'aali q'iij jinaj i pajb'al k'ahaam ruyohq'eem, xupaj reje i hoob' siento b'ara, eh xirik'saj reje chupaam i rooq ha', xa ralaq wooq xponik i ruchamiil. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' chik reje i hoob' siento b'ara, eh xirik'saj reje chupaam i rooq ha' nah nuch'ehk xponik i ruchamiil. Eh xupaj wo' chik reje i hoob' siento b'ara, eh xirik'saj reje chupaam i rooq ha', konah nutuuq xponik i ruchamiil. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh xupaj wo' chik reje i hoob' siento b'ara. Eh inwilow i rooq ha' xsutinik chi qaman nim ha' xiik' naah chamiil, ma' xnub'an ta chik ik'ik chupaam, xa pamux chik neemb'aan ik'ik chupaam. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' winaq je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Chakoj rehtaal chi korik aha' wilik taqe i xawilow, inki. Eh xirusutej wo' chik chaloq chi chii' i rooq ha'. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh xwilow wo' hoq chi k'ultar chi chii' i rooq ha' re' re' ma' k'isiin taqe i chee' wilkeeb' ar. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' winaq je' b'ila' wili i xuq'or weh: Re' rooq ha' wili ar ojik i rub'an parelb'aal q'iij inik'ik taqe ponoq paruyuq'ul Arabá, imponik chupaam i kamnaq palaw. Eh noq re' ha' wili inokik ar inkahnik chi holohik xasaq chik wach i ruha'iil. <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu'nchel i chikop naa kiwihiik chupaam i nim ha' wili naa ruwihiik kik'achariik, eh ma' k'isiin i kar naa kiwihiik chupaam i palaw naa rokiik wii' i rooq ha' wili. Naa ruwihiik kik'achariik chu'nchel i chikop naa kiwihiik chupaam i nim ha' wili. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chi chii' i palaw re' re' naa kiwihiik i aj karineel ar naa kitoq'aam reje En-gadi naakiponiik En-eglaim, ar naakichiqsam wach i kiya'l chopb'al kar. Eh ma' k'isiin i kar naa kiwihiik ar xata wo' jar b'uhr kiwach je' rukab' i wilkeeb' chupaam i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe i tuhqel ha', eh re' taqe i ch'uwa' paam ye'aab' ma' naa ta rusaqb'iik kiwach naa la' kikahnik chi ehteesb'al aatz'aam. <verse number="12" style="v" />K'ul chi chii' chi ju'juntar i nim ha' wili naakik'iik taqe i chee' ink'uxarik i wach, ma' naa ta ruq'ehb'iik i kixaq, ma' naa ta kimayam wachinik chi jumpech rajlaal poh naa kiwachiniik. Ruum re' i naa rut'aqsanik keh re' i rooq ha' naa resjiik cho parupaat i Dios. Eh re' i naakiwachum naa rukamaniik chi k'uxumb'al, eh re' i kixaq naa rukahniik chi iq'oom, inki.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i k'ula't reh i kiye'aab' i tinamit Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i QaJaaw Dios je' wili i xuq'or: Re' taqe i wili i k'ula't reh i tinamit naakik'ulum chi kikooch i kab'laj chuq chi aj Israel. Re' taqe i riih rumaam i José ka'seht i naakik'ulum. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' hin xnuq'or chee xti korik keh taq aamaam awati't chi naa nuye'em keh i ye'aab' wili. Je' re' noq naa ach'aqam keh eliik wach ninqaal i naa aye'em keh i ju'jun ch'uq. Re' wili naa rukahniik chi kikooch.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Je' wili nimaal rooq pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij ar naa rutoq'aam reje chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, naa rik'iik ponoq chi chii' i tinamit Hetlón, je' wo' chi chii' taqe i tinamit Sedad. <verse number="16" style="v" />Naa rik'iik reje chi chii' i Hamat, eh chi chii' i Berota, chi chii' Sibraim, re' taqe i ye'aab' wilkeeb' pank'ula't ruuk' Damasco, re' i Hamat, je' wo' hoq i Hazar-haticon, wilkeeb' pank'ula't ruuk' i Haurán. <verse number="17" style="v" />Je' re' nimaal rooq pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal i q'iij ar naa rutohq'iik reje chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo, eh naa ruponiik kopan k'ula't ruuk' Hazar-enán. Ar naa rukahniik pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij reh i tinamit Damasco, i tinamit Hamat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' ye'aab' parelb'aal i q'iij naa rutohq'iik reje pank'ula't ruuk' i ye'aab' Haurán, ruuk' i Damasco, konaa ruponiik chi chii' i tinamit Tamar chi chii' i kamnaq palaw, i runimaal rooq i nim ha' Jordán. Eh naa rukahniik chi k'ula't ruuk' i tinamiit Galaad, ruuk' i tinamit Israel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' i runimaal rooq i ye'aab' pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij, naa rutohq'iik reje chi chii' i ye'aab' Tamar, naa rik'iik ponoq chi chii' i nim ha' Meriba-cades, inchalik Egipto, naa ruponiik chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. Je' re' nimaal i naa rub'anam reje pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' i runimaal i ye'aab' parookb'aal reje i q'iij ar nareliik chaloq chi chii' i nimlaj palaw Mediterráneo, naa ruponiik pank'ula't reh i Egipto, eh panookb'al reh i Hamat i runimaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' aj re' i ye'aab' wili naakich'aqam chikiwach i kab'laj ch'uq chi aj Israel. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' wili naa rukahniik taq chi akooch, eh noq naa taq ach'aqam chawach i ye'aab' re' re' naa wo' aye'em taq keh i tokoom tinamit wilkeeb' taq chaxilak i wilik chik kak'uun kixq'uun. Naa taq akojom chi je' cho panatinamiit Israel xi-aasjik, eh naa wo' kikahnik chi awuch aj Israel taqe. <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh aha' pa' taq naa awihiik i hat chach'uhqal, wila' wilik taqe i tokoom tinamit taq chaxilak ar wo' naa taq aye'em kiye'aab', inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' wili i kib'ihnaal i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel naa kiwihiik pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal q'iij, naa reliik reje Hetlón, naa ruponiik Hamat, je' wo' ar Hazar-enán, eh ar i Damasco. Eh pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij ar Hamat naakik'ulum i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Dan. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam i Dan naa kikahniik i riih rumaam i Aser. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Aser i naa kikahniik i riih rumaam i Neftalí. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Neftalí naa kikahniik i riih rumaam Manasés. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Manasés naa kikahniik i riih rumaam Efraín. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Efraín, naa kikahniik i riih rumaam Rubén. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Rubén naa kikahniik i riih rumaam i Judá. Eh re' i kiye'aab' i ju'jun ch'uq re' re' naa rutohq'iik reje chi korkiil ireelb'aalq'iij, naa ruponiik chi chii' palaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chucheel chi kiye'aab' i riih rumaam Judá naa rukahniik i chi ye'aab' reh i rupaat i Dios, naa rutohq'iik reje chi korkiil ireelb'aalq'iij, naa ruponiik chi chii' i palaw. Eh kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal wach, re' i runimaal rooq eliik wach ruuk' i naakik'ulum i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. Eh re' i rupaat i Dios panyejaal i ye'aab' re' re' naa rukahniik, inki. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh je' wo' chik wili i xuq'or weh: Re' i ye'aab' naa rukahniik chi reh i QaJaaw Dios kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh lajeeb' miil b'ara runimaal wach. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' wilik naa rukahniik chi kiye'aab' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. Pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij ruch'ihil i pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij naa apajam kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal. Eh pareelb'aal q'iij ruch'ihil i rookb'aal q'iij naa apajam i hoob' miil b'ara, eh panyejaal i ye'aab' re' re' naa ruwihiik i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh naa akanaam chi keh i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Sadoc. Re' taqe i xib'anik reh i nukamaj noq xin kiq'eb' i aj Israel, eh ma' xkiq'eb' ta kiib' i keh je' rukab' i xkian i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Leví. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij ar naa kiwihiik chupaam i ye'aab' wilik rusantohiil, kanamaj chi keh, chucheel reje i kiye'aab' riih rumaam Leví. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i kiye'aab' i aj Levíta naa rukahniik chucheel i kiye'aab' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij junch'uq, kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara rooq, eh hoob' miil b'ara runimaal wach. Eh re' i naa rukahniik chi ruye'aab' i Dios, kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh lajeeb' miil b'ara runimaal wach. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' ye'aab' re' re' q'e' holohik, ma' naa ta rub'anam chi naa kik'ayem k'isinoq, oon chi neenkijal wach. Eh ni xata neenkikanaa' reh i awach keh, ruum naa ruq'ahteesjiik reh i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i ruqox i ye'aab' kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal rooq, eh kiib' miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal wach, ma' naa ta ruwihiik rusantohiil, ar neekik'acharik i tinamit, naa wo' ruwihiik i k'im ar, kiwa' i chikop, eh panyejaal i naa ruwihiik i tinamit. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i naa rokiik wii' i tinamit kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento b'ara ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara chi ju'juntar, eliik wach i runimaal rooq ruuk' i runimaal wach. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh chi junsuut i tinamit re' re' naa ruwihiik i k'im kiwa' taqe i chikop jinaj siento ruuk' hoob' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal wach chi ju'juntar. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh chi junsuut i tinamit naa ruwihiik jinaj i ye'aab', chucheel i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik rusantohiil hoob' miil b'ara runimaal rooq chi korkiil reje i reelb'aal i q'iij, je' wo' re' nimaal chi korkiil reje i rookb'aal i q'iij. Re' i ye'aab' naa rutikariik paam ruuk' i re' naa kik'uxlaam kiib' taqe i naakikamaniik pan tinamit. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' i naakikamaniik pan tinamit, ar naa kichaliik chupaam i ju'jun ch'uq chi tinamit Israel. Re' keh naakitikwiik paam i ye'aab' re' re'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh re' runimaal chu'nchel i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik rusantohiil naa ruye'ariik reh i QaJaaw Dios ruch'ihil i naa ruye'ariik chi ye'aab' tinamit kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara wilik reh chi ju'juntar.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu'nchel i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik rusantohiil naa ruye'ariik chi reh i QaJaaw Dios ruch'ihil i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik wii' i tinamit naa ruye'ariik reh i reey, ar naa reliik chaloq chi korkiil i reelb'aal i q'iij, naa rumponiik chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij, naa wo' ruponiik ko chi chii' i palaw. Kab'laj miil ruuk' hoob' siento b'ara runimaal wach, eh je' wo' re' i runimaal i rooq. Eh panyejaal i ye'aab' re' re' naa ruwihiik i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' i ye'aab' naa ruwihiik chucheel i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Leví, ruch'ihil i naa ruwihiik wii' i tinamit naa rukahniik chi reh i aajaab'ees. Eh re' i ye'aab' re' re' chucheel i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Judá, eh chucheel wo' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam Benjamín.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh re' chik taqe i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij naakik'ulum i kiye'aab'. Ar wo' naakik'ulum i kiye'aab' taqe i riih rumaam Benjamín. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam i Benjamín, naa kikahniik riih rumaam i Simeón. <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam i Simeón naa kikahniik i riih rumaam i Isacar. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam i Isacar, naa kikahniik i riih rumaam Zabulón. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh chucheel i riih rumaam Zabulón naa kikahniik i riih rumaam i Gad. Re' kiye'aab' ju'jun ch'uq re' re' naa rutohq'iik reje chi korkiil i reelb'aal q'iij, naa ruponiik ko chi chii' i palaw. <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij naakik'ulum wii' i kiye'aab' i riih rumaam i Gad ar naa rutohq'iik reje Tamar, naa rik'iik chi chii' i nim ha' Cades, chi chii' i nim ha' i inchalik Egipto, naa ruponiik chi chii' i palaw Mediterráneo. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taqe i ye'aab' re' re' naa taq ach'aqam keh i kab'laj ch'uq chi aj Israel, Nik' wach i xnuq'or taq aweh je' re' i rub'aan taq naa a'nam, inki i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i ru puertahiil i tinamit Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' i tinamit naa rukootjiik riij chi tz'aq. Re' i runimaal wach pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento b'ara ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara naa ruye'ariik reh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh pantz'eet reh i rookb'aal q'iij ixib' i ru puertahiil naa rokiik. Re' i ju'jun chi puerta re' i rub'ihnaal i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel naa ruk'amam. Re' peet puerta Rubén i rub'ihnaal, re' i rukab' puerta Judá, re' i roox puerta Leví. <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh chi korkiil ireelb'aalq'iij kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento b'ara ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara i naa ruye'ariik reh. Eh ixib' wo' i ru puertahiil naa rokiik. Re' i peet puerta José i rub'ihnaal, re' i rukab' puerta Benjamín, re' i roox puerta Dan. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh pansak'aaj reh i rookb'aal i q'iij kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento b'ara ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara i naa ruye'ariik reh. Eh ixib' wo' ru puertahiil naa rokiik re' peet puerta Simeón i rub'ihnaal, re' i rukab' puerta Isacar, re' roox puerta Zabulón. <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh chi korkiil i rookb'aal q'iij kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento b'ara ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl b'ara naa ruye'ariik reh i tz'aq. Eh ixib' wo' ru puertahiil naa rokiik. Re' i peet puerta Gad i rub'ihnaal, re' i rukab' puerta Aser, re' roox puerta Neftalí. <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' i tz'aq naa rukootjiik wii' riij i tinamit b'elejeeb' miil b'ara i runimaal chu'nchel. Eh chupaam taqe i q'iij re' re' je' wili i naa rubíhnaam i tinamit re' re': Re' i QaJaaw Dios wilik ayu', tiko'q keh, inki weh.</para>
</usx>